b4: $ H , h = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , i ∊ dt u M c w q ∧ i ∊ u ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ n , ⟨ p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) ∧ h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ u $ by and_elim_l [b3]
b5: $ H , h = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , i ∊ dt u M c w q ∧ i ∊ u ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ n , ⟨ p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) ∧ h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ m , ⟨ n , ⟨ p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) ∧ h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [b3]
b6: $ H , h = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , i ∊ dt u M c w q ∧ i ∊ u ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ n , ⟨ p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) ∧ h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ m , ⟨ n , ⟨ p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) $ by and_elim_l [b5]
