b8: $ H , h = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , i ∊ dt u M c w q ∧ i ∊ u ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ n , ⟨ p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) ∧ h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ h = ⟨ x , v ⟩ $ by ax
b9: $ H , h = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , i ∊ dt u M c w q ∧ i ∊ u ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ n , ⟨ p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) ∧ h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x , v ⟩ = h $ by eq_sym [b8]
b10: $ H , h = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , i ∊ dt u M c w q ∧ i ∊ u ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ n , ⟨ p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) ∧ h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x , v ⟩ = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [b9, b7]
