b15: $ H , h = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , i ∊ dt u M c w q ∧ i ∊ u ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ n , ⟨ p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) ∧ h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset (csn ⟨ cdm m , i ⟩) $ by csn_set [b14]
