z6: $ G , h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ u ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ n , ⟨ p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) ∧ h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_intro [z2, z5]
z7: $ G , h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ dt u M c w q ∧ i ∊ u ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ n , ⟨ p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) ∧ h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_intro [z1, z6]
z8: $ G , h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ a (i ∊ dt u M c w q ∧ i ∊ u ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ n , ⟨ p , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) ∧ h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_intro [z7]
