z10: $ G , h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i n , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) p , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (i ∊ dt u M c w q ∧ i ∊ u ∧ ⟨ m , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons i q) ∧ h = ⟨ ssnoc m i , ⟨ scons i g , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_intro [z9]
