y2a: $ G ⇒ {y | ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ dt u M c w q ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d w (scons x q) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) c w q) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} = etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons c (scons d ∅) ⟩ w q $ by eq_sym [a1]
