o1: $ G , h ⊆ {y | ∃ x ∃ z (∃ v (⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) f w q) ∧ y = nest x z)} ∧ ∀ x (∃ v (⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) f w q) → apn h x ∈ N) , r ∊ h , ⟨ i , p ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) f w q , r = nest i j ⇒ d ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [g2]
