o6: $ G , h ⊆ {y | ∃ x ∃ z (∃ v (⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) f w q) ∧ y = nest x z)} ∧ ∀ x (∃ v (⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) f w q) → apn h x ∈ N) , r ∊ h , ⟨ i , p ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) f w q , r = nest i j ⇒ r ∊ clam o (dt u M d w q) (⋃ (dt u M b w (scons o q))) $ by b3_pip_elim [o1, o2, o3, o4, o5f, n12]
