p6b: $ G , f = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x4 ∧ ra_isort x6 x7 x4 ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ fseq u ⇒ x7 = x7 $ by eq_refl
p6c: $ G , f = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x4 ∧ ra_isort x6 x7 x4 ∈ lrel , x8 ∊ fseq u ⇒ ra_isort x6 x7 x4 = ra_isort x6 x7 l $ by ra_isort_eq [p6a, p6b, p6]
