l1: $ G ⇒ ∃ i ∃ j (⟨ J , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ⟩ ∈ itc u E D W ∧ ((iprop D J W ∧ r = nest i ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D J W ∧ r = nest i j))) $ by cab_elim [#2]
