s11: $ G , r = nest m e , r ∊ itriv u E D J w , iprt D p t , ityf D J f , q ∊ esat u E p w , ⟨ x , ⟨ g , ⟨ o , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E f w q , (iprop D J w ∧ r = nest (scat x q) ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D J w ∧ r = nest (scat x q) (scons ∅ ∅)) , iprop D J w ∧ r = nest (scat x q) ∅ ⇒ m = scat x q ∧ e = ∅ $ by nest_inj_c [s6, s7, s8, s5, s9, s10]
