g8: $ (⟨ j , ⟨ scat x C , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A) ⟺ (⟨ j , ⟨ scat x D , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B) $ by wcel_congr [g7, #1]
g9: $ (x ∊ fseq (crn x) ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x C , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A) ⟺ (x ∊ fseq (crn x) ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x D , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B) $ by and_congr [g1, g8]
g10: $ ∃ x (x ∊ fseq (crn x) ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x C , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A) ⟺ ∃ x (x ∊ fseq (crn x) ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x D , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B) $ by ex_congr [g9]
g11: $ ∃ j ∃ x (x ∊ fseq (crn x) ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x C , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A) ⟺ ∃ j ∃ x (x ∊ fseq (crn x) ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x D , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B) $ by ex_congr [g10]
g12: $ ixv A C ≐ ixv B D $ by cab_congr [g11]

