p2: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , isset X , x9 = X ⇒ A = a $ by weaken [k4]
p3: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , isset X , x9 = X ⇒ ⟨ A , X ⟩ = ⟨ a , x9 ⟩ $ by opair_eq [p2, p1]
p4: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , isset X , x9 = X ⇒ J = j $ by weaken [k2]
p5: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , isset X , x9 = X ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ A , X ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x9 ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [p4, p3]
p6: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , isset X , x9 = X ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ A , X ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by weaken [k5]
p7: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , isset X , x9 = X ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x9 ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by wcel_eq_l [p5, p6]
p8: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , isset X , x9 = X ⇒ ∃ x (⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z) $ by ex_intro [p7]
p9: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , isset X ⇒ isset X $ by ax
p10: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , isset X ⇒ ∃ x (⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z) $ by isset_elim [p9, p8]
