q3: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ¬ isset X ⇒ ⟨ A , A ⟩ = ⟨ a , a ⟩ $ by opair_eq [q2, q2]
q4: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ¬ isset X ⇒ ⟨ A , X ⟩ = ⟨ a , a ⟩ $ by eq_trans [q1, q3]
q5: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ¬ isset X ⇒ J = j $ by weaken [k2]
q6: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ¬ isset X ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ A , X ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , a ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [q5, q4]
q7: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ¬ isset X ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ A , X ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by weaken [k5]
q8: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ¬ isset X ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by wcel_eq_l [q6, q7]
q9: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ¬ isset X ⇒ ∃ x (⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z) $ by ex_intro [q8]
r0: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset X ∨ ¬ isset X $ by excluded_middle
r1: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ x (⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z) $ by or_elim [r0, p10, q9]
s0: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by ax
s1: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ y ∊ S $ by ax
s2: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
s3: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ y = Y $ by ax
s4: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ Y = y $ by eq_sym [s3]
s5: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ A = a $ by weaken [k4]
s6: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ ⟨ A , Y ⟩ = ⟨ a , y ⟩ $ by opair_eq [s5, s4]
s7: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ J = j $ by weaken [k2]
