s9: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [s2, s8]
s10: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ z ∊ isup Z S $ by b4_isup_in [s0, s1, s9]
