s12: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
s13: $ G , j = J , a = A , y = Y , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ A , Y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ isup Z S $ by wcel_intro [s12, s11]
