f2: $ H , ∃ a ∃ x ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ∧ y ∊ S ∧ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ c0 $ by ex_elim [e2, f3]
f1: $ G , H ⇒ c0 $ by ex_elim [l1, f2]

lemma b4_ixv_intro_c (G: hyps) (Z Q J X Y: class): $ G ⇒ isset J $ > $ G ⇒ isset Y $ > $ G ⇒ X ∈ fseq (crn X) $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ scat X Q , Y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ > $ G ⇒ Y ∈ ixv Z Q $
----
k1: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ x = X $ by ax
k2: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ X = x $ by eq_sym [k1]
k3: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ crn X = crn x $ by crn_eq [k2]
k4: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ fseq (crn X) = fseq (crn x) $ by fseq_eq [k3]
k5: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ x ∊ fseq (crn X) $ by ax
k6: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ x ∊ fseq (crn x) $ by welc_eq [k4, k5]
k7: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ Q = Q $ by eq_refl
k8: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ scat X Q = scat x Q $ by scat_eq [k2, k7]
k9a: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ y = Y $ by ax
k9: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ Y = y $ by eq_sym [k9a]
k10: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ ⟨ scat X Q , Y ⟩ = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ $ by opair_eq [k8, k9]
k11a: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ j = J $ by ax
k11: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ J = j $ by eq_sym [k11a]
k12: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ scat X Q , Y ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [k11, k10]
k13: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ scat X Q , Y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by weaken [#4]
k14: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by wcel_eq_l [k12, k13]
k15: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ x ∊ fseq (crn x) ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by and_intro [k6, k14]
k16: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ ∃ x1 (x1 ∊ fseq (crn x1) ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x1 Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z) $ by ex_intro [k15]
k17: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ ∃ x0 ∃ x1 (x1 ∊ fseq (crn x1) ∧ ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x1 Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z) $ by ex_intro [k16]
k18: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ y ∊ ixv Z Q $ by cab_intro [k17]
k19: $ G , j = J , y = Y , x = X , x ∊ fseq (crn X) ⇒ Y ∈ ixv Z Q $ by wcel_intro [k9a, k18]
d1: $ G , j = J , y = Y ⇒ Y ∈ ixv Z Q $ by wcel_elim [#3, k19]
d2: $ G , j = J ⇒ Y ∈ ixv Z Q $ by isset_elim [#2, d1]
d3: $ G ⇒ Y ∈ ixv Z Q $ by isset_elim [#1, d2]

