l2: $ H , x ∊ fseq (crn x) ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ c0 $ by b4_and2 [#2]
e2: $ H , ∃ x (x ∊ fseq (crn x) ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z) ⇒ ∃ x (x ∊ fseq (crn x) ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z) $ by ax
f2: $ H , ∃ x (x ∊ fseq (crn x) ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z) ⇒ c0 $ by ex_elim [e2, l2]
f1: $ G , H ⇒ c0 $ by ex_elim [l1, f2]

isup_mono
---------
s1: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S ⇒ z ∊ isup Z S $ by ax
c1: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by ax
c0: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ Z ⊆ Z2 $ by weaken [#1]
c2: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z2 $ by wcel_subset [c0, c1]
c3: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ S $ by ax
c4: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ S ⊆ S2 $ by weaken [#2]
c5: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ S2 $ by subset_elim [c4, c3]
c6: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
c7: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ isup Z2 S2 $ by b4_isup_in [c2, c5, c6]
s2: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S ⇒ z ∊ isup Z2 S2 $ by isup_elim [s1, c7]
s3: $ G ⇒ isup Z S ⊆ isup Z2 S2 $ by subset_intro [s2]

isup_sub
--------
s1: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S ⇒ z ∊ isup Z S $ by ax
c1: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by ax
c0: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ Z ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by weaken [#1]
c2: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by wcel_subset [c0, c1]
c3: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset ⟨ a , x ⟩ $ by opair_isset
c3a: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j = j $ by eq_refl
c3b: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset j $ by isset_intro [c3a]
c4: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∈ ω ∧ ⟨ a , x ⟩ ∈ fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u) $ by cxp_elim_pair_c [c2, c3b, c3]
c5: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∈ ω $ by and_elim_l [c4]
c6: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , x ⟩ ∈ fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u) $ by and_elim_r [c4]
c7: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ a ∊ fseq u ∧ x ∊ fseq (ω ∪ u) $ by cxp_elim_pair [c6]
c8: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ by and_elim_l [c7]
c9: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ S $ by ax
c9a: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ S ⊆ fseq (ω ∪ u) $ by weaken [#2]
c10: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ fseq (ω ∪ u) $ by subset_elim [c9a, c9]
c11: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , y ⟩ ∈ fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u) $ by cxp_intro [c8, c10]
c12: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by cxp_intro_c [c5, c11]
c13: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
c14: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [c13]
c15: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by wcel_eq_l [c14, c12]
c16: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by wcel_welc [c15]
s2: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S ⇒ z ∊ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by isup_elim [s1, c16]
s3: $ G ⇒ isup Z S ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by subset_intro [s2]

lemma b4_cdm_u (G: hyps) (U Z: class): $ G ⇒ universe U $ > $ G ⇒ Z ∈ U $ > $ G ⇒ cdm Z ∈ U $
----
l0: $ G , v = Z , v ∊ U ⇒ universe U $ by weaken [#1]
l1: $ G , v = Z , v ∊ U ⇒ v ∊ U $ by ax
l2: $ G , v = Z , v ∊ U ⇒ cdm v ∈ U $ by universe_cdm [l0, l1]
l3: $ G , v = Z , v ∊ U ⇒ v = Z $ by ax
l4: $ G , v = Z , v ∊ U ⇒ cdm v = cdm Z $ by cdm_eq [l3]
l5: $ G , v = Z , v ∊ U ⇒ cdm Z ∈ U $ by wcel_eq_l [l4, l2]
l6: $ G ⇒ cdm Z ∈ U $ by wcel_elim [#2, l5]

lemma b4_crn_u (G: hyps) (U Z: class): $ G ⇒ universe U $ > $ G ⇒ Z ∈ U $ > $ G ⇒ crn Z ∈ U $
----
l0: $ G , v = Z , v ∊ U ⇒ universe U $ by weaken [#1]
l1: $ G , v = Z , v ∊ U ⇒ v ∊ U $ by ax
l2: $ G , v = Z , v ∊ U ⇒ crn v ∈ U $ by universe_crn [l0, l1]
l3: $ G , v = Z , v ∊ U ⇒ v = Z $ by ax
l4: $ G , v = Z , v ∊ U ⇒ crn v = crn Z $ by crn_eq [l3]
l5: $ G , v = Z , v ∊ U ⇒ crn Z ∈ U $ by wcel_eq_l [l4, l2]
l6: $ G ⇒ crn Z ∈ U $ by wcel_elim [#2, l5]

lemma b4_cdm_c (G: hyps) (R B: class) (a: set): $ G ⇒ isset B $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , B ⟩ ∈ R $ > $ G ⇒ a ∊ cdm R $
----
l1: $ G , v = B ⇒ v = B $ by ax
l2: $ G , v = B ⇒ B = v $ by eq_sym [l1]
l3: $ G , v = B ⇒ a = a $ by eq_refl
l4: $ G , v = B ⇒ ⟨ a , B ⟩ = ⟨ a , v ⟩ $ by opair_eq [l3, l2]
l5: $ G , v = B ⇒ ⟨ a , B ⟩ ∈ R $ by weaken [#2]
l6: $ G , v = B ⇒ ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ R $ by wcel_eq_l [l4, l5]
l7: $ G , v = B ⇒ a ∊ cdm R $ by cdm_intro [l6]
l8: $ G ⇒ a ∊ cdm R $ by isset_elim [#1, l7]

lemma b4_crn_c (G: hyps) (R B: class) (a: set): $ G ⇒ isset B $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , B ⟩ ∈ R $ > $ G ⇒ B ∈ crn R $
----
l1: $ G , v = B ⇒ v = B $ by ax
l2: $ G , v = B ⇒ B = v $ by eq_sym [l1]
l3: $ G , v = B ⇒ a = a $ by eq_refl
l4: $ G , v = B ⇒ ⟨ a , B ⟩ = ⟨ a , v ⟩ $ by opair_eq [l3, l2]
l5: $ G , v = B ⇒ ⟨ a , B ⟩ ∈ R $ by weaken [#2]
l6: $ G , v = B ⇒ ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ R $ by wcel_eq_l [l4, l5]
l7: $ G , v = B ⇒ v ∊ crn R $ by crn_intro [l6]
l8: $ G , v = B ⇒ B ∈ crn R $ by wcel_intro [l1, l7]
l9: $ G ⇒ B ∈ crn R $ by isset_elim [#1, l8]

isup_universe
-------------
s1: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S ⇒ z ∊ isup Z S $ by ax
c1: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by ax
c2: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset ⟨ a , x ⟩ $ by opair_isset
c3: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ cdm Z $ by b4_cdm_c [c2, c1]
c4: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , x ⟩ ∈ crn Z $ by b4_crn_c [c2, c1]
c5: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ a ∊ cdm (crn Z) $ by cdm_intro [c4]
c6: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ S $ by ax
c7: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , y ⟩ ∈ cdm (crn Z) × S $ by cxp_intro [c5, c6]
c8: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∈ cdm Z $ by welc_wcel [c3]
c9: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ cdm Z × (cdm (crn Z) × S) $ by cxp_intro_c [c8, c7]
c10: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
c11: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [c10]
c12: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ cdm Z × (cdm (crn Z) × S) $ by wcel_eq_l [c11, c9]
c13: $ G , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ cdm Z × (cdm (crn Z) × S) $ by wcel_welc [c12]
s2: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S ⇒ z ∊ cdm Z × (cdm (crn Z) × S) $ by isup_elim [s1, c13]
s3: $ G ⇒ isup Z S ⊆ cdm Z × (cdm (crn Z) × S) $ by subset_intro [s2]
u1: $ G ⇒ cdm Z ∈ u $ by b4_cdm_u [#1, #2]
u2: $ G ⇒ crn Z ∈ u $ by b4_crn_u [#1, #2]
u3: $ G ⇒ cdm (crn Z) ∈ u $ by b4_cdm_u [#1, u2]
u4: $ G ⇒ cdm (crn Z) × S ∈ u $ by universe_cxp_c [#1, u3, #3]
u5: $ G ⇒ cdm Z × (cdm (crn Z) × S) ∈ u $ by universe_cxp_c [#1, u1, u4]
u6: $ G ⇒ isup Z S ∈ u $ by universe_subset_c [#1, u5, s3]

jval_congr
----------
h1: $ ra_deq g e b a ≐ ra_deq g e b a $ by ceqt_refl
h2: $ (ra_deq g e b a ∈ E) ⟺ (ra_deq g e b a ∈ F) $ by wcel_congr [h1, #3]
h3: $ (w ∊ lvals) ⟺ (w ∊ lvals) $ by iff_refl
hg: $ g ≐ g $ by ceqt_refl
hw: $ w ≐ w $ by ceqt_refl
hr: $ r ≐ r $ by ceqt_refl
he: $ e ≐ e $ by ceqt_refl
hb: $ b ≐ b $ by ceqt_refl
ha: $ a ≐ a $ by ceqt_refl
hs: $ seqt r r $ by seqt_refl
h4: $ sat A C g w ≐ sat B D g w $ by sat_congr [#1, #2, hg, hw]
h5: $ (r ∊ sat A C g w) ⟺ (r ∊ sat B D g w) $ by welc_congr [hs, h4]
h6: $ dt A C e w r ≐ dt B D e w r $ by dt_congr [#1, #2, he, hw, hr]
h7: $ dt A C b w r ≐ dt B D b w r $ by dt_congr [#1, #2, hb, hw, hr]
h8: $ (dt A C e w r = dt A C b w r) ⟺ (dt B D e w r = dt B D b w r) $ by ceq_congr [h6, h7]
h9: $ dt A C a w r ≐ dt B D a w r $ by dt_congr [#1, #2, ha, hw, hr]
h10: $ (dt A C e w r ∈ dt A C a w r) ⟺ (dt B D e w r ∈ dt B D a w r) $ by wcel_congr [h6, h9]
h11: $ (dt A C e w r = dt A C b w r ∧ dt A C e w r ∈ dt A C a w r) ⟺ (dt B D e w r = dt B D b w r ∧ dt B D e w r ∈ dt B D a w r) $ by and_congr [h8, h10]
h12: $ (r ∊ sat A C g w → dt A C e w r = dt A C b w r ∧ dt A C e w r ∈ dt A C a w r) ⟺ (r ∊ sat B D g w → dt B D e w r = dt B D b w r ∧ dt B D e w r ∈ dt B D a w r) $ by im_congr [h5, h11]
h13: $ ∀ r (r ∊ sat A C g w → dt A C e w r = dt A C b w r ∧ dt A C e w r ∈ dt A C a w r) ⟺ ∀ r (r ∊ sat B D g w → dt B D e w r = dt B D b w r ∧ dt B D e w r ∈ dt B D a w r) $ by all_congr [h12]
h14: $ (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat A C g w → dt A C e w r = dt A C b w r ∧ dt A C e w r ∈ dt A C a w r)) ⟺ (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat B D g w → dt B D e w r = dt B D b w r ∧ dt B D e w r ∈ dt B D a w r)) $ by im_congr [h3, h13]
h15: $ ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat A C g w → dt A C e w r = dt A C b w r ∧ dt A C e w r ∈ dt A C a w r)) ⟺ ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat B D g w → dt B D e w r = dt B D b w r ∧ dt B D e w r ∈ dt B D a w r)) $ by all_congr [h14]
h16: $ (ra_deq g e b a ∈ E → ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat A C g w → dt A C e w r = dt A C b w r ∧ dt A C e w r ∈ dt A C a w r))) ⟺ (ra_deq g e b a ∈ F → ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat B D g w → dt B D e w r = dt B D b w r ∧ dt B D e w r ∈ dt B D a w r))) $ by im_congr [h2, h15]
h17: $ ∀ a (ra_deq g e b a ∈ E → ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat A C g w → dt A C e w r = dt A C b w r ∧ dt A C e w r ∈ dt A C a w r))) ⟺ ∀ a (ra_deq g e b a ∈ F → ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat B D g w → dt B D e w r = dt B D b w r ∧ dt B D e w r ∈ dt B D a w r))) $ by all_congr [h16]
h18: $ ∀ b ∀ a (ra_deq g e b a ∈ E → ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat A C g w → dt A C e w r = dt A C b w r ∧ dt A C e w r ∈ dt A C a w r))) ⟺ ∀ b ∀ a (ra_deq g e b a ∈ F → ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat B D g w → dt B D e w r = dt B D b w r ∧ dt B D e w r ∈ dt B D a w r))) $ by all_congr [h17]
h19: $ ∀ e ∀ b ∀ a (ra_deq g e b a ∈ E → ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat A C g w → dt A C e w r = dt A C b w r ∧ dt A C e w r ∈ dt A C a w r))) ⟺ ∀ e ∀ b ∀ a (ra_deq g e b a ∈ F → ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat B D g w → dt B D e w r = dt B D b w r ∧ dt B D e w r ∈ dt B D a w r))) $ by all_congr [h18]
h20: $ jval A C E ⟺ jval B D F $ by all_congr [h19]

sb_f_jval
---------
l1: $ [x/t] (∀ g ∀ e ∀ b ∀ a (ra_deq g e b a ∈ C → ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat A B g w → dt A B e w r = dt A B b w r ∧ dt A B e w r ∈ dt A B a w r)))) ⟺ ∀ g ∀ e ∀ b ∀ a (ra_deq g e b a ∈ (⟦ x / t ⟧ C) → ∀ w (w ∊ lvals → ∀ r (r ∊ sat (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) g w → dt (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) e w r = dt (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) b w r ∧ dt (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) e w r ∈ dt (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) a w r))) $ by iff_refl

iwf_congr
---------
i1: $ uadm A ⟺ uadm B $ by uadm_congr [#1]
i2: $ hty ≐ hty $ by ceqt_refl
i3: $ (hty ⊆ C) ⟺ (hty ⊆ D) $ by subset_congr [i2, #2]
i4: $ functional C ⟺ functional D $ by functional_congr [#2]
i5: $ mcv C ≐ mcv D $ by mcv_congr [#2]
i6: $ jval A (mcv C) E ⟺ jval B (mcv D) F $ by jval_congr [#1, i5, #3]
i7: $ ra_ind_wf H J ≐ ra_ind_wf I K $ by ra_ind_wf_congr [#4, #5]
i8: $ lrel3 E ≐ lrel3 F $ by lrel3_congr [#3]
i9: $ (ra_ind_wf H J ∈ lrel3 E) ⟺ (ra_ind_wf I K ∈ lrel3 F) $ by wcel_congr [i7, i8]
i10: $ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ≐ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind $ by ceqt_refl
i11: $ (J ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind) ⟺ (K ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind) $ by wcel_congr [#5, i10]
i12: $ lvals ≐ lvals $ by ceqt_refl
i13: $ (L ∈ lvals) ⟺ (N ∈ lvals) $ by wcel_congr [#6, i12]
i14: $ sat A (mcv C) H L ≐ sat B (mcv D) I N $ by sat_congr [#1, i5, #4, #6]
i15: $ (O ∈ sat A (mcv C) H L) ⟺ (P ∈ sat B (mcv D) I N) $ by wcel_congr [#7, i14]
j1: $ (L ∈ lvals ∧ O ∈ sat A (mcv C) H L) ⟺ (N ∈ lvals ∧ P ∈ sat B (mcv D) I N) $ by and_congr [i13, i15]
j2: $ (J ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ∧ L ∈ lvals ∧ O ∈ sat A (mcv C) H L) ⟺ (K ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ∧ N ∈ lvals ∧ P ∈ sat B (mcv D) I N) $ by and_congr [i11, j1]
j3: $ (ra_ind_wf H J ∈ lrel3 E ∧ J ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ∧ L ∈ lvals ∧ O ∈ sat A (mcv C) H L) ⟺ (ra_ind_wf I K ∈ lrel3 F ∧ K ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ∧ N ∈ lvals ∧ P ∈ sat B (mcv D) I N) $ by and_congr [i9, j2]
j4: $ (jval A (mcv C) E ∧ ra_ind_wf H J ∈ lrel3 E ∧ J ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ∧ L ∈ lvals ∧ O ∈ sat A (mcv C) H L) ⟺ (jval B (mcv D) F ∧ ra_ind_wf I K ∈ lrel3 F ∧ K ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ∧ N ∈ lvals ∧ P ∈ sat B (mcv D) I N) $ by and_congr [i6, j3]
j5: $ (functional C ∧ jval A (mcv C) E ∧ ra_ind_wf H J ∈ lrel3 E ∧ J ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ∧ L ∈ lvals ∧ O ∈ sat A (mcv C) H L) ⟺ (functional D ∧ jval B (mcv D) F ∧ ra_ind_wf I K ∈ lrel3 F ∧ K ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ∧ N ∈ lvals ∧ P ∈ sat B (mcv D) I N) $ by and_congr [i4, j4]
j6: $ (hty ⊆ C ∧ functional C ∧ jval A (mcv C) E ∧ ra_ind_wf H J ∈ lrel3 E ∧ J ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ∧ L ∈ lvals ∧ O ∈ sat A (mcv C) H L) ⟺ (hty ⊆ D ∧ functional D ∧ jval B (mcv D) F ∧ ra_ind_wf I K ∈ lrel3 F ∧ K ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ∧ N ∈ lvals ∧ P ∈ sat B (mcv D) I N) $ by and_congr [i3, j5]
j7: $ iwf A C E H J L O ⟺ iwf B D F I K N P $ by and_congr [i1, j6]

sb_f_iwf
--------
l1: $ [x/t] (uadm A ∧ hty ⊆ B ∧ functional B ∧ jval A (mcv B) C ∧ ra_ind_wf D E ∈ lrel3 C ∧ E ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ∧ F ∈ lvals ∧ H ∈ sat A (mcv B) D F) ⟺ uadm (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) ∧ hty ⊆ (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) ∧ functional (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) ∧ jval (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (mcv (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) (⟦ x / t ⟧ C) ∧ ra_ind_wf (⟦ x / t ⟧ D) (⟦ x / t ⟧ E) ∈ lrel3 (⟦ x / t ⟧ C) ∧ (⟦ x / t ⟧ E) ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ∧ (⟦ x / t ⟧ F) ∈ lvals ∧ (⟦ x / t ⟧ H) ∈ sat (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (mcv (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) (⟦ x / t ⟧ D) (⟦ x / t ⟧ F) $ by iff_refl

ijs_congr
---------
k1: $ z ≐ z $ by ceqt_refl
k2: $ itc A C E H ≐ itc B D F I $ by itc_congr [#1, #2, #3, #4]
k3: $ (z ∈ itc A C E H) ⟺ (z ∈ itc B D F I) $ by wcel_congr [k1, k2]
k4: $ (z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⟺ (z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by iff_refl
k5: $ j ≐ j $ by ceqt_refl
k6: $ igate A C E j H ⟺ igate B D F j I $ by igate_congr [#1, #2, #3, k5, #4]
k7: $ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ≐ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ $ by ceqt_refl
k8: $ ifam A C E H ≐ ifam B D F I $ by ifam_congr [#1, #2, #3, #4]
k9: $ (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam A C E H) ⟺ (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam B D F I) $ by wcel_congr [k7, k8]
k10: $ ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam A C E H) ⟺ ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam B D F I) $ by ex_congr [k9]
k11: $ (igate A C E j H → ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam A C E H)) ⟺ (igate B D F j I → ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam B D F I)) $ by im_congr [k6, k10]
k12: $ (z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ (igate A C E j H → ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam A C E H))) ⟺ (z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ (igate B D F j I → ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam B D F I))) $ by and_congr [k4, k11]
k13: $ ∃ a (z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ (igate A C E j H → ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam A C E H))) ⟺ ∃ a (z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ (igate B D F j I → ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam B D F I))) $ by ex_congr [k12]
k14: $ ∃ j ∃ a (z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ (igate A C E j H → ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam A C E H))) ⟺ ∃ j ∃ a (z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ (igate B D F j I → ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam B D F I))) $ by ex_congr [k13]
k15: $ (z ∈ itc A C E H ∧ ∃ j ∃ a (z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ (igate A C E j H → ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam A C E H)))) ⟺ (z ∈ itc B D F I ∧ ∃ j ∃ a (z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ (igate B D F j I → ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam B D F I)))) $ by and_congr [k3, k14]
k16: $ ijs A C E H ≐ ijs B D F I $ by cab_congr [k15]

sb_c_ijs
--------
l1: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ {z | z ∈ itc A B C D ∧ ∃ j ∃ a (z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ (igate A B C j D → ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam A B C D)))}) ≐ {z | z ∈ itc (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) (⟦ x / t ⟧ C) (⟦ x / t ⟧ D) ∧ ∃ j ∃ a (z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ (igate (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) (⟦ x / t ⟧ C) j (⟦ x / t ⟧ D) → ∃ y (⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) (⟦ x / t ⟧ C) (⟦ x / t ⟧ D))))} $ by ceqt_refl

ilev_congr
----------
m1: $ ∅ ≐ ∅ $ by ceqt_refl
m2: $ f ≐ f $ by ceqt_refl
m3: $ ityf A ∅ f ⟺ ityf B ∅ f $ by ityf_congr [#1, m1, m2]
m4: $ (ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel) ⟺ (ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel) $ by iff_refl
m5: $ l ≐ l $ by ceqt_refl
m6: $ lv l C ≐ lv l D $ by lv_congr [m5, #2]
m7: $ seqt y y $ by seqt_refl
m8: $ (y ∊ lv l C) ⟺ (y ∊ lv l D) $ by welc_congr [m7, m6]
m9: $ (ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv l C) ⟺ (ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv l D) $ by and_congr [m4, m8]
m10: $ (ityf A ∅ f ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv l C) ⟺ (ityf B ∅ f ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv l D) $ by and_congr [m3, m9]
m11: $ ∃ l (ityf A ∅ f ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv l C) ⟺ ∃ l (ityf B ∅ f ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv l D) $ by ex_congr [m10]
m12: $ ∃ k ∃ l (ityf A ∅ f ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv l C) ⟺ ∃ k ∃ l (ityf B ∅ f ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv l D) $ by ex_congr [m11]
m13: $ ∃ f ∃ k ∃ l (ityf A ∅ f ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv l C) ⟺ ∃ f ∃ k ∃ l (ityf B ∅ f ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv l D) $ by ex_congr [m12]
m14: $ ilev A C ≐ ilev B D $ by cab_congr [m13]

sb_c_ilev
---------
l1: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ {y | ∃ f ∃ k ∃ l (ityf A ∅ f ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv l B)}) ≐ {y | ∃ f ∃ k ∃ l (ityf (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) ∅ f ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv l (⟦ x / t ⟧ B))} $ by ceqt_refl

lemma b4_ap_proper (G: hyps) (T X: class): $ G ⇒ rel T $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ isset X $ > $ G ⇒ ap T X = ∅ $
----
a1: $ G , y ∊ ap T X ⇒ y ∊ ap T X $ by ax
a2: $ G , y ∊ ap T X ⇒ ⟨ X , y ⟩ ∈ T $ by cab_elim [a1]
b1: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T ⇒ rel T $ by weaken [#1]
b2: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T ⇒ v ∊ T → ∃ x0 ∃ x1 (v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩) $ by all_elim [b1]
b3: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T ⇒ v ∊ T $ by ax
b4: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T ⇒ ∃ x0 ∃ x1 (v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩) $ by imp_elim [b2, b3]
c1: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T , v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩ ⇒ v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ $ by ax
c2: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T , v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩ ⇒ v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩ $ by ax
c3: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T , v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ X , y ⟩ = v $ by eq_sym [c1]
c4: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T , v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ X , y ⟩ = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩ $ by eq_trans [c3, c2]
c5: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T , v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩ ⇒ isset X $ by opair_eq_isset [c4]
c6: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T , v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩ ⇒ ¬ isset X $ by weaken [#2]
c7: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T , v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩ ⇒ ⊥ $ by not_elim [c6, c5]
d1: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T , ∃ x1 (v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩) ⇒ ∃ x1 (v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩) $ by ax
d2: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T , ∃ x1 (v = ⟨ x0 , x1 ⟩) ⇒ ⊥ $ by ex_elim [d1, c7]
d3: $ G , y ∊ ap T X , v = ⟨ X , y ⟩ , v ∊ T ⇒ ⊥ $ by ex_elim [b4, d2]
e1: $ G , y ∊ ap T X ⇒ ⊥ $ by wcel_elim [a2, d3]
e2: $ G ⇒ ap T X = ∅ $ by empty_eq_intro [e1]

lemma b4_ap_empty (G: hyps) (T: class): $ G ⇒ cdm T ⊆ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ap T ∅ = ∅ $
----
a1: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ ⇒ y ∊ ap T ∅ $ by ax
a2: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , y ⟩ ∈ T $ by cab_elim [a1]
b1: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ , z = ∅ ⇒ z = ∅ $ by ax
b2: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ , z = ∅ ⇒ ∅ = z $ by eq_sym [b1]
b3: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ , z = ∅ ⇒ y = y $ by eq_refl
b4: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ , z = ∅ ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , y ⟩ = ⟨ z , y ⟩ $ by opair_eq [b2, b3]
b5: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ , z = ∅ ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , y ⟩ ∈ T $ by weaken [a2]
b6: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ , z = ∅ ⇒ ⟨ z , y ⟩ ∈ T $ by wcel_eq_l [b4, b5]
b7: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ , z = ∅ ⇒ ∃ x1 (⟨ z , x1 ⟩ ∈ T) $ by ex_intro [b6]
b8: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ ⇒ isset ∅ $ by ax_empty
b9: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ ⇒ ∅ ∈ cdm T $ by wcel_cab_intro [b8, b7]
b10: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ ⇒ cdm T ⊆ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
b11: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ ⇒ ∅ ∈ trees ω $ by wcel_subset [b10, b9]
b12: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
b13: $ G , y ∊ ap T ∅ ⇒ ⊥ $ by empty_notin_trees_c [b12, b11]
b14: $ G ⇒ ap T ∅ = ∅ $ by empty_eq_intro [b13]

lemma b4_fv_clip (G: hyps) (T X: class): $ G ⇒ rel T $ > $ G ⇒ cdm T ⊆ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ fv T X = fv T (sclip X) $
----
p1: $ G , isset X ⇒ isset X $ by ax
p2: $ G , isset X ⇒ sclip X = X $ by sclip_in [p1]
p3: $ G , isset X ⇒ X = sclip X $ by eq_sym [p2]
p4: $ G , isset X ⇒ T = T $ by eq_refl
p5: $ G , isset X ⇒ fv T X = fv T (sclip X) $ by fv_eq [p4, p3]
q1: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ ¬ isset X $ by ax
q2: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ rel T $ by weaken [#1]
q3: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ ap T X = ∅ $ by b4_ap_proper [q2, q1]
q4: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ sclip X = ∅ $ by sclip_out [q1]
q5: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ T = T $ by eq_refl
q6: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ ap T (sclip X) = ap T ∅ $ by ap_eq [q5, q4]
q7: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ cdm T ⊆ trees ω $ by weaken [#2]
q8: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ ap T ∅ = ∅ $ by b4_ap_empty [q7]
q9: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ ap T (sclip X) = ∅ $ by eq_trans [q6, q8]
q10: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ ∅ = ap T (sclip X) $ by eq_sym [q9]
q11: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ ap T X = ap T (sclip X) $ by eq_trans [q3, q10]
q12: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ fv T X = fv T (sclip X) $ by cuni_eq [q11]
r0: $ G ⇒ isset X ∨ ¬ isset X $ by excluded_middle
r1: $ G ⇒ fv T X = fv T (sclip X) $ by or_elim [r0, p5, q12]

lemma b4_scons_clip (G: hyps) (X S: class): $ G ⇒ scons X S = scons (sclip X) S $
----
p1: $ G , isset X ⇒ isset X $ by ax
p2: $ G , isset X ⇒ sclip X = X $ by sclip_in [p1]
p3: $ G , isset X ⇒ X = sclip X $ by eq_sym [p2]
p4: $ G , isset X ⇒ S = S $ by eq_refl
p5: $ G , isset X ⇒ scons X S = scons (sclip X) S $ by scons_eq [p3, p4]
q1: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ ¬ isset X $ by ax
q2: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ scons X S = scons ∅ S $ by scons_proper [q1]
q3: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ sclip X = ∅ $ by sclip_out [q1]
q4: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ S = S $ by eq_refl
q5: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ scons (sclip X) S = scons ∅ S $ by scons_eq [q3, q4]
q6: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ scons ∅ S = scons (sclip X) S $ by eq_sym [q5]
q7: $ G , ¬ isset X ⇒ scons X S = scons (sclip X) S $ by eq_trans [q2, q6]
r0: $ G ⇒ isset X ∨ ¬ isset X $ by excluded_middle
r1: $ G ⇒ scons X S = scons (sclip X) S $ by or_elim [r0, p5, q7]

lemma b4_scons_cl (G: hyps) (X S T: class) (x: set): $ G ⇒ x = sclip X $ > $ G ⇒ S = T $ > $ G ⇒ scons X S = scons x T $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ scons X S = scons (sclip X) S $ by b4_scons_clip
l2: $ G ⇒ sclip X = x $ by eq_sym [#1]
l3: $ G ⇒ scons (sclip X) S = scons x T $ by scons_eq [l2, #2]
l4: $ G ⇒ scons X S = scons x T $ by eq_trans [l1, l3]

lemma b4_dnf_clip (G: hyps) (U M X: class): $ G ⇒ fv (dnf U M) X = fv (dnf U M) (sclip X) $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ functional (cgr3 k x0 v (dnb U M k x0 v)) $ by cgr3_functional
l2: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
l3: $ G ⇒ rel (dnf U M) $ by trc_rel_c [l2, l1]
l4: $ G ⇒ cdm (dnf U M) = trees ω $ by trc_cdm_c [l2, l1]
l5: $ G ⇒ cdm (dnf U M) ⊆ trees ω $ by eq_subset [l4]
l6: $ G ⇒ fv (dnf U M) X = fv (dnf U M) (sclip X) $ by b4_fv_clip [l3, l5]

lemma b4_stf_clip (G: hyps) (U M X: class): $ G ⇒ fv (stf U M) X = fv (stf U M) (sclip X) $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ functional (cgr3 k x0 v (stb U M k x0 v)) $ by cgr3_functional
l2: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
l3: $ G ⇒ rel (stf U M) $ by trc_rel_c [l2, l1]
l4: $ G ⇒ cdm (stf U M) = trees ω $ by trc_cdm_c [l2, l1]
l5: $ G ⇒ cdm (stf U M) ⊆ trees ω $ by eq_subset [l4]
l6: $ G ⇒ fv (stf U M) X = fv (stf U M) (sclip X) $ by b4_fv_clip [l3, l5]

lemma b4_dt_cl (G: hyps) (U M E W R: class) (e w r: set): $ G ⇒ e = sclip E $ > $ G ⇒ w = W $ > $ G ⇒ r = R $ > $ G ⇒ dt U M e w r = dt U M E W R $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ fv (dnf U M) E = fv (dnf U M) (sclip E) $ by b4_dnf_clip
l2: $ G ⇒ sclip E = e $ by eq_sym [#1]
l3: $ G ⇒ dnf U M = dnf U M $ by eq_refl
l4: $ G ⇒ fv (dnf U M) (sclip E) = fv (dnf U M) e $ by fv_eq [l3, l2]
l5: $ G ⇒ fv (dnf U M) E = fv (dnf U M) e $ by eq_trans [l1, l4]
l6: $ G ⇒ fv (dnf U M) e = fv (dnf U M) E $ by eq_sym [l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ dt U M e w r = dt U M E W R $ by da_eq [l6, #2, #3]

lemma b4_sat_cl (G: hyps) (U M C W: class) (g w: set): $ G ⇒ g = sclip C $ > $ G ⇒ w = W $ > $ G ⇒ sat U M g w = sat U M C W $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ fv (stf U M) C = fv (stf U M) (sclip C) $ by b4_stf_clip
l2: $ G ⇒ sclip C = g $ by eq_sym [#1]
l3: $ G ⇒ stf U M = stf U M $ by eq_refl
l4: $ G ⇒ fv (stf U M) (sclip C) = fv (stf U M) g $ by fv_eq [l3, l2]
l5: $ G ⇒ fv (stf U M) C = fv (stf U M) g $ by eq_trans [l1, l4]
l6: $ G ⇒ fv (stf U M) g = fv (stf U M) C $ by eq_sym [l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ sat U M g w = sat U M C W $ by ap_eq [l6, #2]

lemma b4_jval_s (G: hyps) (U M J: class) (g e b a w r: set): $ G ⇒ jval U M J $ > $ G ⇒ ra_deq g e b a ∈ J $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ r ∊ sat U M g w $ > $ G ⇒ dt U M e w r = dt U M b w r ∧ dt U M e w r ∈ dt U M a w r $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_deq g x1 x2 x3 ∈ J → ∀ x4 (x4 ∊ lvals → ∀ x5 (x5 ∊ sat U M g x4 → dt U M x1 x4 x5 = dt U M x2 x4 x5 ∧ dt U M x1 x4 x5 ∈ dt U M x3 x4 x5))) $ by all_elim [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_deq g e x2 x3 ∈ J → ∀ x4 (x4 ∊ lvals → ∀ x5 (x5 ∊ sat U M g x4 → dt U M e x4 x5 = dt U M x2 x4 x5 ∧ dt U M e x4 x5 ∈ dt U M x3 x4 x5))) $ by all_elim [l1]
