l5: $ G ⇒ ∀ x4 (x4 ∊ lvals → ∀ x5 (x5 ∊ sat U M g x4 → dt U M e x4 x5 = dt U M b x4 x5 ∧ dt U M e x4 x5 ∈ dt U M a x4 x5)) $ by imp_elim [l4, #2]
l6: $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals → ∀ x5 (x5 ∊ sat U M g w → dt U M e w x5 = dt U M b w x5 ∧ dt U M e w x5 ∈ dt U M a w x5) $ by all_elim [l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ ∀ x5 (x5 ∊ sat U M g w → dt U M e w x5 = dt U M b w x5 ∧ dt U M e w x5 ∈ dt U M a w x5) $ by imp_elim [l6, #3]
