m1: $ G , g = sclip C , e = sclip E , b = sclip E2 , a = sclip A , w = W , w ∊ lvals , r = R , r ∊ sat U M C W ⇒ scons A ∅ = scons a ∅ $ by b4_scons_cl [ma, m0]
