d12: $ G , y ∊ ilev D W , ityf D ∅ f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , y ∊ lv l W , x1 = sclip K , x2 = sclip L ⇒ y ∊ lv l W $ by ax
d13: $ G , y ∊ ilev D W , ityf D ∅ f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , y ∊ lv l W , x1 = sclip K , x2 = sclip L ⇒ y ∊ lv L W $ by welc_eq [d11, d12]
