g10: $ G , y ∊ lv L W , x0 = sclip F , x1 = sclip K , x2 = sclip L ⇒ lv L W = lv x2 W $ by eq_sym [g9]
g11: $ G , y ∊ lv L W , x0 = sclip F , x1 = sclip K , x2 = sclip L ⇒ y ∊ lv L W $ by ax
g12: $ G , y ∊ lv L W , x0 = sclip F , x1 = sclip K , x2 = sclip L ⇒ y ∊ lv x2 W $ by welc_eq [g10, g11]
