g13: $ G , y ∊ lv L W , x0 = sclip F , x1 = sclip K , x2 = sclip L ⇒ ityf D ∅ x0 ∧ ra_isort x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ y ∊ lv x2 W $ by and_intro [g4, g13a]
