c2: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_app , scons x7 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 x6 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) e w r = {y | ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x5 w o ∧ y = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , scons (da (fv (dnf u M) x6) w o) a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by eq_trans [c1, w3]
