w1: $ H , n = x0 ∧ k = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_pi , scons l (scons m ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_lift x0 x1 x9 l ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x0 ⟨ kc_s , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ b m ∈ lrel , h = ⟨ kc_s , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons l (scons m ∅) ⟩ w r = {y | ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) l) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) m w (scons x r) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) l w r) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by etel_pi [Tl, Tm, f1, rv]
