m2: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ P ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w (scons x R) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons D t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ P ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w (scons x R) ∧ z = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons D t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [m1]
