lemma b5_pstep (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w s c j: set): $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ c ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ b5_pp u M w s $
----
g1: $ G , z = ⟨ c , j ⟩ , ra_pis z v o ∈ lrel , v ∊ trees ω , ⟨ r , ⟨ q , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) o w s ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#1]
g2: $ G , z = ⟨ c , j ⟩ , ra_pis z v o ∈ lrel , v ∊ trees ω , ⟨ r , ⟨ q , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) o w s ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#2]
g3: $ G , z = ⟨ c , j ⟩ , ra_pis z v o ∈ lrel , v ∊ trees ω , ⟨ r , ⟨ q , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) o w s ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#4]
g4: $ G , z = ⟨ c , j ⟩ , ra_pis z v o ∈ lrel , v ∊ trees ω , ⟨ r , ⟨ q , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) o w s ⇒ crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s $ by weaken [#5]
g5: $ G , z = ⟨ c , j ⟩ , ra_pis z v o ∈ lrel , v ∊ trees ω , ⟨ r , ⟨ q , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) o w s ⇒ z = ⟨ c , j ⟩ $ by ax
