g7: $ G , z = ⟨ c , j ⟩ , ra_pis z v o ∈ lrel , v ∊ trees ω , ⟨ r , ⟨ q , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) o w s ⇒ v ∊ trees ω $ by ax
