lemma b5_pis_ind (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w s: set): $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ b5_pp u M w s $
----
n1: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#1]
n2: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#2]
n3: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s ⇒ c ∊ ω $ by ax
n4: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
n5: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s ⇒ crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s $ by ax
n6: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s ⇒ ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ b5_pp u M w s $ by b5_pstep [n1, n2, n3, n4, n5]
n7: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s → ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ b5_pp u M w s $ by imp_intro [n6]
n8: $ G , c ∊ ω ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s → ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ b5_pp u M w s $ by imp_intro [n7]
