n10: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (c ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s → ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ b5_pp u M w s) $ by all_intro [n9]
n11: $ G ⇒ ∀ c ∀ j (c ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b5_pp u M w s → ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ b5_pp u M w s) $ by all_intro [n10]
