c9: $ G ⇒ ∀ r ∀ q ∀ i ∀ k (ra_pis t1 t2 t3 ∈ lrel → t2 ∊ trees ω → ⟨ r , ⟨ q , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t3 w s → ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ p (p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M s) t2 w p ∧ r = scat x p)) $ by all_elim [c8]
c10: $ G ⇒ ∀ q ∀ i ∀ k (ra_pis t1 t2 t3 ∈ lrel → t2 ∊ trees ω → ⟨ f , ⟨ q , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t3 w s → ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ p (p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M s) t2 w p ∧ f = scat x p)) $ by all_elim [c9]
c11: $ G ⇒ ∀ i ∀ k (ra_pis t1 t2 t3 ∈ lrel → t2 ∊ trees ω → ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ i , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t3 w s → ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ p (p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M s) t2 w p ∧ f = scat x p)) $ by all_elim [c10]
c12: $ G ⇒ ∀ k (ra_pis t1 t2 t3 ∈ lrel → t2 ∊ trees ω → ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , k ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t3 w s → ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ p (p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M s) t2 w p ∧ f = scat x p)) $ by all_elim [c11]
c13: $ G ⇒ ra_pis t1 t2 t3 ∈ lrel → t2 ∊ trees ω → ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t3 w s → ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ p (p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M s) t2 w p ∧ f = scat x p) $ by all_elim [c12]
c14: $ G ⇒ t2 ∊ trees ω → ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t3 w s → ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ p (p ∊ esat u (dsh u M s) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M s) t2 w p ∧ f = scat x p) $ by imp_elim [c13, #1]
