m1a: $ G , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E ⟨ kc_pi , scons Al (scons Bm ∅) ⟩ w r , z = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , z ∊ {y | ∃ x ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (x ∊ da (fv E Al) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E Bm w (scons x r) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc x1 x , ⟨ scons x x2 , ⟨ scons (etel u E Al w r) x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} , x ∊ da (fv E Al) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E Bm w (scons x r) ∧ z = ⟨ ssnoc x1 x , ⟨ scons x x2 , ⟨ scons (etel u E Al w r) x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , ⟨ x1 , ⟨ i , ⟨ d , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E Bb w (scons x o) , b = scons x i , c = scons (etel u E Ax w o) d , v = ⟨ ssnoc x1 x , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x ∊ da (fv E Al) w r $ by weaken [bq1]
