n2: $ H , k = x0 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ q = x6 ∧ e = ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel ⇒ ¬ kc_bvar = kc_pi $ by kc_bvar_ne_pi
