fin: $ H , k = x0 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x5 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ q = x6 ∧ e = ⟨ kc_app , scons x7 (scons x1 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_inst x0 x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst x0 x3 x6 x1 ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_isort e m l ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ p (p ∊ fseq u → cdm p = fv nvf k → ∀ f ∀ g ∀ t ∀ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) e w (scat p s) → ∃ i ∃ d ∃ h (⟨ f , ⟨ i , ⟨ d , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z w (scat p (scons (dt u M q w s) s))))) $ by b5_isbad [f7, q2, k1, s2, n1, n2]
