t3: $ H , k = x0 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q = x6 ∧ e = ⟨ kc_pi , scons o (scons r ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_inst x0 x9 x6 o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ b x6 r ∈ lrel , m = ⟨ kc_s , scons y ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_isort b y l ∈ lrel , x5 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ , p ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf k , x7 = scat p s , x8 = scat p (scons (dt u M q w s) s) , x ∊ u , n = scons x p ⇒ scat (scons x p) s = scons x (scat p s) $ by scat_scons [a1N, t3b]
t4: $ H , k = x0 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q = x6 ∧ e = ⟨ kc_pi , scons o (scons r ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_inst x0 x9 x6 o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ b x6 r ∈ lrel , m = ⟨ kc_s , scons y ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_isort b y l ∈ lrel , x5 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ , p ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf k , x7 = scat p s , x8 = scat p (scons (dt u M q w s) s) , x ∊ u , n = scons x p ⇒ x = x $ by eq_refl
t5: $ H , k = x0 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q = x6 ∧ e = ⟨ kc_pi , scons o (scons r ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_inst x0 x9 x6 o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ b x6 r ∈ lrel , m = ⟨ kc_s , scons y ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_isort b y l ∈ lrel , x5 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ , p ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf k , x7 = scat p s , x8 = scat p (scons (dt u M q w s) s) , x ∊ u , n = scons x p ⇒ scat p s = x7 $ by eq_sym [a3N]
t6: $ H , k = x0 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q = x6 ∧ e = ⟨ kc_pi , scons o (scons r ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_inst x0 x9 x6 o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ b x6 r ∈ lrel , m = ⟨ kc_s , scons y ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_isort b y l ∈ lrel , x5 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ , p ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf k , x7 = scat p s , x8 = scat p (scons (dt u M q w s) s) , x ∊ u , n = scons x p ⇒ scons x (scat p s) = scons x x7 $ by scons_eq [t4, t5]
t7a: $ H , k = x0 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q = x6 ∧ e = ⟨ kc_pi , scons o (scons r ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_inst x0 x9 x6 o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ b x6 r ∈ lrel , m = ⟨ kc_s , scons y ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_isort b y l ∈ lrel , x5 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ , p ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf k , x7 = scat p s , x8 = scat p (scons (dt u M q w s) s) , x ∊ u , n = scons x p ⇒ scat n s = scons x (scat p s) $ by eq_trans [t2, t3]
