t9: $ H , k = x0 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q = x6 ∧ e = ⟨ kc_pi , scons o (scons r ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_inst x0 x9 x6 o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ b x6 r ∈ lrel , m = ⟨ kc_s , scons y ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_isort b y l ∈ lrel , x5 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ , p ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf k , x7 = scat p s , x8 = scat p (scons (dt u M q w s) s) , x ∊ u , n = scons x p ⇒ scat n (scons (dt u M q w s) s) = scat (scons x p) (scons (dt u M q w s) s) $ by scat_eq [n2, t8]
t10a: $ H , k = x0 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q = x6 ∧ e = ⟨ kc_pi , scons o (scons r ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_inst x0 x9 x6 o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ b x6 r ∈ lrel , m = ⟨ kc_s , scons y ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_isort b y l ∈ lrel , x5 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x0 ∅ ⟩ , p ∊ fseq u , cdm p = fv nvf k , x7 = scat p s , x8 = scat p (scons (dt u M q w s) s) , x ∊ u , n = scons x p ⇒ isset x $ by isset_var
