lemma b5_li_ind (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w q s: set): $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ dt u M q w s ∈ u $ > $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ b5_is u M w q s $
----
n1: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_is u M w q s ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#1]
n2: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_is u M w q s ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#2]
n3: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_is u M w q s ⇒ dt u M q w s ∈ u $ by weaken [#3]
n4: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_is u M w q s ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
n5: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_is u M w q s ⇒ crn j ⊆ b5_is u M w q s $ by ax
n6: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_is u M w q s ⇒ ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ b5_is u M w q s $ by b5_lstep [n1, n2, n3, n4, n5]
n7: $ G , c ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ crn j ⊆ b5_is u M w q s → ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ b5_is u M w q s $ by imp_intro [n6]
n8: $ G , c ∊ ω ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b5_is u M w q s → ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ b5_is u M w q s $ by imp_intro [n7]
n9: $ G ⇒ c ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b5_is u M w q s → ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ b5_is u M w q s $ by imp_intro [n8]
n10: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (c ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b5_is u M w q s → ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ b5_is u M w q s) $ by all_intro [n9]
n11: $ G ⇒ ∀ c ∀ j (c ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b5_is u M w q s → ⟨ c , j ⟩ ∈ b5_is u M w q s) $ by all_intro [n10]
n12: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
n13: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ b5_is u M w q s $ by trees_ind_c [n12, n11]

lemma b5_li {p f g t a i d h: set} (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w q s m l k e x: set): $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ dt u M q w s ∈ u $ > $ G ⇒ ra_isort x m l ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_inst k x q e ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_isort e m l ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ p (p ∊ fseq u → cdm p = fv nvf k → ∀ f ∀ g ∀ t ∀ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) e w (scat p s) → ∃ i ∃ d ∃ h (⟨ f , ⟨ i , ⟨ d , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x w (scat p (scons (dt u M q w s) s))))) $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ b5_is u M w q s $ by b5_li_ind [#1, #2, #3]
l2: $ G ⇒ kr_inst ∈ ω $ by kr_inst_omega
l3: $ G ⇒ isset kr_inst $ by wcel_isset [l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ k ∊ trees ω ∧ x ∊ trees ω ∧ q ∊ trees ω ∧ e ∊ trees ω $ by lrel_args4 [#5, l3]
l5: $ G ⇒ x ∊ trees ω ∧ q ∊ trees ω ∧ e ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [l4]
l6: $ G ⇒ x ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ x ∊ b5_is u M w q s $ by subset_elim [l1, l6]
l8: $ G ⇒ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (ra_isort x x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_inst x3 x q x4 ∈ lrel → ra_isort x4 x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ p (p ∊ fseq u → cdm p = fv nvf x3 → ∀ f ∀ g ∀ t ∀ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x4 w (scat p s) → ∃ i ∃ d ∃ h (⟨ f , ⟨ i , ⟨ d , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x w (scat p (scons (dt u M q w s) s)))))) $ by cab_elim [l7]
l9: $ G ⇒ ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (ra_isort x m x2 ∈ lrel → ra_inst x3 x q x4 ∈ lrel → ra_isort x4 m x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ p (p ∊ fseq u → cdm p = fv nvf x3 → ∀ f ∀ g ∀ t ∀ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x4 w (scat p s) → ∃ i ∃ d ∃ h (⟨ f , ⟨ i , ⟨ d , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x w (scat p (scons (dt u M q w s) s)))))) $ by all_elim [l8]
