cf4: $ H , c = x0 ∧ h = x1 ∧ q = x2 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x3 (scons x4 ∅) ⟩ ∧ e = x7 ∧ ra_sty x0 x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_deq x0 x4 x4 x5 ∈ J ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x6 x4 x7 ∈ lrel , b = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⇒ r ∊ sat u M c w $ by weaken [#4]
