lemma b5_sy_step (G: hyps) (J M K S: class) (u w c h q r l o k j: set): $ G ⇒ jval u M J $ > $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ r ∊ sat u M c w $ > $ G ⇒ ra_isort q o l ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , S ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ K = kc_pi $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ K = kc_app $ > $ G ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l $
----
g1: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_sty c h q z e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ jval u M J $ by weaken [#1]
g2: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_sty c h q z e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ uadm u $ by weaken [#2]
g3: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_sty c h q z e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#3]
g4: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_sty c h q z e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ r ∊ sat u M c w $ by weaken [#4]
g5: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_sty c h q z e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ra_isort q o l ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#5]
g6: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_sty c h q z e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ $ by weaken [#6]
g7: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_sty c h q z e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ⟨ K , S ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#7]
g8: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_sty c h q z e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ¬ K = kc_pi $ by weaken [#8]
g9: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_sty c h q z e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ¬ K = kc_app $ by weaken [#9]
g10: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_sty c h q z e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by weaken [#10]
g11: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_sty c h q z e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l $ by weaken [#11]
g12: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_sty c h q z e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
