lemma b5_sy_ind (G: hyps) (J M K S: class) (u w c h q r l o: set): $ G ⇒ jval u M J $ > $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ r ∊ sat u M c w $ > $ G ⇒ ra_isort q o l ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , S ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ K = kc_pi $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ K = kc_app $ > $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l $
----
n1: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l ⇒ jval u M J $ by weaken [#1]
n2: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l ⇒ uadm u $ by weaken [#2]
n3: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#3]
n4: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l ⇒ r ∊ sat u M c w $ by weaken [#4]
n5: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l ⇒ ra_isort q o l ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#5]
n6: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l ⇒ h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ $ by weaken [#6]
n7: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l ⇒ ⟨ K , S ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#7]
n8: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l ⇒ ¬ K = kc_pi $ by weaken [#8]
n9: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l ⇒ ¬ K = kc_app $ by weaken [#9]
n10: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
n11: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l ⇒ crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l $ by ax
n12: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l $ by b5_sy_step [n1, n2, n3, n4, n5, n6, n7, n8, n9, n10, n11]
n13: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l $ by imp_intro [n12]
n14: $ G , k ∊ ω ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l $ by imp_intro [n13]
n15: $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l $ by imp_intro [n14]
n16: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l) $ by all_intro [n15]
n17: $ G ⇒ ∀ k ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l) $ by all_intro [n16]
n18: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
n19: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ b5_sy u M w J c h q r l $ by trees_ind_c [n18, n17]

