q31: $ H , z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x (scons y ∅) ⟩ ∧ x ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr ∧ y ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr ⇒ a ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr ∧ b ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr $ by b6_clash [q23, q27, q30, q28, q29]
