q9: $ H , z = ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x ∅ ⟩ ∧ x ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_nat ⇒ a ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_blk ∧ b ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_nat ∧ c ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr $ by b6_clash [q3, q5, q8, q6, q7]
