q33: $ G , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (d = x1 ∧ j = x2 ∧ n = x2 ∧ k = x3 ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x4) ⇒ f ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr $ by ex_elim [q32, q31]
q34: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (d = x1 ∧ j = x2 ∧ n = x2 ∧ k = x3 ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x4) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (d = x1 ∧ j = x2 ∧ n = x2 ∧ k = x3 ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x4) $ by ax
q35: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (d = x1 ∧ j = x2 ∧ n = x2 ∧ k = x3 ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x4) ⇒ f ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr $ by ex_elim [q34, q33]
q36: $ G , d = x1 ∧ j = x5 ∧ n = x2 ∧ k = x3 ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x7 ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst x3 x4 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 x3 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ⇒ d = x1 ∧ j = x5 ∧ n = x2 ∧ k = x3 ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x7 ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst x3 x4 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 x3 x6 x7 ∈ lrel $ by ax
q37: $ G , d = x1 ∧ j = x5 ∧ n = x2 ∧ k = x3 ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x7 ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst x3 x4 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 x3 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ⇒ d = x1 $ by and_elim_l [q36]
