q8: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = e ∧ t3 = e ⇒ ra_pis z t2 t3 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#4]
q9: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = e ∧ t3 = e ⇒ kr_pis ∈ ω $ by kr_pis_omega
