q21: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = e ∧ t3 = e , ra_clen z q ∈ lrel , ra_isort t2 m l ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_clen z q ∈ lrel $ by ax
q22: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = e ∧ t3 = e , ra_clen z q ∈ lrel , ra_isort t2 m l ∈ lrel ⇒ (z = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ q = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 (z = ⟨ kc_cons , scons x1 (scons x2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ q = ⟨ kc_s , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_clen x2 x3 ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_clen_cases [q21]
