q20: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = e ∧ t3 = e , z = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t4 = x2 ⇒ t3 = t4 $ by eq_trans [q17, q19]
