q26: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t2 = e ∧ t3 = e , z = ⟨ kc_cons , scons x1 (scons x4 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t4 = x3 ∧ ra_pis x4 ⟨ kc_pi , scons x1 (scons x2 ∅) ⟩ x3 ∈ lrel ⇒ t2 = x2 $ by and_elim_l [q25]
