q52: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_cons , scons d (scons g ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = e ∧ t3 = f ∧ ra_pis g ⟨ kc_pi , scons d (scons e ∅) ⟩ f ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_pis g ⟨ kc_pi , scons d (scons e ∅) ⟩ f ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [q50]
