q119: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons g (scons h (scons f ∅)) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons i ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = d ∧ t4 = e ∧ ra_nth_ty f i d e ∈ lrel , t0 = x1 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x2 (scons x4 (scons x5 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ ra_pis x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_tys_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_tys_closed t0 f ∈ lrel → ra_nth_ty f i t3 t4 ∈ lrel → ra_pis t0 t3 t5 ∈ lrel → ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t5 ∈ lrel $ by all_elim [q118]
