q15: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_ctc t0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (ra_tys_closed t0 z ∈ lrel → ra_nth_ty z x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel → ra_pis t0 x7 x9 ∈ lrel → ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x9 ∈ lrel) $ by all_intro [q14]
q16: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_ctc t0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (ra_tys_closed t0 z ∈ lrel → ra_nth_ty z x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel → ra_pis t0 x7 x9 ∈ lrel → ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x9 ∈ lrel) $ by all_intro [q15]
q17: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_ctc t0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ b6_ctc t0 $ by cab_intro [q16]
q18: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_ctc t0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
q19: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_ctc t0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_ctc t0 $ by wcel_intro [q18, q17]
q20: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_ctc t0 ⇒ isset ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by opair_isset
q21: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_ctc t0 ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_ctc t0 $ by isset_elim [q20, q19]
q22: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ crn j ⊆ b6_ctc t0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_ctc t0 $ by imp_intro [q21]
q23: $ G , k ∊ ω ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b6_ctc t0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_ctc t0 $ by imp_intro [q22]
q24: $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b6_ctc t0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_ctc t0 $ by imp_intro [q23]
q25: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b6_ctc t0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_ctc t0) $ by all_intro [q24]
q26: $ G ⇒ ∀ k ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b6_ctc t0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_ctc t0) $ by all_intro [q25]
q27: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
q28: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ b6_ctc t0 $ by trees_ind_c [q27, q26]
q29: $ G ⇒ kr_nth_ty ∈ ω $ by kr_nth_ty_omega
q30: $ G ⇒ isset kr_nth_ty $ by wcel_isset [q29]
q31: $ G ⇒ t1 ∊ trees ω ∧ t2 ∊ trees ω ∧ t3 ∊ trees ω ∧ t4 ∊ trees ω $ by lrel_args4 [#2, q30]
q32: $ G ⇒ t1 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [q31]
q33: $ G ⇒ t2 ∊ trees ω ∧ t3 ∊ trees ω ∧ t4 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [q31]
q34: $ G ⇒ t2 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [q33]
q35: $ G ⇒ t3 ∊ trees ω ∧ t4 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [q33]
q36: $ G ⇒ t3 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [q35]
q37: $ G ⇒ t4 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [q35]
q38: $ G ⇒ t1 ∊ b6_ctc t0 $ by subset_elim [q28, q32]
q39: $ G ⇒ ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (ra_tys_closed t0 t1 ∈ lrel → ra_nth_ty t1 x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel → ra_pis t0 x7 x9 ∈ lrel → ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x9 ∈ lrel) $ by cab_elim [q38]
q40: $ G ⇒ ∀ x7 ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (ra_tys_closed t0 t1 ∈ lrel → ra_nth_ty t1 t2 x7 x8 ∈ lrel → ra_pis t0 x7 x9 ∈ lrel → ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x9 ∈ lrel) $ by all_elim [q39]
q41: $ G ⇒ ∀ x8 ∀ x9 (ra_tys_closed t0 t1 ∈ lrel → ra_nth_ty t1 t2 t3 x8 ∈ lrel → ra_pis t0 t3 x9 ∈ lrel → ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x9 ∈ lrel) $ by all_elim [q40]
q42: $ G ⇒ ∀ x9 (ra_tys_closed t0 t1 ∈ lrel → ra_nth_ty t1 t2 t3 t4 ∈ lrel → ra_pis t0 t3 x9 ∈ lrel → ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x9 ∈ lrel) $ by all_elim [q41]
q43: $ G ⇒ ra_tys_closed t0 t1 ∈ lrel → ra_nth_ty t1 t2 t3 t4 ∈ lrel → ra_pis t0 t3 t5 ∈ lrel → ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t5 ∈ lrel $ by all_elim [q42]
q44: $ G ⇒ ra_nth_ty t1 t2 t3 t4 ∈ lrel → ra_pis t0 t3 t5 ∈ lrel → ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t5 ∈ lrel $ by imp_elim [q43, #1]
q45: $ G ⇒ ra_pis t0 t3 t5 ∈ lrel → ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t5 ∈ lrel $ by imp_elim [q44, #2]
