q100: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ scons x t4 = v $ by eq_sym [q88]
q101: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) = etel u E x3 w v $ by etel_eq [q98, q99, q100]
q102: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w v $ by wcel_eq_r [q101, q97]
q103: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [q47]
q104: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ t3 = x1 $ by weaken [q46]
q105: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ x1 = t3 $ by eq_sym [q104]
q106: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ x3 = x3 $ by eq_refl
q107: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ x4 = x4 $ by eq_refl
q108: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 = ra_isort x3 x4 t3 $ by ra_isort_eq [q106, q107, q105]
q109: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ ra_isort x3 x4 t3 ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q108, q103]
q110: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w v → cdm f = fv nvf x4 $ by imp_elim [q96, q109]
q111: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ cdm f = fv nvf x4 $ by imp_elim [q110, q102]
q112: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ x3 ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [q60]
q113: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ x3 ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [q112]
q114: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ f ∊ fseq u ∧ g ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm g = cdm f ∧ cdm t = cdm f $ by etel_fseq [q113, q102]
q115: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ f ∊ fseq u $ by and_elim_l [q114]
q116: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ cdm (ssnoc f x) = suc (cdm f) $ by ssnoc_len [q115]
