q118: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ cdm t5 = cdm (ssnoc f x) $ by cdm_eq [q117]
q119: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ cdm t5 = suc (cdm f) $ by eq_trans [q118, q116]
q120: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ kr_isort ∈ ω $ by kr_isort_omega
q121: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ isset kr_isort $ by wcel_isset [q120]
q122: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ x3 ∊ trees ω ∧ x4 ∊ trees ω ∧ t3 ∊ trees ω $ by lrel_args3 [q109, q121]
q123: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ x3 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [q122]
