q125: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ x4 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [q124]
q126: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ t3 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [q124]
q127: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ nvf = nvf $ by eq_refl
q128: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ $ by weaken [q44]
q129: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ fv nvf t2 = fv nvf ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ $ by fv_eq [q127, q128]
q130: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ x4 ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [q125]
q131: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ fv nvf ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ = suc (fv nvf x4) $ by nvf_s [q130]
q132: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ fv nvf t2 = suc (fv nvf x4) $ by eq_trans [q129, q131]
q133: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ suc (cdm f) = suc (fv nvf x4) $ by suc_eq [q111]
q134: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ cdm t5 = suc (fv nvf x4) $ by eq_trans [q119, q133]
q135: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ suc (fv nvf x4) = fv nvf t2 $ by eq_sym [q132]
q136: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x , v = scons x t4 ⇒ cdm t5 = fv nvf t2 $ by eq_trans [q134, q135]
q137: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x ⇒ isset t4 $ by isset_var
q138: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel , x ∊ da (fv E x2) w t4 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , t8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E x3 w (scons x t4) ∧ t5 = ssnoc f x ⇒ isset (scons x t4) $ by scons_set [q137]
