q47: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x3 x2 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x3 x2 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel $ by ax
