q187: $ G , ∃ x3 ∃ x2 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x3 x2 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x3 ∃ x2 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x3 x2 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q188: $ G , ∃ x3 ∃ x2 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x3 x2 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) z w r) = nadd (fv nvf t2) (cdm z0) $ by ex_elim [q187, q186]
q189: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x3 ∃ x2 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x3 x2 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x3 ∃ x2 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x3 x2 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q190: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x3 ∃ x2 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x3 x2 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) z w r) = nadd (fv nvf t2) (cdm z0) $ by ex_elim [q189, q188]
q191: $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) z w r) = nadd (fv nvf t2) (cdm z0) $ by or_elim [q1, q46, q190]

lemma b6_iargs_cnt (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w r z0 t1 t2 t3 t4: set): $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ z0 ∊ fseq b6_V $ > $ G ⇒ ra_iargs t1 t2 t3 t4 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) t3 w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) t4 w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r) = nadd (fv nvf t2) (cdm z0) $
----
q1: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel , etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by ax
q2: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel , etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
q3: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel , etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
q4: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel , etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 $ by ax
q5: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel , etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ trees ω $ by trees_omega_intro [q1, q2, q3]
q6: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel , etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel $ by ax
q7: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel , etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
q8: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel , etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#1]
q9: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel , etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#2]
q10: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel , etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z0 ∊ fseq b6_V $ by weaken [#3]
q11: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel , etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) z w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (cdm z0) $ by b6_ia_st [q4, q3, q5, q8, q9, q10, q6, q7]
q12: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ → etel u (dnf u M) z w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) z w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (cdm z0) $ by imp_intro [q11]
q13: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel → etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ → etel u (dnf u M) z w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) z w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (cdm z0) $ by imp_intro [q12]
q14: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ∀ x (ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel → etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ → etel u (dnf u M) z w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) z w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (cdm z0)) $ by all_intro [q13]
q15: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ∀ m ∀ x (ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel → etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ → etel u (dnf u M) z w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) z w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (cdm z0)) $ by all_intro [q14]
q16: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ∀ q ∀ m ∀ x (ra_iargs q m x z ∈ lrel → etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ → etel u (dnf u M) z w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) z w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (cdm z0)) $ by all_intro [q15]
q17: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ b6_cia u M w r z0 $ by cab_intro [q16]
q18: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
q19: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_cia u M w r z0 $ by wcel_intro [q18, q17]
q20: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 ⇒ isset ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by opair_isset
q21: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_cia u M w r z0 $ by isset_elim [q20, q19]
q22: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_cia u M w r z0 $ by imp_intro [q21]
q23: $ G , k ∊ ω ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_cia u M w r z0 $ by imp_intro [q22]
q24: $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_cia u M w r z0 $ by imp_intro [q23]
q25: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_cia u M w r z0) $ by all_intro [q24]
q26: $ G ⇒ ∀ k ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b6_cia u M w r z0) $ by all_intro [q25]
q27: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
q28: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ b6_cia u M w r z0 $ by trees_ind_c [q27, q26]
q29: $ G ⇒ kr_iargs ∈ ω $ by kr_iargs_omega
q30: $ G ⇒ isset kr_iargs $ by wcel_isset [q29]
q31: $ G ⇒ t1 ∊ trees ω ∧ t2 ∊ trees ω ∧ t3 ∊ trees ω ∧ t4 ∊ trees ω $ by lrel_args4 [#4, q30]
q32: $ G ⇒ t1 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [q31]
q33: $ G ⇒ t2 ∊ trees ω ∧ t3 ∊ trees ω ∧ t4 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [q31]
q34: $ G ⇒ t2 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [q33]
q35: $ G ⇒ t3 ∊ trees ω ∧ t4 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [q33]
q36: $ G ⇒ t3 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [q35]
q37: $ G ⇒ t4 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [q35]
q38: $ G ⇒ t4 ∊ b6_cia u M w r z0 $ by subset_elim [q28, q37]
q39: $ G ⇒ ∀ q ∀ m ∀ x (ra_iargs q m x t4 ∈ lrel → etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ → etel u (dnf u M) t4 w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (cdm z0)) $ by cab_elim [q38]
q40: $ G ⇒ ∀ m ∀ x (ra_iargs t1 m x t4 ∈ lrel → etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ → etel u (dnf u M) t4 w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (cdm z0)) $ by all_elim [q39]
q41: $ G ⇒ ∀ x (ra_iargs t1 t2 x t4 ∈ lrel → etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ → etel u (dnf u M) t4 w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r) = nadd (fv nvf t2) (cdm z0)) $ by all_elim [q40]
q42: $ G ⇒ ra_iargs t1 t2 t3 t4 ∈ lrel → etel u (dnf u M) t3 w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ → etel u (dnf u M) t4 w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r) = nadd (fv nvf t2) (cdm z0) $ by all_elim [q41]
q43: $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) t3 w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , z0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ → etel u (dnf u M) t4 w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r) = nadd (fv nvf t2) (cdm z0) $ by imp_elim [q42, #4]
q44: $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) t4 w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r ∈ fseq b6_V ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t4 w r) = nadd (fv nvf t2) (cdm z0) $ by imp_elim [q43, #5]

lemma b6_fseq_V (G: hyps) (u s: set): $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq b6_V $
----
q1: $ G , x ∊ u ⇒ x = x $ by eq_refl
q2: $ G , x ∊ u ⇒ x ∊ b6_V $ by cab_intro [q1]
q3: $ G ⇒ u ⊆ b6_V $ by subset_intro [q2]
q4: $ G ⇒ fseq u ⊆ fseq b6_V $ by fseq_mono [q3]
q5: $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq b6_V $ by subset_elim [q4, #1]

lemma b6_indapp_cnt (G: hyps) {m: set} (M: class) (u w r t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6: set): $ G ⇒ ra_indapp t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ m (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3) ∧ isset (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r ∈ fseq b6_V) $
----
q1: $ G ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_indapp_cases [#1]
q2: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel ⇒ t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel $ by ax
q3: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel ⇒ t1 = x1 $ by and_elim_l [q2]
q4: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel ⇒ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [q2]
q5: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel ⇒ t2 = x2 $ by and_elim_l [q4]
q6: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel ⇒ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [q4]
q7: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel ⇒ t3 = x3 $ by and_elim_l [q6]
