q109: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel , h = ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ , v = swin r (fv nvf x4) (fv nvf x3) ⇒ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 = ra_nidx t1 t6 x8 $ by ra_nidx_eq [q105, q107, q108]
q110: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel , h = ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ , v = swin r (fv nvf x4) (fv nvf x3) ⇒ ra_nidx t1 t6 x8 ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q109, q103]
q111: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel , h = ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ , v = swin r (fv nvf x4) (fv nvf x3) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) d w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) d w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [q79]
