q141: $ G , ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q142: $ G , ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ m (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3) ∧ isset (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r ∈ fseq b6_V) $ by ex_elim [q141, q140]
q143: $ G , ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q144: $ G , ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ m (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3) ∧ isset (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r ∈ fseq b6_V) $ by ex_elim [q143, q142]
q145: $ G , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q146: $ G , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ m (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3) ∧ isset (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r ∈ fseq b6_V) $ by ex_elim [q145, q144]
q147: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q148: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ m (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3) ∧ isset (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r ∈ fseq b6_V) $ by ex_elim [q147, q146]
q149: $ G ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ d (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = d ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ d x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 d ∈ lrel) → ∃ m (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3) ∧ isset (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r ∈ fseq b6_V) $ by imp_intro [q148]
q150: $ G ⇒ ∃ m (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3) ∧ isset (sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r) ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r ∈ fseq b6_V) $ by imp_elim [q149, q1]

lemma b6_inst_isort (G: hyps) (T: class) (t2 t3 t4 t5 t6: set): $ G ⇒ isset T $ > $ G ⇒ ra_inst T t2 t3 t4 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_isort t2 t5 t6 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_isort t4 t5 t6 ∈ lrel $
----
q1: $ G , w = T ⇒ w = T $ by ax
q2: $ G , w = T ⇒ ra_inst T t2 t3 t4 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#2]
q3: $ G , w = T ⇒ T = w $ by eq_sym [q1]
q4: $ G , w = T ⇒ t2 = t2 $ by eq_refl
q5: $ G , w = T ⇒ t3 = t3 $ by eq_refl
q6: $ G , w = T ⇒ t4 = t4 $ by eq_refl
q7: $ G , w = T ⇒ ra_inst T t2 t3 t4 = ra_inst w t2 t3 t4 $ by ra_inst_eq [q3, q4, q5, q6]
q8: $ G , w = T ⇒ ra_inst w t2 t3 t4 ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q7, q2]
q9: $ G , w = T ⇒ (t2 ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr → t3 ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr → t4 ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr) ∧ ∀ n ∀ l (ra_isort t2 n l ∈ lrel → ra_isort t4 n l ∈ lrel) $ by b6_inst [q8]
q10: $ G , w = T ⇒ ∀ n ∀ l (ra_isort t2 n l ∈ lrel → ra_isort t4 n l ∈ lrel) $ by and_elim_r [q9]
q11: $ G , w = T ⇒ ∀ l (ra_isort t2 t5 l ∈ lrel → ra_isort t4 t5 l ∈ lrel) $ by all_elim [q10]
q12: $ G , w = T ⇒ ra_isort t2 t5 t6 ∈ lrel → ra_isort t4 t5 t6 ∈ lrel $ by all_elim [q11]
q13: $ G , w = T ⇒ ra_isort t2 t5 t6 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#3]
q14: $ G , w = T ⇒ ra_isort t4 t5 t6 ∈ lrel $ by imp_elim [q12, q13]
q15: $ G ⇒ ra_isort t4 t5 t6 ∈ lrel $ by isset_elim [#1, q14]

def b6_csy (J M u w r c h A N l: class) (.y .t .o: set): class = $ {y | ∀ t (ra_sty c h A y t ∈ lrel3 J → ∃ o (ra_isort t o l ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf N = nadd (fv nvf o) (cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) y w r))) ∧ etel u (dnf u M) y w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) y w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) y w r ∈ fseq b6_V)} $

lemma b6_sy_st (G: hyps) {o: set} (J M K S0: class) (u w r c h A N l z k s t5: set): $ G ⇒ crn s ⊆ b6_csy J M u w r c h A N l $ > $ G ⇒ z = ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ z ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ h = ⟨ K , S0 ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , S0 ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ K = kc_pi $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ K = kc_app $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ra_isort A N l ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_sty c h A z t5 ∈ lrel3 J $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ o (ra_isort t5 o l ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf N = nadd (fv nvf o) (cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) z w r))) ∧ etel u (dnf u M) z w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r ∈ fseq b6_V $
----
q1: $ G ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 (c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t5 = x8 ∧ ra_sty x1 x2 x3 x4 ⟨ kc_pi , scons x6 (scons x7 ∅) ⟩ ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_deq x1 x5 x5 x6 ∈ J ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x7 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) $ by lrel3_sty_cases [#11]
q2: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 $ by ax
q3: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ c = x1 $ by and_elim_l [q2]
q4: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 $ by and_elim_r [q2]
q5: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ h = x2 $ by and_elim_l [q4]
q6: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 $ by and_elim_r [q4]
q7: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ A = x3 $ by and_elim_l [q6]
q8: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 $ by and_elim_r [q6]
q9: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ z = x2 $ by and_elim_l [q8]
q10: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ t5 = x3 $ by and_elim_r [q8]
q11: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ h = ⟨ K , S0 ⟩ $ by weaken [#4]
q12: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ ⟨ K , S0 ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#5]
q13: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ ¬ K = kc_pi $ by weaken [#6]
q14: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ ¬ K = kc_app $ by weaken [#7]
q15: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#8]
q16: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#9]
q17: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ ra_isort A N l ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#10]
q18: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ x2 = h $ by eq_sym [q5]
q19: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ z = h $ by eq_trans [q9, q18]
q20: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ x3 = A $ by eq_sym [q7]
q21: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ t5 = A $ by eq_trans [q10, q20]
q22: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ A = t5 $ by eq_sym [q21]
q23: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ N = N $ by eq_refl
q24: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ l = l $ by eq_refl
q25: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ ra_isort A N l = ra_isort t5 N l $ by ra_isort_eq [q22, q23, q24]
q26: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ ra_isort t5 N l ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q25, q17]
q27: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ z = ⟨ K , S0 ⟩ $ by eq_trans [q19, q11]
q28: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ sarg u (dnf u M) ⟨ K , S0 ⟩ w r = ∅ $ by sarg_other [q12, q13, q14, q15, q16]
q29: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
q30: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ r = r $ by eq_refl
q31: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r = sarg u (dnf u M) ⟨ K , S0 ⟩ w r $ by sarg_eq [q27, q29, q30]
q32: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r = ∅ $ by eq_trans [q31, q28]
q33: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = x2 ∧ t5 = x3 ⇒ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) z w r) = cdm ∅ $ by cdm_eq [q32]
