q220: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t5 = x8 ∧ ra_sty x1 x2 x3 x4 ⟨ kc_pi , scons x6 (scons x7 ∅) ⟩ ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_deq x1 x5 x5 x6 ∈ J ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x7 x5 x8 ∈ lrel , v = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x6 (scons x7 ∅) ⟩ , ra_isort v o l ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf N = nadd (fv nvf o) (cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) x4 w r)) , v = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x0 (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ o = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x9 ∧ ra_isort d e x9 ∈ lrel , y = sarg u (dnf u M) x4 w r , q = da (fv (dnf u M) x5) w r ⇒ sarg u (dnf u M) z w r = scons q y $ by eq_trans [q219, q218]
q221: $ G , c = x1 ∧ h = x2 ∧ A = x3 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ t5 = x8 ∧ ra_sty x1 x2 x3 x4 ⟨ kc_pi , scons x6 (scons x7 ∅) ⟩ ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_deq x1 x5 x5 x6 ∈ J ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x7 x5 x8 ∈ lrel , v = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x6 (scons x7 ∅) ⟩ , ra_isort v o l ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf N = nadd (fv nvf o) (cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) x4 w r)) , v = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x0 (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ o = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x9 ∧ ra_isort d e x9 ∈ lrel , y = sarg u (dnf u M) x4 w r , q = da (fv (dnf u M) x5) w r ⇒ cdm (sarg u (dnf u M) z w r) = cdm (scons q y) $ by cdm_eq [q220]
