a0: $ G , t1 = x0 ∧ j = x1 ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ t4 = x2 ∧ e = x3 ∧ f = x3 ⇒ t1 = x0 ∧ j = x1 ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ t4 = x2 ∧ e = x3 ∧ f = x3 $ by ax
