m6: $ G , t1 = x0 ∧ j = x4 ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ t4 = x2 ∧ e = x3 ∧ f = x6 ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst x2 x3 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x0 (scons x4 ∅) ⟩ x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x0 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x1 x2 x5 x6 ∈ lrel ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) f w (scat p s) = etel u (dnf u M) e w (scat p (scat z s)) $ by isset_elim [m5, m4]
