q33: $ G , z ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ esat u E2 T w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E2 A) w q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ z ∊ fseq u $ by and_elim_l [q32]
q34: $ G , z ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ esat u E2 T w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E2 A) w q ∧ r = scons x q)} ⇒ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ esat u E2 T w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E2 A) w q ∧ z = scons x q) $ by and_elim_r [q32]
