q45: $ G , z ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ esat u E2 T w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E2 A) w q ∧ r = scons x q)} , q ∊ esat u E2 T w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E2 A) w q ∧ z = scons x q ⇒ da (fv E A) w q = da (fv E2 A) w q $ by imp_elim [q44, q42]
q46: $ G , z ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ esat u E2 T w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E2 A) w q ∧ r = scons x q)} , q ∊ esat u E2 T w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E2 A) w q ∧ z = scons x q ⇒ da (fv E2 A) w q = da (fv E A) w q $ by eq_sym [q45]
q47: $ G , z ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ esat u E2 T w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E2 A) w q ∧ r = scons x q)} , q ∊ esat u E2 T w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E2 A) w q ∧ z = scons x q ⇒ x ∊ da (fv E A) w q $ by welc_eq [q46, q38]
q48: $ G , z ∊ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ esat u E2 T w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E2 A) w q ∧ r = scons x q)} , q ∊ esat u E2 T w ∧ x ∊ da (fv E2 A) w q ∧ z = scons x q ⇒ x ∊ da (fv E A) w q ∧ z = scons x q $ by and_intro [q47, q39]
