q20: $ G , z ∊ sarg U E T2 W2 R2 , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W2 R2 ∧ z ∈ a ⇒ etel U E T W R = etel U E T2 W2 R2 $ by weaken [#1]
