q44: $ G , h = scat t6 X , l = scat t6 Y , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ z = x6 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x5 x6 ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_closed x5 x6 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [q42]
