q59: $ G , h = scat t6 X , l = scat t6 Y , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ z = x6 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x5 x6 ∈ lrel ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ fv nvf x5 → fv h i = fv l i) $ by fv_agree_eq [q53, q55, q57, q58]
q60: $ G , h = scat t6 X , l = scat t6 Y , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ z = x6 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x5 x6 ∈ lrel ⇒ x6 = z $ by eq_sym [q41]
