q263: $ G , h = scat t6 X , l = scat t6 Y , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x6 (scons x7 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x5 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x7 ∈ lrel , y ∊ dt u M x6 w l , a = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ , b = scons y t6 , f = ap t7 y ⇒ scat (scons y t6) X = scons y h $ by eq_trans [q255, q262]
