q338: $ G , h = scat t6 X , l = scat t6 Y , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x6 (scons x7 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x5 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x7 ∈ lrel ⇒ ∀ y (y ∊ dt u M x6 w l → fv (cgr e (dt u M x7 w (scons e l))) y = dt u M x7 w (scons y l)) ↔ ∀ x0 (x0 ∊ dt u M x6 w l → fv (cgr e (dt u M x7 w (scons e l))) x0 = dt u M x7 w (scons x0 l)) $ by weaken [q337]
