q5: $ G , e = ∅ , a = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , b = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t3 t4 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#1]
q6: $ G , e = ∅ , a = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , b = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ a = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ $ by weaken [q3]
