q28: $ G , e = ∅ , a = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , b = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ nvf = nvf $ by eq_refl
