q32: $ G , e = ∅ , a = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , b = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ fv nvf a = suc ∅ $ by eq_trans [q30, q31]
