q50: $ G , e = ∅ , a = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , b = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , o = scons x e ⇒ ra_lift a b t3 t4 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [q12]
q51: $ G , e = ∅ , a = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , b = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , o = scons x e ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#2]
q52: $ G , e = ∅ , a = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , b = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , o = scons x e ⇒ cdm e = fv nvf b $ by weaken [q27]
q53: $ G , e = ∅ , a = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , b = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , o = scons x e ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) t4 w (scat e (scat o r)) = etel u (dnf u M) t3 w (scat e r) $ by lrel_lift_etel [q50, q51, q35, q52, q39, q48, q49]
q54: $ G , e = ∅ , a = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , b = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , o = scons x e ⇒ r = r $ by eq_refl
