lemma b6_pis0_etel (G: hyps) {x g2 s2 a2 q: set} (M: class) (u w t1 t2 t3 f g t a: set): $ G ⇒ ra_pis t1 t2 t3 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ t1 ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx $ > $ G ⇒ t2 ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t3 w ∅ $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w q ∧ f = scat x q) $
----
q1: $ G ⇒ isset ∅ $ by ax_empty
q2: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ e = ∅ $ by ax
q3: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ ∅ = e $ by eq_sym [q2]
q4: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq u $ by fseq_empty
q5: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ e ∈ fseq u $ by wcel_eq_l [q3, q4]
q6: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ e ∊ fseq u $ by wcel_welc [q5]
q7: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ t3 = t3 $ by eq_refl
q8: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
q9: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ ∅ = e $ by eq_sym [q2]
q10: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) t3 w ∅ = etel u (dnf u M) t3 w e $ by etel_eq [q7, q8, q9]
q11: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t3 w ∅ $ by weaken [#6]
q12: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t3 w e $ by wcel_eq_r [q10, q11]
q13: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ ra_pis t1 t2 t3 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#1]
q14: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ uadm u $ by weaken [#2]
q15: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ t1 ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx $ by weaken [#3]
q16: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ t2 ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#4]
q17: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#5]
q18: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) $ by lrel_pis_etel [q13, q14, q15, q16, q17, q6, q12]
q19: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ eagv u (dsh u M e) (dnf u M) $ by b6_eagv_dsh0 [q2]
q20: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 $ by ax
q21: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w $ by and_elim_l [q20]
q22: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 $ by and_elim_r [q20]
q23: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 $ by and_elim_l [q22]
q24: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ f = scat x5 x9 $ by and_elim_r [q22]
q25: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ t1 ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx $ by weaken [#3]
q26: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ t1 ∈ trees ω $ by lsig_ofsort_trees [q25]
q27: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ t2 ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#4]
q28: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ t2 ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [q27]
q29: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ eagv u (dsh u M e) (dnf u M) $ by weaken [q19]
q30: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w = esat u (dnf u M) t1 w $ by esat_agv [q26, q29]
q31: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 = etel u (dnf u M) t2 w x9 $ by etel_agv [q28, q29]
q32: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ x9 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w $ by welc_eq [q30, q21]
q33: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w x9 $ by wcel_eq_r [q31, q23]
