q35: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ x9 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 $ by and_intro [q32, q34]
q36: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w q ∧ f = scat x5 q) $ by ex_intro [q35]
