q39: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w q ∧ f = scat x5 q) $ by ex_intro [q38]
q40: $ G , e = ∅ , x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9 ⇒ ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w q ∧ f = scat x q) $ by ex_intro [q39]
q41: $ G , e = ∅ , ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) ⇒ ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) $ by ax
q42: $ G , e = ∅ , ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) ⇒ ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w q ∧ f = scat x q) $ by ex_elim [q41, q40]
q43: $ G , e = ∅ , ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) ⇒ ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) $ by ax
q44: $ G , e = ∅ , ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) ⇒ ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w q ∧ f = scat x q) $ by ex_elim [q43, q42]
q45: $ G , e = ∅ , ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) ⇒ ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) $ by ax
q46: $ G , e = ∅ , ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) ⇒ ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w q ∧ f = scat x q) $ by ex_elim [q45, q44]
q47: $ G , e = ∅ , ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) ⇒ ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) $ by ax
q48: $ G , e = ∅ , ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) ⇒ ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w q ∧ f = scat x q) $ by ex_elim [q47, q46]
q49: $ G , e = ∅ , ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) ⇒ ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) $ by ax
q50: $ G , e = ∅ , ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) ⇒ ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w q ∧ f = scat x q) $ by ex_elim [q49, q48]
q51: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (x9 ∊ esat u (dsh u M e) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dsh u M e) t2 w x9 ∧ f = scat x5 x9) → ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w q ∧ f = scat x q) $ by imp_intro [q50]
q52: $ G , e = ∅ ⇒ ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w q ∧ f = scat x q) $ by imp_elim [q51, q18]
q53: $ G ⇒ ∃ x ∃ g2 ∃ s2 ∃ a2 ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t1 w ∧ ⟨ x , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ s2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t2 w q ∧ f = scat x q) $ by isset_elim [q1, q52]

lemma b6_sinst0_sem (G: hyps) {i b: set} (M: class) (u w t1 t3 t4 t5 t6 p s v: set): $ G ⇒ ra_sinst t1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t3 t4 t5 t6 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ t1 ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ p ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ cdm p = fv nvf t4 $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ v ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ cdm v = fv nvf t3 $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm v → b ∊ trees ω → fv nvf b = i → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons t1 (scons b ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = fv v i) $ > $ G ⇒ dt u M t6 w (scat p s) = dt u M t5 w (scat p (scat v s)) $
----
q1: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ $ by ax
q2: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ ra_sinst t1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t3 t4 t5 t6 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#1]
q3: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [q1]
q4: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ t1 = t1 $ by eq_refl
q5: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ t3 = t3 $ by eq_refl
q6: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ t4 = t4 $ by eq_refl
q7: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ t5 = t5 $ by eq_refl
q8: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ t6 = t6 $ by eq_refl
q9: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ ra_sinst t1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t3 t4 t5 t6 = ra_sinst t1 z t3 t4 t5 t6 $ by ra_sinst_eq [q4, q3, q5, q6, q7, q8]
q10: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ ra_sinst t1 z t3 t4 t5 t6 ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q9, q2]
q11: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ nvf = nvf $ by eq_refl
q12: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ fv nvf z = fv nvf ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ $ by fv_eq [q11, q1]
q13: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ fv nvf ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ = ∅ $ by nvf_nz
q14: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ fv nvf z = ∅ $ by eq_trans [q12, q13]
q15: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ cdm v = fv nvf t3 $ by weaken [#9]
q16: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ v ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#8]
q17: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ cdm v ∈ ω $ by fseq_len [q16]
q18: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ cdm v = cdm v $ by eq_refl
q19: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ nadd (fv nvf z) (cdm v) = nadd ∅ (cdm v) $ by nadd_eq [q14, q18]
q20: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ nadd ∅ (cdm v) = cdm v $ by b6_zero_nadd [q17]
q21: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ nadd ∅ (cdm v) = fv nvf t3 $ by eq_trans [q20, q15]
q22: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ nadd (fv nvf z) (cdm v) = fv nvf t3 $ by eq_trans [q19, q21]
q23: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , i ∊ cdm v , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = nadd (fv nvf z) i ⇒ i ∊ cdm v $ by ax
q24: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , i ∊ cdm v , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = nadd (fv nvf z) i ⇒ i ∈ cdm v $ by welc_wcel [q23]
q25: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , i ∊ cdm v , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = nadd (fv nvf z) i ⇒ cdm v ∈ ω $ by weaken [q17]
q26: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , i ∊ cdm v , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = nadd (fv nvf z) i ⇒ i ∈ ω $ by omega_elem_omega_c [q24, q25]
q27: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , i ∊ cdm v , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = nadd (fv nvf z) i ⇒ fv nvf z = ∅ $ by weaken [q14]
q28: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , i ∊ cdm v , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = nadd (fv nvf z) i ⇒ i = i $ by eq_refl
q29: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , i ∊ cdm v , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = nadd (fv nvf z) i ⇒ nadd (fv nvf z) i = nadd ∅ i $ by nadd_eq [q27, q28]
