q32: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , i ∊ cdm v , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = nadd (fv nvf z) i ⇒ nadd ∅ i = i $ by b6_zero_nadd [q26]
