q41: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , i ∊ cdm v , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = nadd (fv nvf z) i ⇒ dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons t1 (scons b ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = fv v i $ by imp_elim [q40, q33]
