q75: $ G , ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (t1 = x1 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ t21 = x6 ∧ ra_ind_data x1 x2 x3 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x4 x5 x7 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x7 x6 x9 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 (t1 = x1 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ t21 = x6 ∧ ra_ind_data x1 x2 x3 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x4 x5 x7 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x7 x6 x9 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
