lemma b6_res_tail (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w t5 t13 t14 t15 t16 t17 t18 t19 t20 o0 h0 f8 g8 s8 a8 tp tt: set): $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ ra_tys_closed t13 t14 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_nth_ty t14 t5 t15 t16 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_pis t13 t15 t17 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_lift t20 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t17 t18 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ t13 ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx $ > $ G ⇒ t15 ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ o0 ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ cdm o0 = fv nvf t20 $ > $ G ⇒ t19 ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ h0 = scat o0 t19 $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f8 , ⟨ g8 , ⟨ s8 , a8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t18 w h0 $ > $ G ⇒ tp = t13 $ > $ G ⇒ tt = t14 $ > $ G ⇒ f8 ∊ b6_Qc u M w tp tt t5 $
----
q1: $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) t18 w (scat o0 t19) = etel u (dnf u M) t17 w t19 $ by b6_lift0_etel [#6, #2, #9, #10, #11]
q2: $ G ⇒ t18 = t18 $ by eq_refl
q3: $ G ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
q4: $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) t18 w h0 = etel u (dnf u M) t18 w (scat o0 t19) $ by etel_eq [q2, q3, #12]
q5: $ G ⇒ ⟨ f8 , ⟨ g8 , ⟨ s8 , a8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t18 w (scat o0 t19) $ by wcel_eq_r [q4, #13]
q6: $ G ⇒ ⟨ f8 , ⟨ g8 , ⟨ s8 , a8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t17 w t19 $ by wcel_eq_r [q1, q5]
q7: $ G ⇒ ra_closed ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t17 ∈ lrel $ by b6_tc_nth [#3, #4, #5]
q8: $ G ⇒ kr_pis ∈ ω $ by kr_pis_omega
q9: $ G ⇒ isset kr_pis $ by wcel_isset [q8]
q10: $ G ⇒ t13 ∊ trees ω ∧ t15 ∊ trees ω ∧ t17 ∊ trees ω $ by lrel_args3 [#5, q9]
q11: $ G ⇒ t13 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [q10]
q12: $ G ⇒ t15 ∊ trees ω ∧ t17 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [q10]
q13: $ G ⇒ t15 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [q12]
q14: $ G ⇒ t17 ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [q12]
q15: $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) t17 w t19 = etel u (dnf u M) t17 w ∅ $ by b6_closed0_etel [q7, q14, #2, #11]
q16: $ G ⇒ ⟨ f8 , ⟨ g8 , ⟨ s8 , a8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t17 w ∅ $ by wcel_eq_r [q15, q6]
q17: $ G ⇒ ∃ y ∃ b ∃ c ∃ d ∃ f (f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f) $ by b6_pis0_etel [#5, #1, #7, #8, #2, q16]
q18: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f $ by ax
q19: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w $ by and_elim_l [q18]
q20: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f $ by and_elim_r [q18]
q21: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f $ by and_elim_l [q20]
q22: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ f8 = scat y f $ by and_elim_r [q20]
q23: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ ra_nth_ty t14 t5 t15 t16 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#4]
q24: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ tt = t14 $ by weaken [#15]
q25: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ t14 = tt $ by eq_sym [q24]
q26: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ t5 = t5 $ by eq_refl
q27: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ t15 = t15 $ by eq_refl
q28: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ t16 = t16 $ by eq_refl
q29: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ ra_nth_ty t14 t5 t15 t16 = ra_nth_ty tt t5 t15 t16 $ by ra_nth_ty_eq [q25, q26, q27, q28]
q30: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ ra_nth_ty tt t5 t15 t16 ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q29, q23]
q31: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ tp = t13 $ by weaken [#14]
q32: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ t13 = tp $ by eq_sym [q31]
q33: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
q34: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w = esat u (dnf u M) tp w $ by esat_eq [q32, q33]
q35: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) tp w $ by welc_eq [q34, q19]
q36: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ ∃ a (⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f) $ by ex_intro [q21]
q37: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f) $ by ex_intro [q36]
q38: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ y , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f) $ by ex_intro [q37]
q39: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ f8 = scat y f ∧ ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ y , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f) $ by and_intro [q22, q38]
q40: $ G , f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) t13 w ∧ ⟨ y , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , d ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f ∧ f8 = scat y f ⇒ f ∊ esat u (dnf u M) tp w ∧ f8 = scat y f ∧ ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ y , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t15 w f) $ by and_intro [q35, q39]
