q187: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr $ by weaken [#28]
q188: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ⟨ p5 , ⟨ p6 , ⟨ p7 , p8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z w (scat f0 (scat t6 t7)) $ by weaken [#29]
q189: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ x8 = x8 $ by eq_refl
