q199: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y = ra_sinst t1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t2 x8 x9 y $ by ra_sinst_eq [q153, q195, q154, q196, q197, q198]
q200: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ra_sinst t1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q199, q141]
q201: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ∅ = ∅ $ by eq_refl
q202: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ scons x6 ∅ = scons c0 ∅ $ by scons_eq [q158, q201]
q203: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ y = y $ by eq_refl
q204: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ scons y (scons x6 ∅) = scons y (scons c0 ∅) $ by scons_eq [q203, q202]
q205: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ kc_cons = kc_cons $ by eq_refl
q206: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ = ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons c0 ∅) ⟩ $ by opair_eq [q205, q204]
q207: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ∅ = ∅ $ by eq_refl
q208: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ scons x7 ∅ = scons d0 ∅ $ by scons_eq [q159, q207]
q209: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ kc_s = kc_s $ by eq_refl
q210: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ = ⟨ kc_s , scons d0 ∅ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [q209, q208]
q211: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ x0 = x0 $ by eq_refl
q212: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 = ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons c0 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons d0 ∅ ⟩ x0 $ by ra_cwf_eq [q153, q154, q155, q156, q157, q206, q210, q211]
q213: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons c0 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons d0 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J $ by wcel_eq_l [q212, q152]
q214: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ kc_pi ∈ ω $ by kc_pi_omega
q215: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ isset kc_pi $ by wcel_isset [q214]
q216: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ isset ∅ $ by ax_empty
q217: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ isset (scons x0 ∅) $ by scons_set [q216]
q218: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ isset (scons x9 (scons x0 ∅)) $ by scons_set [q217]
