q251: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f h ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 j l n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty n x5 r a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis l r b ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ b e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ e h g ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f h ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 j l n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty n x5 r a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis l r b ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ b e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ e h g ∈ lrel3 J $ by ax
