q387: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ y ∃ d ∃ c (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ h ∃ j ∃ l ∃ n ∃ r ∃ a ∃ b ∃ e ∃ g (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f h ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 j l n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty n x5 r a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis l r b ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ b e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ e h g ∈ lrel3 J) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ y ∃ d ∃ c (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ⇒ p8 ∊ b6_Qc u M w tp tt t5 $ by weaken [q250]
q388: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ y ∃ d ∃ c (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 y ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 y y ⟨ kc_srt , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 c ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ d x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ h ∃ j ∃ l ∃ n ∃ r ∃ a ∃ b ∃ e ∃ g (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f h ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 j l n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty n x5 r a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis l r b ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ b e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ e h g ∈ lrel3 J) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ h ∃ j ∃ l ∃ n ∃ r ∃ a ∃ b ∃ e ∃ g (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c0 = x6 ∧ d0 = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f h ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 j l n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty n x5 r a ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis l r b ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ b e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ e h g ∈ lrel3 J) ⇒ p8 ∊ b6_Qc u M w tp tt t5 $ by weaken [q385]
