q6: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b6_ccw J M u w t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t9 tp tt , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , c ∊ trees ω , d ∊ trees ω , f ∊ fseq u , cdm f = fv nvf d , scat f (scat t6 t9) ∈ sat u M c w , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z w (scat f (scat t6 t7)) ⇒ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J $ by ax
