q8: $ G , z = ⟨ tj , ⟨ ta , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , iprt d x1 x2 , ityf d x0 x3 , x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 , z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w $ by ax
q9: $ G , z = ⟨ tj , ⟨ ta , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , iprt d x1 x2 , ityf d x0 x3 , x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 , z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 $ by ax
q10: $ G , z = ⟨ tj , ⟨ ta , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , iprt d x1 x2 , ityf d x0 x3 , x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 , z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
