q14: $ G , z = ⟨ tj , ⟨ ta , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , iprt d x1 x2 , ityf d x0 x3 , x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 , z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ tq = x1 $ by and_elim_l [q13]
q15: $ G , z = ⟨ tj , ⟨ ta , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , iprt d x1 x2 , ityf d x0 x3 , x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 , z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ra_clen tq tnp ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#3]
q16: $ G , z = ⟨ tj , ⟨ ta , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , iprt d x1 x2 , ityf d x0 x3 , x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 , z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ tnp = tnp $ by eq_refl
q17: $ G , z = ⟨ tj , ⟨ ta , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , iprt d x1 x2 , ityf d x0 x3 , x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 , z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ra_clen tq tnp = ra_clen x1 tnp $ by ra_clen_eq [q14, q16]
q18: $ G , z = ⟨ tj , ⟨ ta , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , iprt d x1 x2 , ityf d x0 x3 , x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 , z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ra_clen x1 tnp ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q17, q15]
q19: $ G , z = ⟨ tj , ⟨ ta , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , iprt d x1 x2 , ityf d x0 x3 , x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 , z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ d ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind $ by weaken [#1]
