q63: $ G , z = ⟨ tj , ⟨ ta , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , iprt d x1 x2 , ityf d x0 x3 , x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 , z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ra_isort x3 tm tl ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q62, q59]
q64: $ G , z = ⟨ tj , ⟨ ta , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , iprt d x1 x2 , ityf d x0 x3 , x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 , z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm x5 = fv nvf tm $ by b6_isort_fields [q63, q9]
q65: $ G , z = ⟨ tj , ⟨ ta , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , iprt d x1 x2 , ityf d x0 x3 , x4 ∊ esat u (dnf u M) x1 w , ⟨ x5 , ⟨ x6 , ⟨ x7 , x8 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x3 w x4 , z = ⟨ x0 , ⟨ scat x5 x4 , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ cdm ta = cdm (scat x5 x4) $ by cdm_eq [q52]
