q95: $ G , ra_nidx d o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , d = x0 ∧ o = x4 ∧ m = x5 ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 x5 x8 ∈ lrel , e ∊ apn (fv tX (fv nvf o)) q , v = nest q e , y ∊ ap (ixs d w tx) (fv nvf o) ∧ v ∊ y , z = ⟨ fv nvf o , y ⟩ , j ∊ intys d ∧ z = ⟨ j , ient d w tx j ⟩ , igate u (dnf u M) d j w ⇒ isset e $ by isset_var
q96: $ G , ra_nidx d o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , d = x0 ∧ o = x4 ∧ m = x5 ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 x5 x8 ∈ lrel , e ∊ apn (fv tX (fv nvf o)) q , v = nest q e , y ∊ ap (ixs d w tx) (fv nvf o) ∧ v ∊ y , z = ⟨ fv nvf o , y ⟩ , j ∊ intys d ∧ z = ⟨ j , ient d w tx j ⟩ , igate u (dnf u M) d j w ⇒ e ∈ apn (ityv u (dnf u M) d j w) q ↔ nest q e ∈ ityv u (dnf u M) d j w $ by apn_wcel [q95]
q97: $ G , ra_nidx d o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , d = x0 ∧ o = x4 ∧ m = x5 ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 x5 x8 ∈ lrel , e ∊ apn (fv tX (fv nvf o)) q , v = nest q e , y ∊ ap (ixs d w tx) (fv nvf o) ∧ v ∊ y , z = ⟨ fv nvf o , y ⟩ , j ∊ intys d ∧ z = ⟨ j , ient d w tx j ⟩ , igate u (dnf u M) d j w ⇒ e ∈ apn (ityv u (dnf u M) d j w) q $ by bi_elim_r [q96, q94]
q98: $ G , ra_nidx d o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , d = x0 ∧ o = x4 ∧ m = x5 ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 x5 x8 ∈ lrel , e ∊ apn (fv tX (fv nvf o)) q , v = nest q e , y ∊ ap (ixs d w tx) (fv nvf o) ∧ v ∊ y , z = ⟨ fv nvf o , y ⟩ , j ∊ intys d ∧ z = ⟨ j , ient d w tx j ⟩ , igate u (dnf u M) d j w ⇒ fv (scat tv tr) (fv nvf o) = ityv u (dnf u M) d j w $ by weaken [q82]
