q119: $ G , ra_nidx d o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , d = x0 ∧ o = x4 ∧ m = x5 ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 x5 x8 ∈ lrel , e ∊ apn (fv tX (fv nvf o)) q , v = nest q e , y ∊ ap (ixs d w tx) (fv nvf o) ∧ v ∊ y , z = ⟨ fv nvf o , y ⟩ , j ∊ intys d ∧ z = ⟨ j , ient d w tx j ⟩ , ¬ igate u (dnf u M) d j w , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ tx ∧ ((iprop d j w ∧ v = nest a ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop d j w ∧ v = nest a x)) ⇒ tx ⊆ b10_S u (dnf u M) d w $ by weaken [#5]
q120: $ G , ra_nidx d o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , d = x0 ∧ o = x4 ∧ m = x5 ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 x5 x8 ∈ lrel , e ∊ apn (fv tX (fv nvf o)) q , v = nest q e , y ∊ ap (ixs d w tx) (fv nvf o) ∧ v ∊ y , z = ⟨ fv nvf o , y ⟩ , j ∊ intys d ∧ z = ⟨ j , ient d w tx j ⟩ , ¬ igate u (dnf u M) d j w , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ tx ∧ ((iprop d j w ∧ v = nest a ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop d j w ∧ v = nest a x)) ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ b10_S u (dnf u M) d w $ by wcel_subset [q119, q117]
q121: $ G , ra_nidx d o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , d = x0 ∧ o = x4 ∧ m = x5 ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 x5 x8 ∈ lrel , e ∊ apn (fv tX (fv nvf o)) q , v = nest q e , y ∊ ap (ixs d w tx) (fv nvf o) ∧ v ∊ y , z = ⟨ fv nvf o , y ⟩ , j ∊ intys d ∧ z = ⟨ j , ient d w tx j ⟩ , ¬ igate u (dnf u M) d j w , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ tx ∧ ((iprop d j w ∧ v = nest a ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop d j w ∧ v = nest a x)) ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ itc u (dnf u M) d w $ by b10_S_elim [q120]
q122: $ G , ra_nidx d o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , d = x0 ∧ o = x4 ∧ m = x5 ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 x5 x8 ∈ lrel , e ∊ apn (fv tX (fv nvf o)) q , v = nest q e , y ∊ ap (ixs d w tx) (fv nvf o) ∧ v ∊ y , z = ⟨ fv nvf o , y ⟩ , j ∊ intys d ∧ z = ⟨ j , ient d w tx j ⟩ , ¬ igate u (dnf u M) d j w , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ tx ∧ ((iprop d j w ∧ v = nest a ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop d j w ∧ v = nest a x)) ⇒ isset ∅ $ by ax_empty
