q114: $ G , ∃ x0 ∃ x3 ∃ x1 ∃ x4 ∃ x2 ∃ x5 (tT = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x3 (scons x4 (scons x2 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x0 ∧ t4 = x1 ∧ ra_nth_ty x2 x5 x0 x1 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x0 ∃ x3 ∃ x1 ∃ x4 ∃ x2 ∃ x5 (tT = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x3 (scons x4 (scons x2 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x0 ∧ t4 = x1 ∧ ra_nth_ty x2 x5 x0 x1 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
