q73: $ G , y ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm y = intys d ∧ ∀ k (k ∊ intys d → fv y k = ityv u (dnf u (mcv H)) d k w) , x = ixs d w tx ⇒ scat y tr ∈ fseq u $ by scat_fseq [q71, q72]
