q75: $ G , y ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm y = intys d ∧ ∀ k (k ∊ intys d → fv y k = ityv u (dnf u (mcv H)) d k w) , x = ixs d w tx , v = scat y tr ⇒ v = scat y tr $ by ax
