q98: $ G , y ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm y = intys d ∧ ∀ k (k ∊ intys d → fv y k = ityv u (dnf u (mcv H)) d k w) , x = ixs d w tx , v = scat y tr , e = ∅ ⇒ e ∈ fseq u $ by wcel_eq_l [q96, q97]
q99: $ G , y ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm y = intys d ∧ ∀ k (k ∊ intys d → fv y k = ityv u (dnf u (mcv H)) d k w) , x = ixs d w tx , v = scat y tr , e = ∅ ⇒ e ∊ fseq u $ by wcel_welc [q98]
