q169: $ G , y ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm y = intys d ∧ ∀ k (k ∊ intys d → fv y k = ityv u (dnf u (mcv H)) d k w) , x = ixs d w tx , v = scat y tr , e = ∅ , ra_nth_ty tT ti b c ∈ lrel ∧ q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) tP w ∧ sa = scat a q ∧ ∃ g ∃ t ∃ h (⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q) , ⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q ⇒ q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) tP w $ by weaken [q160]
q170: $ G , y ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm y = intys d ∧ ∀ k (k ∊ intys d → fv y k = ityv u (dnf u (mcv H)) d k w) , x = ixs d w tx , v = scat y tr , e = ∅ , ra_nth_ty tT ti b c ∈ lrel ∧ q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) tP w ∧ sa = scat a q ∧ ∃ g ∃ t ∃ h (⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q) , ⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q ⇒ q ∈ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) tP w $ by welc_wcel [q169]
