q172: $ G , y ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm y = intys d ∧ ∀ k (k ∊ intys d → fv y k = ityv u (dnf u (mcv H)) d k w) , x = ixs d w tx , v = scat y tr , e = ∅ , ra_nth_ty tT ti b c ∈ lrel ∧ q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) tP w ∧ sa = scat a q ∧ ∃ g ∃ t ∃ h (⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q) , ⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q ⇒ sa = scat a q $ by weaken [q162]
q173: $ G , y ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm y = intys d ∧ ∀ k (k ∊ intys d → fv y k = ityv u (dnf u (mcv H)) d k w) , x = ixs d w tx , v = scat y tr , e = ∅ , ra_nth_ty tT ti b c ∈ lrel ∧ q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) tP w ∧ sa = scat a q ∧ ∃ g ∃ t ∃ h (⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q) , ⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q ⇒ scat a q = sa $ by eq_sym [q172]
q174: $ G , y ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm y = intys d ∧ ∀ k (k ∊ intys d → fv y k = ityv u (dnf u (mcv H)) d k w) , x = ixs d w tx , v = scat y tr , e = ∅ , ra_nth_ty tT ti b c ∈ lrel ∧ q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) tP w ∧ sa = scat a q ∧ ∃ g ∃ t ∃ h (⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q) , ⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q ⇒ scons ∅ ∅ = scons ∅ ∅ $ by eq_refl
q175: $ G , y ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm y = intys d ∧ ∀ k (k ∊ intys d → fv y k = ityv u (dnf u (mcv H)) d k w) , x = ixs d w tx , v = scat y tr , e = ∅ , ra_nth_ty tT ti b c ∈ lrel ∧ q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) tP w ∧ sa = scat a q ∧ ∃ g ∃ t ∃ h (⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q) , ⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q ⇒ ⟨ scat a q , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ = ⟨ sa , scons ∅ ∅ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [q173, q174]
q176: $ G , y ∊ fseq u ∧ cdm y = intys d ∧ ∀ k (k ∊ intys d → fv y k = ityv u (dnf u (mcv H)) d k w) , x = ixs d w tx , v = scat y tr , e = ∅ , ra_nth_ty tT ti b c ∈ lrel ∧ q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) tP w ∧ sa = scat a q ∧ ∃ g ∃ t ∃ h (⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q) , ⟨ a , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , h ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w q ⇒ tj = tj $ by eq_refl
