q36: $ G , iprt d p t ∧ fv nvf n = tj ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = tm ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m tk ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_nth_ty t n f e = ra_nth_ty tT n f e $ by ra_nth_ty_eq [q32, q33, q34, q35]
q37: $ G , iprt d p t ∧ fv nvf n = tj ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = tm ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m tk ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_nth_ty tT n f e ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q36, q25]
q38: $ G , iprt d p t ∧ fv nvf n = tj ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = tm ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m tk ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_tys_wf d tn tnp tl tz tG2 tT ∈ lrel3 J $ by weaken [#16]
q39: $ G , iprt d p t ∧ fv nvf n = tj ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = tm ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m tk ∈ lrel ⇒ tz ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [q15]
q40: $ G , iprt d p t ∧ fv nvf n = tj ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = tm ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m tk ∈ lrel ⇒ ∃ i (fv nvf i = nadd (fv nvf tz) (fv nvf n) ∧ ra_ctors_wf d tn tnp tl i tG2 e ∈ lrel3 J) $ by lrel3_tys_wf_nth [q38, q37, q39]
