q43: $ G , iprt d p t ∧ fv nvf n = tj ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = tm ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m tk ∈ lrel , fv nvf i = nadd (fv nvf tz) (fv nvf n) ∧ ra_ctors_wf d tn tnp tl i tG2 e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ ra_ctors_wf d tn tnp tl i tG2 e ∈ lrel3 J $ by and_elim_r [q41]
q44: $ G , iprt d p t ∧ fv nvf n = tj ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = tm ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m tk ∈ lrel , fv nvf i = nadd (fv nvf tz) (fv nvf n) ∧ ra_ctors_wf d tn tnp tl i tG2 e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ fv nvf tz = ∅ $ by weaken [q19]
q45: $ G , iprt d p t ∧ fv nvf n = tj ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = tm ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m tk ∈ lrel , fv nvf i = nadd (fv nvf tz) (fv nvf n) ∧ ra_ctors_wf d tn tnp tl i tG2 e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ fv nvf n = fv nvf n $ by eq_refl
