q63: $ G , iprt d p t ∧ fv nvf n = tj ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = tm ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m tk ∈ lrel , fv nvf i = nadd (fv nvf tz) (fv nvf n) ∧ ra_ctors_wf d tn tnp tl i tG2 e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ tG2 = tG2 $ by eq_refl
q64: $ G , iprt d p t ∧ fv nvf n = tj ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = tm ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m tk ∈ lrel , fv nvf i = nadd (fv nvf tz) (fv nvf n) ∧ ra_ctors_wf d tn tnp tl i tG2 e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ tk = tk $ by eq_refl
