q67: $ G , iprt d p t ∧ fv nvf n = tj ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = tm ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m tk ∈ lrel , fv nvf i = nadd (fv nvf tz) (fv nvf n) ∧ ra_ctors_wf d tn tnp tl i tG2 e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ uadm u $ by weaken [#1]
q68: $ G , iprt d p t ∧ fv nvf n = tj ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = tm ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m tk ∈ lrel , fv nvf i = nadd (fv nvf tz) (fv nvf n) ∧ ra_ctors_wf d tn tnp tl i tG2 e ∈ lrel3 J ⇒ hty ⊆ H $ by weaken [#2]
