q6: $ G , iprt d q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q w , ictk d j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k w (scat p (ixs d w tx)) , a ∊ fseq u , tz = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ tz = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
q7: $ G , iprt d q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q w , ictk d j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k w (scat p (ixs d w tx)) , a ∊ fseq u , tz = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ uadm u $ by weaken [#1]
q8: $ G , iprt d q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q w , ictk d j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k w (scat p (ixs d w tx)) , a ∊ fseq u , tz = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ hty ⊆ H $ by weaken [#2]
q9: $ G , iprt d q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q w , ictk d j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k w (scat p (ixs d w tx)) , a ∊ fseq u , tz = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ functional H $ by weaken [#3]
