p9: $ (x ⊆ O ∧ x ∊ A ∧ z ∊ iphi0 A C E H J L x) ⟺ (x ⊆ P ∧ x ∊ B ∧ z ∊ iphi0 B D F I K N x) $ by and_congr [p2, p8]
p10: $ ∃ x (x ⊆ O ∧ x ∊ A ∧ z ∊ iphi0 A C E H J L x) ⟺ ∃ x (x ⊆ P ∧ x ∊ B ∧ z ∊ iphi0 B D F I K N x) $ by ex_congr [p9]
p11: $ iphi A C E H J L O ≐ iphi B D F I K N P $ by cab_congr [p10]

