r3b: $ G , q = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , i ∊ ω , v ∊ fseq u × u , v = ⟨ b , e ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u , e ∊ u , o ∊ ient D W (csn q) J , ⟨ J , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ csn q ∧ ((iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x)) , ¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x ⇒ x = e $ by weaken [n12]
r3: $ G , q = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , i ∊ ω , v ∊ fseq u × u , v = ⟨ b , e ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u , e ∊ u , o ∊ ient D W (csn q) J , ⟨ J , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ csn q ∧ ((iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x)) , ¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x ⇒ nest a x = nest b e $ by nest_eq [r3a, r3b]
r4: $ G , q = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , i ∊ ω , v ∊ fseq u × u , v = ⟨ b , e ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u , e ∊ u , o ∊ ient D W (csn q) J , ⟨ J , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ csn q ∧ ((iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x)) , ¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x ⇒ o = nest b e $ by eq_trans [r2, r3]
r5: $ G , q = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , i ∊ ω , v ∊ fseq u × u , v = ⟨ b , e ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u , e ∊ u , o ∊ ient D W (csn q) J , ⟨ J , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ csn q ∧ ((iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x)) , ¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x ⇒ o = nest b ∅ ∨ o = nest b e $ by or_intro_r [r4]
r6: $ G , q = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , i ∊ ω , v ∊ fseq u × u , v = ⟨ b , e ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u , e ∊ u , o ∊ ient D W (csn q) J , ⟨ J , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ csn q ∧ ((iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x)) , ¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x ⇒ o ∊ cpr (nest b ∅) (nest b e) $ by cpr_intro [r5]
n13: $ G , q = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , i ∊ ω , v ∊ fseq u × u , v = ⟨ b , e ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u , e ∊ u , o ∊ ient D W (csn q) J , ⟨ J , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ csn q ∧ ((iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x)) ⇒ o ∊ cpr (nest b ∅) (nest b e) $ by or_elim [n5, p6, r6]
n13a: $ G , q = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , i ∊ ω , v ∊ fseq u × u , v = ⟨ b , e ⟩ , b ∊ fseq u , e ∊ u , o ∊ ient D W (csn q) J , ∃ x (⟨ J , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ csn q ∧ ((iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x))) ⇒ ∃ x (⟨ J , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ csn q ∧ ((iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D J W ∧ o = nest a x))) $ by ax
