t1: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_ias u M w t1 t3 r A0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ b7_ias u M w t1 t3 r A0 $ by cab_intro [t0b]
