lemma b7_indapp_shape {m x: set} (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w r t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6: set): $ G ⇒ ra_indapp t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ t5 ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ m ∃ x (ra_nidx t1 t6 m ∈ lrel ∧ x ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ cdm x = fv nvf m ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) t5 w r = scat x (swin r (fv nvf t4) (fv nvf t3))) $
----
a0: $ G ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ l (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = l ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ l x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 l ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_indapp_cases [#1]
b: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = l ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ l x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 l ∈ lrel ⇒ t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = l ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ l x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 l ∈ lrel $ by ax
c0: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = l ∧ t6 = x5 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ l x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x6 x5 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x5 ∅ ⟩ x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x4 x3 x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x1 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x6 x8 x0 l ∈ lrel ⇒ t1 = x1 $ by and_elim_l [b]
