t1b: $ G , ra_nidx D2 j m ∈ lrel , x ∊ fseq b7_V , cdm x = fv nvf m , nest (scat x Q) y ∈ fv A2 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf E2) (fv nvf N2)) (fv nvf j)) ⇒ nadd (fv nvf E2) (fv nvf N2) = nadd (fv nvf E) (fv nvf N) $ by weaken [k4]
