t2b: $ G , ra_nidx D2 j m ∈ lrel , x ∊ fseq b7_V , cdm x = fv nvf m , nest (scat x Q) y ∈ fv A2 (nadd (nadd (fv nvf E2) (fv nvf N2)) (fv nvf j)) ⇒ A2 = A $ by eq_sym [t2a]
