c1: $ G , o = Dd , o ∊ trees ω , p = A , p ∊ fseq u , q = B , q ∊ fseq u ⇒ y ∊ b7_pm u M w D N Q X0 $ by weaken [#1]
c2: $ G , o = Dd , o ∊ trees ω , p = A , p ∊ fseq u , q = B , q ∊ fseq u ⇒ ∀ d ∀ a ∀ b (ra_ipos D N Q d y ∈ lrel → d ∊ trees ω → a ∊ fseq u → b ∊ fseq u → ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf Q) → fv a i = fv b i) → b7_hw D X0 a b d Q → dt u M y w a ⊆ dt u M y w b) $ by cab_elim [c1]
c3: $ G , o = Dd , o ∊ trees ω , p = A , p ∊ fseq u , q = B , q ∊ fseq u ⇒ ∀ a ∀ b (ra_ipos D N Q o y ∈ lrel → o ∊ trees ω → a ∊ fseq u → b ∊ fseq u → ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf o) (fv nvf Q) → fv a i = fv b i) → b7_hw D X0 a b o Q → dt u M y w a ⊆ dt u M y w b) $ by all_elim [c2]
c4: $ G , o = Dd , o ∊ trees ω , p = A , p ∊ fseq u , q = B , q ∊ fseq u ⇒ ∀ b (ra_ipos D N Q o y ∈ lrel → o ∊ trees ω → p ∊ fseq u → b ∊ fseq u → ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf o) (fv nvf Q) → fv p i = fv b i) → b7_hw D X0 p b o Q → dt u M y w p ⊆ dt u M y w b) $ by all_elim [c3]
