c15: $ G , o = Dd , o ∊ trees ω , p = A , p ∊ fseq u , q = B , q ∊ fseq u ⇒ b7_hw D X0 p q o Q → dt u M y w p ⊆ dt u M y w q $ by imp_elim [c14, k8]
c16: $ G , o = Dd , o ∊ trees ω , p = A , p ∊ fseq u , q = B , q ∊ fseq u ⇒ dt u M y w p ⊆ dt u M y w q $ by imp_elim [c15, k10]
