lemma b7_ipos_mono (G: hyps) {i: set} (M X0: class) (u w r r2 t1 t2 t3 t4 t5: set): $ G ⇒ ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ t4 ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ t5 ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ r2 ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf t4) (fv nvf t3) → fv r i = fv r2 i) $ > $ G ⇒ b7_hw t1 X0 r r2 t4 t3 $ > $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ dt u M t5 w r ⊆ dt u M t5 w r2 $
----
s1: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by ax
s2: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
s3: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
s4: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 ⇒ z ∊ trees ω $ by trees_omega_intro [s1, s2, s3]
s5: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#4]
