s11: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x8 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) $ by lrel3_cwf_cases [s10]
