s16: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 ⇒ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J)) → etel u (dnf u M) z w a ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by b7_cm_c2 [s4, s5, s6, s7, s9]
s17: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by imp_use [s16]
s18: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) $ by ax
s19: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by weaken [s13r]
s20: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by weaken [s17]
s21: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by or_elim [s18, s19, s20]
s22: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , b7_hw t1 X0 a b d t3 ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by or_elim [s11, s13, s21]
s23: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 $ by b7_cm_i [s22]
s24: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
s25: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 $ by wcel_intro [s24, s23]
s26: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 ⇒ isset ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by opair_isset
s27: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 $ by isset_elim [s26, s25]
s28: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 $ by imp_intro [s27]
s29: $ G , k ∊ ω ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 $ by imp_intro [s28]
s30: $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 $ by imp_intro [s29]
s31: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0) $ by all_intro [s30]
s32: $ G ⇒ ∀ k ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0) $ by all_intro [s31]
s33: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
s34: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 $ by trees_ind_c [s33, s32]
s35: $ G ⇒ t8 ∊ b7_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 $ by subset_elim [s34, #3]
s36: $ G ⇒ t7 ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [#2]
s37: $ G ⇒ r ∈ fseq u $ by welc_wcel [#5]
s38: $ G ⇒ r2 ∈ fseq u $ by welc_wcel [#6]
s39: $ G ⇒ isset t6 $ by isset_var
s40: $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) t8 w r ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) t8 w r2 $ by b7_cm_e [s35, s39, #1, s36, s37, s38, #7, #8]

--| Inversion of `tys_wf` at a `tcons`.

--| The paths whose arguments are some `x` (the indices of a type `K`) in front of `S`.
def b7_shp (D K S: class) (.o .f .g .t .r .m .x: set): class = $ {o | ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ r ∃ m ∃ x (o = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ ra_nidx D K m ∈ lrel ∧ x ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ cdm x = fv nvf m ∧ r = scat x S)} $

--| @congr
lemma b7_shp_congr (A B C D E F: class): $ A ≐ B $ > $ C ≐ D $ > $ E ≐ F $ > $ b7_shp A C E ≐ b7_shp B D F $
----
c0: $ o ≐ o $ by ceqt_refl
c0b: $ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ≐ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ceqt_refl
c1: $ (o = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) ⟺ (o = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) $ by iff_refl
c2a: $ m ≐ m $ by ceqt_refl
c2b: $ lrel ≐ lrel $ by ceqt_refl
c2c: $ ra_nidx A C m ≐ ra_nidx B D m $ by ra_nidx_congr [#1, #2, c2a]
c2: $ (ra_nidx A C m ∈ lrel) ⟺ (ra_nidx B D m ∈ lrel) $ by wcel_congr [c2c, c2b]
c3: $ (x ∊ fseq b7_V) ⟺ (x ∊ fseq b7_V) $ by iff_refl
c4: $ (cdm x = fv nvf m) ⟺ (cdm x = fv nvf m) $ by iff_refl
c5a: $ x ≐ x $ by ceqt_refl
c5b: $ scat x E ≐ scat x F $ by scat_congr [c5a, #3]
c5c: $ r ≐ r $ by ceqt_refl
c5: $ (r = scat x E) ⟺ (r = scat x F) $ by ceq_congr [c5c, c5b]
c6: $ (cdm x = fv nvf m ∧ r = scat x E) ⟺ (cdm x = fv nvf m ∧ r = scat x F) $ by and_congr [c4, c5]
