ha1: $ G , o ∊ b7_shp D K S , ∃ g ∃ t ∃ r ∃ m ∃ x (o = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ ra_nidx D K m ∈ lrel ∧ x ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ cdm x = fv nvf m ∧ r = scat x S) ⇒ ∃ g ∃ t ∃ r ∃ m ∃ x (o = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ ra_nidx D K m ∈ lrel ∧ x ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ cdm x = fv nvf m ∧ r = scat x S) $ by ax
