ccr1: $ G , q ∊ etel u (dnf u M) z w r , x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) x9) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x0 w (scons x r) ∧ q = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) x9 w r) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) x0 w (scons x r) ∧ q = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) x9 w r) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [ccr0]
