l6b: $ G ⇒ x5 = t5 $ by eq_sym [#4]
l6c: $ G ⇒ m = m $ by eq_refl
l4w: $ G ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
l7a: $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w r = etel u (dnf u M) f w r $ by etel_eq [#1, l4w, l4a]
l7: $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) f w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [l7a, l2a]
