sd1: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) $ by ax
sdb: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a ⊆ b7_shp t1 t5 (swin a (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) $ by weaken [sb2]
sdc: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a ⊆ b7_shp t1 t5 (swin a (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) $ by weaken [sc2]
sd2: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ x9 ∃ x0 ∃ e ∃ v ∃ h (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x9 (scons x0 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 x9 e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_deq x6 e e ⟨ kc_srt , scons h ∅ ⟩ ∈ J ∧ ra_ulevel x4 h ∈ lrel2 ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 x7 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x0 ⟨ kc_srt , scons ⟨ kc_lz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v x0 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 ⟨ kc_cons , scons e (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons x7 ∅ ⟩ x0 ∈ lrel3 J) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a ⊆ b7_shp t1 t5 (swin a (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) $ by or_elim [sd1, sdb, sdc]
s22: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a ⊆ b7_shp t1 t5 (swin a (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) $ by or_elim [s11, sa2, sd2]
s23: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 $ by b7_cs_i [s22]
s24: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
s25: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 $ by wcel_intro [s24, s23]
s26: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ⇒ isset ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by opair_isset
s27: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 $ by isset_elim [s26, s25]
s28: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 $ by imp_intro [s27]
s29: $ G , k ∊ ω ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 $ by imp_intro [s28]
s30: $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 $ by imp_intro [s29]
s31: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5) $ by all_intro [s30]
s32: $ G ⇒ ∀ k ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5) $ by all_intro [s31]
s33: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
s34: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 $ by trees_ind_c [s33, s32]
s35: $ G ⇒ t8 ∊ b7_cs u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 $ by subset_elim [s34, #2]
s36: $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) t8 w r ⊆ b7_shp t1 t5 (swin r (fv nvf t7) (fv nvf t3)) $ by b7_cs_e [s35, #1, #3, #5]

lemma b7_swin_scat (G: hyps) (A: class) (p t: set): $ G ⇒ p ∊ fseq A $ > $ G ⇒ t ∊ fseq A $ > $ G ⇒ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) = p $
----
k0: $ G ⇒ functional p $ by fseq_functional [#1]
k1: $ G ⇒ rel p $ by fseq_rel [#1]
k2: $ G ⇒ cdm p ∈ ω $ by fseq_len [#1]
k3: $ G ⇒ ∅ ∈ ω $ by omega_zero
a1: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) ⇒ z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) $ by ax
a2: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩) $ by cab_elim [a1]
b1: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ $ by ax
b2: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ i ∊ cdm p $ by and_elim_l [b1]
b3: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [b1]
b4a: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ ∅ ∈ ω $ by weaken [k3]
b4b: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ i ∈ cdm p $ by welc_wcel [b2]
b4c: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ cdm p ∈ ω $ by weaken [k2]
b4d: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ i ∈ ω $ by omega_elem_omega_c [b4b, b4c]
b4e: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ nadd ∅ i = nadd i ∅ $ by nadd_comm_c [b4a, b4d]
b4f: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ isset i $ by isset_var
b4g: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ nadd i ∅ = i $ by nadd_zero_c [b4f]
b4: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ nadd ∅ i = i $ by eq_trans [b4e, b4g]
b5a: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ scat p t = scat p t $ by eq_refl
b5b: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) = fv (scat p t) i $ by fv_eq [b5a, b4]
b5c: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ p ∊ fseq A $ by weaken [#1]
b5d: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ t ∊ fseq A $ by weaken [#2]
b5e: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ fv (scat p t) i = fv p i $ by scat_fv_l [b5c, b5d, b2]
b5: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) = fv p i $ by eq_trans [b5b, b5e]
b6a: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ i = i $ by eq_refl
b6b: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ = ⟨ i , fv p i ⟩ $ by opair_eq [b6a, b5]
b6: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ i , fv p i ⟩ $ by eq_trans [b3, b6b]
c1: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ p ⇒ ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ p $ by ax
c2a: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ p ⇒ functional p $ by weaken [k0]
c2: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ p ⇒ fv p i = y $ by fv_val [c2a, c1]
c3a: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ p ⇒ i = i $ by eq_refl
c3b: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ p ⇒ ⟨ i , fv p i ⟩ = ⟨ i , y ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c3a, c2]
c3z: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ p ⇒ z = ⟨ i , fv p i ⟩ $ by weaken [b6]
c3c: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ p ⇒ z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ $ by eq_trans [c3z, c3b]
c3d: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ p ⇒ ⟨ i , y ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [c3c]
c3e: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ p ⇒ z ∈ p $ by wcel_eq_l [c3d, c1]
c3: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ , ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ p ⇒ z ∊ p $ by wcel_welc [c3e]
c4: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) , i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ p $ by cdm_elim [b2, c3]
c5: $ G , z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) ⇒ z ∊ p $ by ex_elim [a2, c4]
