e6b: $ G , z ∊ p , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ , i ∊ cdm p , y ∊ crn p ⇒ fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) = fv (scat p t) i $ by fv_eq [e6a, e5]
e6c: $ G , z ∊ p , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ , i ∊ cdm p , y ∊ crn p ⇒ p ∊ fseq A $ by weaken [#1]
