e6e: $ G , z ∊ p , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ , i ∊ cdm p , y ∊ crn p ⇒ fv (scat p t) i = fv p i $ by scat_fv_l [e6c, e6d, e2]
e6f: $ G , z ∊ p , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ , i ∊ cdm p , y ∊ crn p ⇒ fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) = fv p i $ by eq_trans [e6b, e6e]
e6: $ G , z ∊ p , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ , i ∊ cdm p , y ∊ crn p ⇒ fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) = y $ by eq_trans [e6f, e4]
e7a: $ G , z ∊ p , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ , i ∊ cdm p , y ∊ crn p ⇒ i = i $ by eq_refl
e7b: $ G , z ∊ p , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ , i ∊ cdm p , y ∊ crn p ⇒ y = fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) $ by eq_sym [e6]
e7c: $ G , z ∊ p , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ , i ∊ cdm p , y ∊ crn p ⇒ ⟨ i , y ⟩ = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ $ by opair_eq [e7a, e7b]
e7: $ G , z ∊ p , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ , i ∊ cdm p , y ∊ crn p ⇒ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ $ by eq_trans [e1, e7c]
e8: $ G , z ∊ p , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ , i ∊ cdm p , y ∊ crn p ⇒ i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩ $ by and_intro [e2, e7]
e9: $ G , z ∊ p , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ , i ∊ cdm p , y ∊ crn p ⇒ ∃ i (i ∊ cdm p ∧ z = ⟨ i , fv (scat p t) (nadd ∅ i) ⟩) $ by ex_intro [e8]
e10: $ G , z ∊ p , z = ⟨ i , y ⟩ , i ∊ cdm p , y ∊ crn p ⇒ z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) $ by cab_intro [e9]
e11: $ G , z ∊ p ⇒ z ∊ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) $ by cxp_elim [d3, e10]
e12: $ G ⇒ swin (scat p t) ∅ (cdm p) = p $ by eq_intro [c5, e11]

