dr2: $ G , o ∊ b7_shp D K S , o = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ ra_nidx D K m ∈ lrel ∧ x ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ cdm x = fv nvf m ∧ r = scat x S ⇒ cdm x = fv nvf m ∧ r = scat x S $ by and_elim_r [dr1]
