e1: $ G , o ∊ b7_shp D K S , o = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ ra_nidx D K m ∈ lrel ∧ x ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ cdm x = fv nvf m ∧ r = scat x S ⇒ S = S2 $ by weaken [#3]
e2a: $ G , o ∊ b7_shp D K S , o = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ ra_nidx D K m ∈ lrel ∧ x ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ cdm x = fv nvf m ∧ r = scat x S ⇒ x = x $ by eq_refl
e2: $ G , o ∊ b7_shp D K S , o = ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ ra_nidx D K m ∈ lrel ∧ x ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ cdm x = fv nvf m ∧ r = scat x S ⇒ scat x S = scat x S2 $ by scat_eq [e2a, e1]
