q1: $ G , x5 = ⟨ z , ⟨ r , w ⟩ ⟩ , x6 ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) D W ∧ x6 ∊ u ∧ x5 ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W x6 ⇒ x6 ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) D W $ by and_elim_l [q0]
