q2: $ G , x5 = ⟨ z , ⟨ r , w ⟩ ⟩ , x6 ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) D W ∧ x6 ∊ u ∧ x5 ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W x6 ⇒ x6 ∊ u $ by and_elim_l [q1r]
q3: $ G , x5 = ⟨ z , ⟨ r , w ⟩ ⟩ , x6 ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) D W ∧ x6 ∊ u ∧ x5 ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W x6 ⇒ x5 ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W x6 $ by and_elim_r [q1r]
q4: $ G , x5 = ⟨ z , ⟨ r , w ⟩ ⟩ , x6 ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) D W ∧ x6 ∊ u ∧ x5 ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W x6 ⇒ x6 ∈ u $ by welc_wcel [q2]
q5a: $ G , x5 = ⟨ z , ⟨ r , w ⟩ ⟩ , x6 ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) D W ∧ x6 ∊ u ∧ x5 ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W x6 ⇒ ifam u (dnf u M) D W ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by weaken [k2]
q5: $ G , x5 = ⟨ z , ⟨ r , w ⟩ ⟩ , x6 ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) D W ∧ x6 ∊ u ∧ x5 ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W x6 ⇒ x6 ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by subset_trans [q1, q5a]
s1: $ G , x5 = ⟨ z , ⟨ r , w ⟩ ⟩ , x6 ⊆ ifam u (dnf u M) D W ∧ x6 ∊ u ∧ x5 ∊ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W x6 , iprt D q e , y ∊ esat u (dnf u M) q W , ictk D v b d , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ h , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) d W (scat y (ixs D W x6)) , a ∊ fseq u , x5 = ⟨ v , ⟨ a , scons b g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ iprt D q e $ by ax
