xa6: $ G , ∃ m ∃ l ∃ x (iprt D p t ∧ ra_clen p m ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ j ∀ c ∀ k (ictk D j c k → ∃ i (fv nvf i = j ∧ ra_cwf D n m l i x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel3 J))) ⇒ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W Z ⊆ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W Z2 $ by ex_elim [xa5, xa4]
xa7: $ G , ∃ n ∃ m ∃ l ∃ x (iprt D p t ∧ ra_clen p m ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ j ∀ c ∀ k (ictk D j c k → ∃ i (fv nvf i = j ∧ ra_cwf D n m l i x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel3 J))) ⇒ ∃ n ∃ m ∃ l ∃ x (iprt D p t ∧ ra_clen p m ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ j ∀ c ∀ k (ictk D j c k → ∃ i (fv nvf i = j ∧ ra_cwf D n m l i x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel3 J))) $ by ax
xa8: $ G , ∃ n ∃ m ∃ l ∃ x (iprt D p t ∧ ra_clen p m ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ j ∀ c ∀ k (ictk D j c k → ∃ i (fv nvf i = j ∧ ra_cwf D n m l i x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel3 J))) ⇒ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W Z ⊆ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W Z2 $ by ex_elim [xa7, xa6]
xa9: $ G , ∃ t ∃ n ∃ m ∃ l ∃ x (iprt D p t ∧ ra_clen p m ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ j ∀ c ∀ k (ictk D j c k → ∃ i (fv nvf i = j ∧ ra_cwf D n m l i x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel3 J))) ⇒ ∃ t ∃ n ∃ m ∃ l ∃ x (iprt D p t ∧ ra_clen p m ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ j ∀ c ∀ k (ictk D j c k → ∃ i (fv nvf i = j ∧ ra_cwf D n m l i x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel3 J))) $ by ax
xa10: $ G , ∃ t ∃ n ∃ m ∃ l ∃ x (iprt D p t ∧ ra_clen p m ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ j ∀ c ∀ k (ictk D j c k → ∃ i (fv nvf i = j ∧ ra_cwf D n m l i x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel3 J))) ⇒ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W Z ⊆ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W Z2 $ by ex_elim [xa9, xa8]
xa11: $ G , ∃ p ∃ t ∃ n ∃ m ∃ l ∃ x (iprt D p t ∧ ra_clen p m ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ j ∀ c ∀ k (ictk D j c k → ∃ i (fv nvf i = j ∧ ra_cwf D n m l i x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel3 J))) ⇒ ∃ p ∃ t ∃ n ∃ m ∃ l ∃ x (iprt D p t ∧ ra_clen p m ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ j ∀ c ∀ k (ictk D j c k → ∃ i (fv nvf i = j ∧ ra_cwf D n m l i x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel3 J))) $ by ax
xa12: $ G , ∃ p ∃ t ∃ n ∃ m ∃ l ∃ x (iprt D p t ∧ ra_clen p m ∈ lrel ∧ ∀ j ∀ c ∀ k (ictk D j c k → ∃ i (fv nvf i = j ∧ ra_cwf D n m l i x ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ k ∈ lrel3 J))) ⇒ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W Z ⊆ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W Z2 $ by ex_elim [xa11, xa10]
f5: $ G ⇒ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W Z ⊆ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W Z2 $ by ex_elim [#1, xa10]

lemma b7_isup_sub2 (G: hyps) (Z S V: class) (u: set): $ G ⇒ Z ⊆ ω × (fseq u × V) $ > $ G ⇒ S ⊆ u $ > $ G ⇒ isup Z S ⊆ ω × (fseq u × u) $
----
a1: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S ⇒ z ∊ isup Z S $ by ax
b1: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by ax
b2: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ Z ⊆ ω × (fseq u × V) $ by weaken [#1]
b3: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × (fseq u × V) $ by wcel_subset [b2, b1]
b4: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ ω ∧ a ∊ fseq u ∧ x ∊ V $ by b7_pt3a [b3]
b5: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ ω $ by and_elim_l [b4]
b6: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ a ∊ fseq u ∧ x ∊ V $ by and_elim_r [b4]
b7: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ by and_elim_l [b6]
b8: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ S ⊆ u $ by weaken [#2]
b9: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ S $ by ax
b10: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ u $ by subset_elim [b8, b9]
b11: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , y ⟩ ∈ fseq u × u $ by cxp_intro [b7, b10]
b12: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j ∈ ω $ by welc_wcel [b5]
b13: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × (fseq u × u) $ by cxp_intro_c [b12, b11]
b14: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
b15: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [b14]
b16: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ ω × (fseq u × u) $ by wcel_eq_l [b15, b13]
b17: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ ω × (fseq u × u) $ by wcel_welc [b16]
b18: $ G , z ∊ isup Z S ⇒ z ∊ ω × (fseq u × u) $ by isup_elim [a1, b17]
b19: $ G ⇒ isup Z S ⊆ ω × (fseq u × u) $ by subset_intro [b18]

lemma b7_ixv_mono (G: hyps) (A B Q: class): $ G ⇒ A ⊆ B $ > $ G ⇒ ixv A Q ⊆ ixv B Q $
----
a1: $ G , y ∊ ixv A Q ⇒ y ∊ ixv A Q $ by ax
a2: $ G , y ∊ ixv A Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ⇒ x ∊ fseq (crn x) $ by ax
a3: $ G , y ∊ ixv A Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ⇒ x ∈ fseq (crn x) $ by welc_wcel [a2]
a4: $ G , y ∊ ixv A Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A $ by ax
a5: $ G , y ∊ ixv A Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ⇒ A ⊆ B $ by weaken [#1]
a6: $ G , y ∊ ixv A Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B $ by wcel_subset [a5, a4]
a7a: $ G , y ∊ ixv A Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ⇒ isset j $ by isset_var
a7b: $ G , y ∊ ixv A Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ⇒ isset y $ by isset_var
a7: $ G , y ∊ ixv A Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ⇒ y ∈ ixv B Q $ by ixv_intro [a7a, a7b, a3, a6]
a8: $ G , y ∊ ixv A Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ A ⇒ y ∊ ixv B Q $ by wcel_welc [a7]
a9: $ G , y ∊ ixv A Q ⇒ y ∊ ixv B Q $ by ixv_elim [a1, a8]
a10: $ G ⇒ ixv A Q ⊆ ixv B Q $ by subset_intro [a9]

iphi0_mono
----------
k1: $ G ⇒ universe u $ by uadm_universe [#2]
k2: $ G ⇒ isup Z S2 ∈ u $ by isup_universe [k1, #5, #7]
k3a: $ G ⇒ S2 ⊆ u $ by universe_elem_subset_c [k1, #7]
k3: $ G ⇒ isup Z S2 ⊆ ω × (fseq u × u) $ by b7_isup_sub2 [#6, k3a]
k4a: $ G ⇒ Z ⊆ Z $ by subset_refl
k4: $ G ⇒ isup Z S ⊆ isup Z S2 $ by isup_mono [k4a, #8]
k5: $ G ⇒ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W (isup Z S) ⊆ iop0 u (dnf u M) D W (isup Z S2) $ by b7_iop0_mono_g [#1, #2, #3, #4, k2, k3, k4]
k6: $ G ⇒ ixv (iop0 u (dnf u M) D W (isup Z S)) Q ⊆ ixv (iop0 u (dnf u M) D W (isup Z S2)) Q $ by b7_ixv_mono [k5]
k7: $ G ⇒ iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q S ⊆ iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q S2 $ by weaken [k6]

iphi_mono
---------
m1: $ G , a ⊆ b ⇒ a ⊆ b $ by ax
m2: $ G , a ⊆ b ⇒ iphi u E D W Z Q a ⊆ iphi u E D W Z Q b $ by b7_iphi_mono [m1]
m3: $ G ⇒ mono y (iphi u E D W Z Q y) $ by mono_intro [m2]

lemma b7_pt3 (G: hyps) (B1 B2 B3 J A: class) (y: set): $ G ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B1 × (B2 × B3) $ > $ G ⇒ y ∊ B3 $
----
a1: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) ⇒ c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) $ by ax
b1: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ $ by ax
b2: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
b3: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ = c $ by eq_sym [b2]
b4: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ x , v ⟩ $ by eq_trans [b3, b1]
b5: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ isset J $ by opair_eq_isset [b4]
b6: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ isset ⟨ A , y ⟩ $ by opair_isset
b7: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ isset x $ by isset_var
b8: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ isset v $ by isset_var
b9: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ J = x ∧ ⟨ A , y ⟩ = v $ by opair_inj_c [b4, b5, b6, b7, b8]
b10: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ ⟨ A , y ⟩ = v $ by and_elim_r [b9]
b11: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ v ∊ B2 × B3 $ by ax
d1: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ $ by ax
d2a: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ ⟨ A , y ⟩ = v $ by weaken [b10]
d2: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ ⟨ A , y ⟩ = ⟨ w , e ⟩ $ by eq_trans [d2a, d1]
d3: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ isset A $ by opair_eq_isset [d2]
d4: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ isset y $ by isset_var
d5: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ isset w $ by isset_var
d6: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ isset e $ by isset_var
d7: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ A = w ∧ y = e $ by opair_inj_c [d2, d3, d4, d5, d6]
d8: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ y = e $ by and_elim_r [d7]
d9: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ e ∊ B3 $ by ax
d10: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ e = y $ by eq_sym [d8]
d11: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ y ∊ B3 $ by welc_eq_set [d10, d9]
d12: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ y ∊ B3 $ by cxp_elim [b11, d11]
d13: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) ⇒ y ∊ B3 $ by cxp_elim [a1, d12]
d14: $ G ⇒ y ∊ B3 $ by wcel_elim [#1, d13]

lemma b7_ixv_sub (G: hyps) (Z Q B1 B2 B3: class): $ G ⇒ Z ⊆ B1 × (B2 × B3) $ > $ G ⇒ ixv Z Q ⊆ B3 $
----
a1: $ G , y ∊ ixv Z Q ⇒ y ∊ ixv Z Q $ by ax
a2: $ G , y ∊ ixv Z Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by ax
a3: $ G , y ∊ ixv Z Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ Z ⊆ B1 × (B2 × B3) $ by weaken [#1]
a4: $ G , y ∊ ixv Z Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B1 × (B2 × B3) $ by wcel_subset [a3, a2]
a5: $ G , y ∊ ixv Z Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ⇒ y ∊ B3 $ by b7_pt3 [a4]
a6: $ G , y ∊ ixv Z Q ⇒ y ∊ B3 $ by ixv_elim [a1, a5]
a7: $ G ⇒ ixv Z Q ⊆ B3 $ by subset_intro [a6]

lemma b7_iphi_sub (G: hyps) (E D W Z Q Y: class) (u: set): $ G ⇒ iphi u E D W Z Q Y ⊆ fseq (ω ∪ u) $
----
l1: $ G , z ∊ iphi u E D W Z Q Y ⇒ z ∊ iphi u E D W Z Q Y $ by ax
l2: $ G , z ∊ iphi u E D W Z Q Y ⇒ ∃ x (x ⊆ Y ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u E D W Z Q x) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , z ∊ iphi u E D W Z Q Y , x ⊆ Y ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u E D W Z Q x ⇒ x ⊆ Y ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u E D W Z Q x $ by ax
l4: $ G , z ∊ iphi u E D W Z Q Y , x ⊆ Y ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u E D W Z Q x ⇒ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u E D W Z Q x $ by and_elim_r [l3]
l5: $ G , z ∊ iphi u E D W Z Q Y , x ⊆ Y ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u E D W Z Q x ⇒ z ∊ iphi0 u E D W Z Q x $ by and_elim_r [l4]
