b2: $ G , x0 = scat x q , x0 ∊ fseq A , v ∊ x ⇒ v ∊ x ∪ {z | ∃ i ∃ y (z = ⟨ nadd (cdm x) i , y ⟩ ∧ ⟨ i , y ⟩ ∈ q)} $ by cun_intro_l [b1]
b3: $ G , x0 = scat x q , x0 ∊ fseq A , v ∊ x ⇒ x0 = scat x q $ by ax
b4: $ G , x0 = scat x q , x0 ∊ fseq A , v ∊ x ⇒ scat x q = x0 $ by eq_sym [b3]
