--| `lrel_ipos_mono`'s `ipos_pi` case for `DEP`: the value does not depend on the entries.
lemma b9_nc_pidep {r o x0 x1: set} (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w t1 t2 t3 d k z A B: set): $ G ⇒ ra_add d t3 k ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_closed k A ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ B ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ d ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ A ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ B ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ r ∀ o (r ∊ fseq u → o ∊ fseq u → b9_ag r o (nadd (fv nvf ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩) (fv nvf t3)) → dt u M B w r = dt u M B w o) $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 (x0 ∊ fseq u → x1 ∊ fseq u → b9_ag x0 x1 (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) → dt u M z w x0 = dt u M z w x1) $
----
c0: $ G ⇒ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 (x0 ∊ fseq u → x1 ∊ fseq u → b9_ag x0 x1 (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) → dt u M A w x0 = dt u M A w x1) $ by b9_nc_cl [#1, #2, #7]
