r0: $ G , q ∊ fseq u , p ∊ fseq u , b9_ag q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) , b9_hs t1 X0 q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) X , swin q (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) = X0 , f ∊ dt u M z w q , x9 ∊ dt u M A w q ⇒ x9 ∊ dt u M A w q $ by ax
w6_q4: $ G , q ∊ fseq u , p ∊ fseq u , b9_ag q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) , b9_hs t1 X0 q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) X , swin q (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) = X0 , f ∊ dt u M z w q , x9 ∊ dt u M A w q ⇒ f ∊ cpi y (dt u M A w q) (dt u M B w (scons y q)) $ by weaken [q4]
r1: $ G , q ∊ fseq u , p ∊ fseq u , b9_ag q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) , b9_hs t1 X0 q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) X , swin q (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) = X0 , f ∊ dt u M z w q , x9 ∊ dt u M A w q ⇒ ap f x9 ∈ dt u M B w (scons x9 q) $ by cpi_elim_ap [w6_q4, r0]
w7_h3: $ G , q ∊ fseq u , p ∊ fseq u , b9_ag q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) , b9_hs t1 X0 q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) X , swin q (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) = X0 , f ∊ dt u M z w q , x9 ∊ dt u M A w q ⇒ ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ B ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#3]
w8_c3: $ G , q ∊ fseq u , p ∊ fseq u , b9_ag q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) , b9_hs t1 X0 q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) X , swin q (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) = X0 , f ∊ dt u M z w q , x9 ∊ dt u M A w q ⇒ isset ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ $ by weaken [c3]
w9_h6: $ G , q ∊ fseq u , p ∊ fseq u , b9_ag q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) , b9_hs t1 X0 q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) X , swin q (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) = X0 , f ∊ dt u M z w q , x9 ∊ dt u M A w q ⇒ B ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#6]
