r3a: $ G , q ∊ fseq u , p ∊ fseq u , b9_ag q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) , b9_hs t1 X0 q p (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) X , swin q (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) = X0 , f ∊ dt u M z w q , x9 ∊ dt u M A w q ⇒ isset f $ by isset_var
