s1: $ … ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) y w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) y w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ dt u M y w r = apn (fv r (nadd (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf j0))) (sarg u (dnf u M) y w r) $ by lrel_indapp_sem [#2, #3, #4, #6]
