s3: $ … ⇒ sarg u (dnf u M) y w r = sarg u (dnf u M) y w q $ by b11_nc_sarg [#1, #2, #3, #4, #5, #6, #7]
s4: $ … ⇒ sarg u (dnf u M) y w r = scat x X0 $ by eq_trans [s3, #8]
