s5: $ … ⇒ apn (fv r (nadd (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf j0))) (sarg u (dnf u M) y w r) = apn (fv r (nadd (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf j0))) (scat x X0) $ by apn_eq [ff, s4]
fin: $ … ⇒ dt u M y w r = apn (fv r (nadd (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) (fv nvf j0))) (scat x X0) $ by eq_trans [s2, s5]

