w173_e2s: $ G , ra_nidx D j m ∈ lrel , x ∊ fseq b7_V , cdm x = fv nvf m , nest (scat x X0) y ∈ fv A (nadd K2 (fv nvf j)) , apn (fv S (nadd K (fv nvf j))) (scat x X0) = csn k ∧ (y = ∅ ∨ (⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ k ∧ y ∊ X)) ⇒ nadd K2 (fv nvf j) = nadd K (fv nvf j) $ by weaken [e2s]
