b2: $ … ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) B w rx = etel u (dnf u M) B w (scons x r) $ by etel_eq [r1, r2, w183_h8]
w184_h9: $ G , n = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons Tt t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) B w rx $ by weaken [#9]
b3: $ … ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) B w (scons x r) $ by wcel_eq_r [b2, w184_h9]
n0: $ G , n = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons Tt t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ n = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons Tt t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
