k3: $ … ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) B w (scons x r) ∧ n = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) A w r) t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_intro [b3, b4]
