x4: $ … ⇒ ∃ j ∃ k ∃ l ∃ m (x ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) A) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ k , ⟨ l , m ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) B w (scons x r) ∧ n = ⟨ ssnoc j x , ⟨ scons x k , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) A w r) l , m ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_intro [x3]
