y1: $ G ⇒ ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons Tt t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ {o | ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ l ∃ m (i ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) A) w r ∧ i ∊ u ∧ ⟨ j , ⟨ k , ⟨ l , m ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) B w (scons i r) ∧ o = ⟨ ssnoc j i , ⟨ scons i k , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) A w r) l , m ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by wcel_cab_intro [s1, x5]
