a1: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , k = ∅ , l = scons y k ⇒ i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ $ by ax
a2: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , k = ∅ , l = scons y k ⇒ j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ $ by ax
a3: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , k = ∅ , l = scons y k ⇒ k = ∅ $ by ax
a4: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , k = ∅ , l = scons y k ⇒ l = scons y k $ by ax
b1: $ … ⇒ ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ = i $ by eq_sym [a1]
b2: $ … ⇒ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ = j $ by eq_sym [a2]
b3: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , k = ∅ , l = scons y k ⇒ B2 = B2 $ by eq_refl
b4: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , k = ∅ , l = scons y k ⇒ B = B $ by eq_refl
b5: $ … ⇒ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ B2 B = ra_lift i j B2 B $ by ra_lift_eq [b1, b2, b3, b4]
w188_h1: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , k = ∅ , l = scons y k ⇒ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ B2 B ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#1]
b6: $ … ⇒ ra_lift i j B2 B ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [b5, w188_h1]
c1: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , k = ∅ , l = scons y k ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq u $ by fseq_empty
c2: $ … ⇒ ∅ = k $ by eq_sym [a3]
c3: $ … ⇒ k ∈ fseq u $ by wcel_eq_l [c2, c1]
c4: $ … ⇒ k ∊ fseq u $ by wcel_welc [c3]
