w190_h2: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , k = ∅ , l = scons y k ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#2]
w191_h3: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , k = ∅ , l = scons y k ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#3]
m1: $ … ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) B w (scat k (scat l r)) = etel u (dnf u M) B2 w (scat k r) $ by lrel_lift_etel [b6, w190_h2, c4, d9, e4, f10, w191_h3]
