o4: $ … ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) B w (scons y r) = etel u (dnf u M) B2 w r $ by eq_trans [o3, o2]
o5: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , k = ∅ ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) B w (scons y r) = etel u (dnf u M) B2 w r $ by isset_elim [i4, o4]
w192_i3: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ isset ∅ $ by weaken [i3]
o6: $ G , i = ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ , j = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) B w (scons y r) = etel u (dnf u M) B2 w r $ by isset_elim [w192_i3, o5]
