--| (SH) at `Π A. B` when the value of `A` at the shape world is a singleton.
lemma b11_sh_pis {a s h b v c g t e: set} (G: hyps) (J M X0 X: class) (u w t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 cc dd d0 A B B2 z a0 r0 pf pg ph pe: set): $ G ⇒ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 cc dd B ∈ lrel3 J $ > $ G ⇒ dd = ⟨ kc_s , scons d0 ∅ ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ B ∊ b11_sh_I u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 X $ > $ G ⇒ z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr $ > $ G ⇒ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ d0 ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ a0 ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ r0 ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ b9_ag a0 r0 (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) $ > $ G ⇒ b9_hs t1 X0 a0 r0 (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) X $ > $ G ⇒ swin a0 (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3) = X0 $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ pf , ⟨ pg , ⟨ ph , pe ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z w a0 $ > $ G ⇒ ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d0 A ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_lift ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ B2 B ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ (∀ a ∀ s ∀ h (a ∊ fseq u → s ∊ fseq u → b9_ag a s (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) → b9_hs t1 X0 a s (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) X → swin a (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3) = X0 → h ∊ dt u M A w a → dt u M A w s = csn (⋃ (dt u M A w s)) ∧ ∀ b ∀ v (b ∊ fseq u → b9_ag a b (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) → b9_hb t1 X0 a b (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) v → ∅ ∈ v → ∀ c ∀ g ∀ t ∀ e (⟨ c , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) A w a → nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ ⋃ (dt u M A w s) → apn h c ∈ X → apn h c ∈ v) → h ∈ dt u M A w b))) → b11_sh_C u M z w a0 r0 (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) t1 X0 X pg ⟨ pf , ⟨ pg , ⟨ ph , pe ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $
----
sx: $ G , ∀ a ∀ s ∀ h (a ∊ fseq u → s ∊ fseq u → b9_ag a s (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) → b9_hs t1 X0 a s (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) X → swin a (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3) = X0 → h ∊ dt u M A w a → dt u M A w s = csn (⋃ (dt u M A w s)) ∧ ∀ b ∀ v (b ∊ fseq u → b9_ag a b (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) → b9_hb t1 X0 a b (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) v → ∅ ∈ v → ∀ c ∀ g ∀ t ∀ e (⟨ c , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) A w a → nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ ⋃ (dt u M A w s) → apn h c ∈ X → apn h c ∈ v) → h ∈ dt u M A w b)) ⇒ ∀ a ∀ s ∀ h (a ∊ fseq u → s ∊ fseq u → b9_ag a s (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) → b9_hs t1 X0 a s (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) X → swin a (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3) = X0 → h ∊ dt u M A w a → dt u M A w s = csn (⋃ (dt u M A w s)) ∧ ∀ b ∀ v (b ∊ fseq u → b9_ag a b (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) → b9_hb t1 X0 a b (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) v → ∅ ∈ v → ∀ c ∀ g ∀ t ∀ e (⟨ c , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) A w a → nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ ⋃ (dt u M A w s) → apn h c ∈ X → apn h c ∈ v) → h ∈ dt u M A w b)) $ by ax
w254_h4: $ G , ∀ a ∀ s ∀ h (a ∊ fseq u → s ∊ fseq u → b9_ag a s (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) → b9_hs t1 X0 a s (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) X → swin a (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3) = X0 → h ∊ dt u M A w a → dt u M A w s = csn (⋃ (dt u M A w s)) ∧ ∀ b ∀ v (b ∊ fseq u → b9_ag a b (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) → b9_hb t1 X0 a b (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) v → ∅ ∈ v → ∀ c ∀ g ∀ t ∀ e (⟨ c , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) A w a → nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ ⋃ (dt u M A w s) → apn h c ∈ X → apn h c ∈ v) → h ∈ dt u M A w b)) ⇒ z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr $ by weaken [#4]
w255_h5: $ G , ∀ a ∀ s ∀ h (a ∊ fseq u → s ∊ fseq u → b9_ag a s (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) → b9_hs t1 X0 a s (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) X → swin a (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3) = X0 → h ∊ dt u M A w a → dt u M A w s = csn (⋃ (dt u M A w s)) ∧ ∀ b ∀ v (b ∊ fseq u → b9_ag a b (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) → b9_hb t1 X0 a b (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) v → ∅ ∈ v → ∀ c ∀ g ∀ t ∀ e (⟨ c , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) A w a → nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ ⋃ (dt u M A w s) → apn h c ∈ X → apn h c ∈ v) → h ∈ dt u M A w b)) ⇒ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ $ by weaken [#5]
s0: $ … ⇒ A ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr ∧ B ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr $ by b3_pi_sort [w254_h4, w255_h5]
sA: $ … ⇒ A ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr $ by and_elim_l [s0]
