bw: $ … ⇒ B ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [Bt]
w256_h7: $ G , ∀ a ∀ s ∀ h (a ∊ fseq u → s ∊ fseq u → b9_ag a s (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) → b9_hs t1 X0 a s (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) X → swin a (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3) = X0 → h ∊ dt u M A w a → dt u M A w s = csn (⋃ (dt u M A w s)) ∧ ∀ b ∀ v (b ∊ fseq u → b9_ag a b (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) → b9_hb t1 X0 a b (nadd (fv nvf d0) (fv nvf t3)) v → ∅ ∈ v → ∀ c ∀ g ∀ t ∀ e (⟨ c , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) A w a → nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ ⋃ (dt u M A w s) → apn h c ∈ X → apn h c ∈ v) → h ∈ dt u M A w b)) ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#7]
