--| (SH) by induction on the constructor type.
lemma b11_sh_all (G: hyps) (J M X0 X: class) (uu ww t1 t2 t3 t4 t5: set): $ G ⇒ uadm uu $ > $ G ⇒ ww ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ t1 ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ b11_sh_I uu M ww J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 X $
----
s1: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b11_sh_I uu M ww J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 X , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq uu , b ∊ fseq uu , b9_ag a b (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) , b9_hs t1 X0 a b (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) X , swin a (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) = X0 , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , ⟨ m , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel uu (dnf uu M) z ww a ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by ax
s2: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b11_sh_I uu M ww J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 X , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq uu , b ∊ fseq uu , b9_ag a b (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) , b9_hs t1 X0 a b (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) X , swin a (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) = X0 , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , ⟨ m , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel uu (dnf uu M) z ww a ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
s3: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b11_sh_I uu M ww J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 X0 X , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq uu , b ∊ fseq uu , b9_ag a b (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) , b9_hs t1 X0 a b (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) X , swin a (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) = X0 , ⟨ e , ⟨ h , ⟨ m , v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel uu (dnf uu M) z ww a ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
