c7: $ … ⇒ cdm a = cdm Q $ by cdm_eq [c3]
w397_h6: $ G , a = Q , a ∊ fseq u , b = ixs D W (isup Z S) , b ∊ fseq u ⇒ K = cdm Q $ by weaken [#6]
c9: $ … ⇒ cdm Q = K $ by eq_sym [w397_h6]
c10: $ … ⇒ cdm a = K $ by eq_trans [c7, c9]
c11: $ G , a = Q , a ∊ fseq u , b = ixs D W (isup Z S) , b ∊ fseq u ⇒ J = J $ by eq_refl
