y15: $ G , d = D , d ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind , w = W , w ∊ lvals , ∃ b ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ i ∃ k ∃ f ∃ c ∃ l (d = x4 ∧ tj = i ∧ tm = k ∧ ra_ind_data x4 b x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x2 i f c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ b ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ i ∃ k ∃ f ∃ c ∃ l (d = x4 ∧ tj = i ∧ tm = k ∧ ra_ind_data x4 b x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x2 i f c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel) $ by ax
y16: $ G , d = D , d ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind , w = W , w ∊ lvals , ∃ b ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ i ∃ k ∃ f ∃ c ∃ l (d = x4 ∧ tj = i ∧ tm = k ∧ ra_ind_data x4 b x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x2 i f c ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel) ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf t3) $ by ex_elim [y15, y14]
y17: $ G , d = D , d ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind , w = W , w ∊ lvals ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf t3) $ by ex_elim [n4, y16]
w424_h2: $ G , d = D , d ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ⇒ W ∈ lvals $ by weaken [#2]
z1: $ G , d = D , d ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf t3) $ by wcel_elim [w424_h2, y17]
z2: $ G ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf t3) $ by wcel_elim [#1, z1]
z3: $ … ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf t3) ∧ ta ∊ fseq u $ by and_intro [z2, p6]

--| `b7_ixs_fv_in` for a `Z` with elements in `u` (as `isup Z S` for `S ⊆ u`).
lemma b11_hb_fvin (G: hyps) (D W Z Y: class) (u j: set): $ G ⇒ universe u $ > $ G ⇒ Z ∈ u $ > $ G ⇒ Z ⊆ ω × (fseq u × u) $ > $ G ⇒ Y ∈ fv (ixs D W Z) j $ > $ G ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ Y ∈ ient D W Z j $
----
a0: $ G ⇒ Y ∈ ⋃ (ap (ixs D W Z) j) $ by weaken [#4]
b1: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v ⇒ v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j $ by ax
b2: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v ⇒ ⟨ j , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z $ by cab_elim [b1]
c1: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ c ∊ ixs D W Z $ by ax
c2: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ ∃ k (k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩) $ by cab_elim [c1]
d1: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ $ by ax
d2: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ intys D $ by and_elim_l [d1]
d3: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [d1]
d4a: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ $ by ax
d4b: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , v ⟩ = c $ by eq_sym [d4a]
d4: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , v ⟩ = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ $ by eq_trans [d4b, d3]
d5a: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ universe u $ by weaken [#1]
d5b: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ Z ∈ u $ by weaken [#2]
d5c: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ Z ⊆ ω × (fseq u × u) $ by weaken [#3]
d5d: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ ient D W Z k ∈ u $ by b7_ient_universe [d5a, d5b, d5c]
d5: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ isset (ient D W Z k) $ by wcel_isset [d5d]
d6a: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ isset j $ by isset_var
d6b: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ isset v $ by isset_var
d6c: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ isset k $ by isset_var
d6: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ j = k ∧ v = ient D W Z k $ by opair_inj_c [d4, d6a, d6b, d6c, d5]
d7: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ j = k $ by and_elim_l [d6]
d8: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ v = ient D W Z k $ by and_elim_r [d6]
d9a: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ k = j $ by eq_sym [d7]
d9: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ intys D $ by welc_eq_set [d9a, d2]
d10a: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ Y ∈ v $ by ax
d10b: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ Y ∈ ient D W Z k $ by wcel_eq_r [d8, d10a]
d10c: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ D = D $ by eq_refl
d10d: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ W = W $ by eq_refl
d10e: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ Z = Z $ by eq_refl
d10f: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ ient D W Z k = ient D W Z j $ by ient_eq [d10c, d10d, d10e, d9a]
d10: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ Y ∈ ient D W Z j $ by wcel_eq_r [d10f, d10b]
d11: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ Y ∈ ient D W Z j $ by and_intro [d9, d10]
d12: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ Y ∈ ient D W Z j $ by ex_elim [c2, d11]
d13: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ Y ∈ ient D W Z j $ by wcel_elim [b2, d12]
d14: $ G ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ Y ∈ ient D W Z j $ by wcel_cuni_elim [a0, d13]

lemma b11_hb_fvout (G: hyps) (D W Z: class) (u j o: set): $ G ⇒ universe u $ > $ G ⇒ Z ∈ u $ > $ G ⇒ Z ⊆ ω × (fseq u × u) $ > $ G ⇒ j ∊ intys D $ > $ G ⇒ o ∈ ient D W Z j $ > $ G ⇒ o ∊ fv (ixs D W Z) j $
----
a1: $ G ⇒ ient D W Z j ∈ u $ by b7_ient_universe [#1, #2, #3]
a2: $ G ⇒ isset (ient D W Z j) $ by wcel_isset [a1]
b1: $ G , v = ient D W Z j ⇒ v = ient D W Z j $ by ax
b2: $ G , v = ient D W Z j ⇒ isset ⟨ j , v ⟩ $ by opair_isset
c1: $ G , v = ient D W Z j , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ ⇒ c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ $ by ax
c2a: $ G , v = ient D W Z j , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ ⇒ j = j $ by eq_refl
c2b: $ G , v = ient D W Z j , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ ⇒ v = ient D W Z j $ by ax
c2: $ G , v = ient D W Z j , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , v ⟩ = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c2a, c2b]
c3: $ G , v = ient D W Z j , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ ⇒ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ $ by eq_trans [c1, c2]
c4: $ G , v = ient D W Z j , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ intys D $ by weaken [#4]
c5: $ G , v = ient D W Z j , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ $ by and_intro [c4, c3]
c6: $ G , v = ient D W Z j , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ ⇒ ∃ k (k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩) $ by ex_intro [c5]
b3: $ G , v = ient D W Z j ⇒ ⟨ j , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z $ by wcel_cab_intro [b2, c6]
b4: $ G , v = ient D W Z j ⇒ v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j $ by cab_intro [b3]
b5a: $ G , v = ient D W Z j ⇒ o ∈ ient D W Z j $ by weaken [#5]
b5b: $ G , v = ient D W Z j ⇒ ient D W Z j = v $ by eq_sym [b1]
b5c: $ G , v = ient D W Z j ⇒ o ∈ v $ by wcel_eq_r [b5b, b5a]
b5: $ G , v = ient D W Z j ⇒ o ∊ v $ by wcel_welc [b5c]
b6: $ G , v = ient D W Z j ⇒ o ∊ ⋃ (ap (ixs D W Z) j) $ by cuni_intro [b5, b4]
b7: $ G , v = ient D W Z j ⇒ o ∊ fv (ixs D W Z) j $ by weaken [b6]
b8: $ G ⇒ o ∊ fv (ixs D W Z) j $ by isset_elim [a2, b7]

--| The analysis of an entry of the top-level valuation over `isup Z S`, at the type `tj`.
lemma b11_hb_ent {e h: set} (G: hyps) (M D W Z P T Q S K: class) (u p t t3 tj tm tk tc ty: set): $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ D ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind $ > $ G ⇒ W ∈ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ Z ∈ u $ > $ G ⇒ Z ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ > $ G ⇒ Z ⊆ itc u (dnf u M) D W $ > $ G ⇒ iprt D P T $ > $ G ⇒ Q ∈ esat u (dnf u M) P W $ > $ G ⇒ iprt D p t $ > $ G ⇒ ra_clen p t3 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ S ∈ u $ > $ G ⇒ K = cdm Q $ > $ G ⇒ ra_nidx D tj tm ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ tk = fv nvf tj $ > $ G ⇒ tc ∊ fseq b7_V $ > $ G ⇒ cdm tc = fv nvf tm $ > $ G ⇒ nest (scat tc Q) ty ∈ fv (scat Q (ixs D W (isup Z S))) (nadd K tk) $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ e ∃ h (tk ∊ intys D ∧ ⟨ tk , ⟨ scat tc Q , e ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z ∧ h ∊ S ∧ ((iprop D tk W ∧ ty = ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D tk W ∧ ty = h))) $
----
uu: $ … ⇒ universe u $ by uadm_universe [#1]
cq1: $ … ⇒ cdm Q = fv nvf t3 $ by b11_tp_clen [#2, #7, #8, #9, #10]
cq0: $ G ⇒ esat u (dnf u M) P W ⊆ fseq u $ by esat_fseq
cq2: $ … ⇒ Q ∈ fseq u $ by wcel_subset [cq0, #8]
i0: $ G ⇒ isset tj $ by isset_var
k1: $ … ⇒ fv nvf tj ∈ ω $ by nvf_omega [i0]
k2: $ … ⇒ fv nvf tj = tk $ by eq_sym [#14]
k3: $ … ⇒ tk ∈ ω $ by wcel_eq_l [k2, k1]
lk: $ … ⇒ fv (scat Q (ixs D W (isup Z S))) (nadd K tk) = fv (ixs D W (isup Z S)) tk $ by b11_hb_look [#1, #4, #5, #11, cq2, #12, k3]
n1: $ … ⇒ nest (scat tc Q) ty ∈ fv (ixs D W (isup Z S)) tk $ by wcel_eq_r [lk, #17]
zs: $ … ⇒ isup Z S ∈ u ∧ isup Z S ⊆ ω × (fseq u × u) $ by b11_hb_zs [uu, #4, #5, #11]
zs1: $ … ⇒ isup Z S ∈ u $ by and_elim_l [zs]
zs2: $ … ⇒ isup Z S ⊆ ω × (fseq u × u) $ by and_elim_r [zs]
fi: $ … ⇒ tk ∊ intys D ∧ nest (scat tc Q) ty ∈ ient D W (isup Z S) tk $ by b11_hb_fvin [uu, zs1, zs2, n1]
fi1: $ … ⇒ tk ∊ intys D $ by and_elim_l [fi]
fi2: $ … ⇒ nest (scat tc Q) ty ∈ ient D W (isup Z S) tk $ by and_elim_r [fi]
s1: $ … ⇒ tc ∈ fseq b7_V $ by welc_wcel [#15]
s2: $ … ⇒ Q ∈ fseq b7_V $ by b7_fseqV [cq2]
s3: $ … ⇒ scat tc Q ∈ fseq b7_V $ by scat_fseq_c [s1, s2]
s4: $ … ⇒ cdm (scat tc Q) = nadd (cdm tc) (cdm Q) $ by scat_len_c [s1, s2]
s5: $ … ⇒ nadd (cdm tc) (cdm Q) = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf t3) $ by nadd_eq [#16, cq1]
s6: $ … ⇒ cdm (scat tc Q) = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf t3) $ by eq_trans [s4, s5]
v0: $ G , v = nest (scat tc Q) ty , v ∊ ient D W (isup Z S) tk ⇒ v = nest (scat tc Q) ty $ by ax
v1: $ G , v = nest (scat tc Q) ty , v ∊ ient D W (isup Z S) tk ⇒ v ∊ ient D W (isup Z S) tk $ by ax
el: $ G , v = nest (scat tc Q) ty , v ∊ ient D W (isup Z S) tk ⇒ ∃ z ∃ o (⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ ∈ isup Z S ∧ ((iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z o))) $ by b7_ient_el [v1]
l0: $ G , v = nest (scat tc Q) ty , v ∊ ient D W (isup Z S) tk , ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ ∈ isup Z S ∧ ((iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z o)) ⇒ ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ ∈ isup Z S ∧ ((iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z o)) $ by ax
l1: $ … ⇒ ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ ∈ isup Z S $ by and_elim_l [l0]
l2: $ … ⇒ (iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z o) $ by and_elim_r [l0]
ws: $ G , v = nest (scat tc Q) ty , v ∊ ient D W (isup Z S) tk , ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ ∈ isup Z S ∧ ((iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z o)) , w = ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ , w ∊ isup Z S ⇒ w ∊ isup Z S $ by ax
m1: $ G , v = nest (scat tc Q) ty , v ∊ ient D W (isup Z S) tk , ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ ∈ isup Z S ∧ ((iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z o)) , w = ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ , w ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , w = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z $ by ax
m2: $ G , v = nest (scat tc Q) ty , v ∊ ient D W (isup Z S) tk , ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ ∈ isup Z S ∧ ((iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z o)) , w = ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ , w ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , w = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ S $ by ax
m3: $ G , v = nest (scat tc Q) ty , v ∊ ient D W (isup Z S) tk , ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ ∈ isup Z S ∧ ((iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z o)) , w = ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ , w ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , w = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
m4: $ G , v = nest (scat tc Q) ty , v ∊ ient D W (isup Z S) tk , ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ ∈ isup Z S ∧ ((iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z ∅) ∨ (¬ iprop D tk W ∧ v = nest z o)) , w = ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ , w ∊ isup Z S , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ ∈ Z , y ∊ S , w = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ tk , ⟨ z , o ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
