----
n2: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y ⇒ n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y $ by ax
n3: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y ⇒ (∃ d ∃ c (d ∊ ω ∧ c ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩)) ∨ (n = ⟨ ∅ , Y ⟩ ∧ Y ∈ X) $ by cab_elim [n2]
p0: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y , d ∊ ω ∧ c ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩ ⇒ d ∊ ω ∧ c ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩ $ by ax
p2: $ … ⇒ c ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p0]
p4: $ … ⇒ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p2]
p6: $ … ⇒ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p4]
p7: $ … ⇒ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X $ by and_elim_l [p6]
p8: $ … ⇒ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [p6]
ic: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y , d ∊ ω ∧ c ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩ ⇒ isset ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
id: $ … ⇒ isset (apn (fv F d) c) $ by wcel_isset [p7]
r1: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y , d ∊ ω ∧ c ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩ ⇒ ∃ a ∃ b (n = ⟨ a , b ⟩) $ by b11_sp_pr [p8, ic, id]
s1: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y , ∃ c (d ∊ ω ∧ c ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩) ⇒ ∃ c (d ∊ ω ∧ c ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩) $ by ax
s2: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y , ∃ c (d ∊ ω ∧ c ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩) ⇒ ∃ a ∃ b (n = ⟨ a , b ⟩) $ by ex_elim [s1, r1]
s3: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y , ∃ d ∃ c (d ∊ ω ∧ c ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩) ⇒ ∃ d ∃ c (d ∊ ω ∧ c ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩) $ by ax
s4: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y , ∃ d ∃ c (d ∊ ω ∧ c ∊ fseq b7_V ∧ nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ∈ fv S d ∧ apn (fv F d) c ∈ X ∧ n = ⟨ ⟨ d , nest c ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ , apn (fv F d) c ⟩) ⇒ ∃ a ∃ b (n = ⟨ a , b ⟩) $ by ex_elim [s3, s2]
t0: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y , n = ⟨ ∅ , Y ⟩ ∧ Y ∈ X ⇒ n = ⟨ ∅ , Y ⟩ ∧ Y ∈ X $ by ax
t1: $ … ⇒ n = ⟨ ∅ , Y ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [t0]
t2: $ … ⇒ Y ∈ X $ by and_elim_r [t0]
ie: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y , n = ⟨ ∅ , Y ⟩ ∧ Y ∈ X ⇒ isset ∅ $ by ax_empty
iy: $ … ⇒ isset Y $ by wcel_isset [t2]
t3: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y , n = ⟨ ∅ , Y ⟩ ∧ Y ∈ X ⇒ ∃ a ∃ b (n = ⟨ a , b ⟩) $ by b11_sp_pr [t1, ie, iy]
u1: $ G , n ∊ b11_sp_O S F X Y ⇒ ∃ a ∃ b (n = ⟨ a , b ⟩) $ by or_elim [n3, s4, t3]
zz: $ G ⇒ rel (b11_sp_O S F X Y) $ by rel_intro [u1]

lemma b11_sp_crni (G: hyps) (R A B: class): $ G ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ ∈ R $ > $ G ⇒ isset A $ > $ G ⇒ isset B $ > $ G ⇒ B ∈ crn R $
----
h1: $ G , h = A , l = B ⇒ h = A $ by ax
l1: $ G , h = A , l = B ⇒ l = B $ by ax
e1: $ … ⇒ ⟨ h , l ⟩ = ⟨ A , B ⟩ $ by opair_eq [h1, l1]
e2: $ … ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ = ⟨ h , l ⟩ $ by eq_sym [e1]
w717_h1: $ G , h = A , l = B ⇒ ⟨ A , B ⟩ ∈ R $ by weaken [#1]
e3: $ … ⇒ ⟨ h , l ⟩ ∈ R $ by wcel_eq_l [e2, w717_h1]
e4: $ … ⇒ l ∊ crn R $ by crn_intro [e3]
e5: $ … ⇒ l ∈ crn R $ by welc_wcel [e4]
e6: $ … ⇒ B ∈ crn R $ by wcel_eq_l [l1, e5]
w718_h3: $ G , h = A ⇒ isset B $ by weaken [#3]
e7: $ G , h = A ⇒ B ∈ crn R $ by isset_elim [w718_h3, e6]
e8: $ G ⇒ B ∈ crn R $ by isset_elim [#2, e7]

--| The support function with its value `y0` at `∅` given.
lemma b11_sp_main {o w v: set} (G: hyps o w v) (M D W Z Q P: class) (u x p t j e k g f2 g2 t2 a2 y0: set): $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ D ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind $ > $ G ⇒ W ∈ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ Z ∈ u $ > $ G ⇒ Q ∈ esat u (dnf u M) P W $ > $ G ⇒ x ∊ u $ > $ G ⇒ iprt D p t $ > $ G ⇒ ictk D j e k $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f2 , ⟨ g2 , ⟨ t2 , a2 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) k W (scat Q (ixs D W (isup Z (csn (scons ∅ ∅))))) $ > $ G ⇒ ∅ ∈ x → y0 = ∅ $ > $ G ⇒ x = ∅ ∨ y0 ∊ x $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ o ∃ w ∃ v (functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ w = crn o ∧ w ⊆ x ∧ v = w ∪ csn ∅ ∧ ∅ ∈ v ∧ (w = ∅ → x = ∅) ∧ (∅ ∈ x → ∅ ∈ w) ∧ b11_cnd g2 g x v) $
----
