a8: $ G , ∅ ∈ x , y = ∅ ⇒ ∃ o ∃ w ∃ v (functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ w = crn o ∧ w ⊆ x ∧ v = w ∪ csn ∅ ∧ ∅ ∈ v ∧ (w = ∅ → x = ∅) ∧ (∅ ∈ x → ∅ ∈ w) ∧ b11_cnd g2 g x v) $ by b11_sp_main [w741_h1, w742_h2, w743_h3, w744_h4, w745_h5, w746_h6, w747_h7, w748_h8, w749_h9, a2, a7]
