n0: $ G , ¬ ∅ ∈ x ⇒ ¬ ∅ ∈ x $ by ax
e2: $ G , ¬ ∅ ∈ x ⇒ x = ∅ ∨ ¬ x = ∅ $ by excluded_middle
b1: $ G , ¬ ∅ ∈ x , x = ∅ ⇒ x = ∅ $ by ax
