w769_ng: $ G , ¬ ∅ ∈ x , ¬ x = ∅ , ¬ (∃ o ∃ w ∃ v (functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ w = crn o ∧ w ⊆ x ∧ v = w ∪ csn ∅ ∧ ∅ ∈ v ∧ (w = ∅ → x = ∅) ∧ (∅ ∈ x → ∅ ∈ w) ∧ b11_cnd g2 g x v)) , y ∊ x ⇒ ¬ (∃ o ∃ w ∃ v (functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ w = crn o ∧ w ⊆ x ∧ v = w ∪ csn ∅ ∧ ∅ ∈ v ∧ (w = ∅ → x = ∅) ∧ (∅ ∈ x → ∅ ∈ w) ∧ b11_cnd g2 g x v)) $ by weaken [ng]
