w770_c0: $ G , ¬ ∅ ∈ x , ¬ x = ∅ , ¬ (∃ o ∃ w ∃ v (functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ w = crn o ∧ w ⊆ x ∧ v = w ∪ csn ∅ ∧ ∅ ∈ v ∧ (w = ∅ → x = ∅) ∧ (∅ ∈ x → ∅ ∈ w) ∧ b11_cnd g2 g x v)) ⇒ ¬ x = ∅ $ by weaken [c0]
da: $ … ⇒ ⊥ $ by not_elim [w770_c0, d9]
db: $ G , ¬ ∅ ∈ x , ¬ x = ∅ ⇒ ∃ o ∃ w ∃ v (functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ w = crn o ∧ w ⊆ x ∧ v = w ∪ csn ∅ ∧ ∅ ∈ v ∧ (w = ∅ → x = ∅) ∧ (∅ ∈ x → ∅ ∈ w) ∧ b11_cnd g2 g x v) $ by by_contra [da]
dc: $ G , ¬ ∅ ∈ x ⇒ ∃ o ∃ w ∃ v (functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ w = crn o ∧ w ⊆ x ∧ v = w ∪ csn ∅ ∧ ∅ ∈ v ∧ (w = ∅ → x = ∅) ∧ (∅ ∈ x → ∅ ∈ w) ∧ b11_cnd g2 g x v) $ by or_elim [e2, b4, db]
