d9: $ G , z ∊ iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q v , x ⊆ v ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q x , functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ w = crn o ∧ w ⊆ x ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q w ⇒ z ∊ iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q w $ by cab_intro [d8]
da: $ G , z ∊ iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q v , x ⊆ v ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q x , functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ w = crn o ∧ w ⊆ x ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q w ⇒ z ∊ cap y (iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q y) (crn o) $ by cap_intro [c3, d9]
db: $ … ⇒ crn o ⊆ v ∧ z ∊ cap y (iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q y) (crn o) $ by and_intro [d2, da]
dc: $ … ⇒ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ crn o ⊆ v ∧ z ∊ cap y (iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q y) (crn o) $ by and_intro [c2, db]
dd: $ … ⇒ functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ crn o ⊆ v ∧ z ∊ cap y (iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q y) (crn o) $ by and_intro [c1, dc]
de: $ … ⇒ ∃ f (functional f ∧ cdm f ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ crn f ⊆ v ∧ z ∊ cap y (iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q y) (crn f)) $ by ex_intro [dd]
x1: $ G , z ∊ iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q v , x ⊆ v ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q x , ∃ w (functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ w = crn o ∧ w ⊆ x ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q w) ⇒ ∃ w (functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ w = crn o ∧ w ⊆ x ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q w) $ by ax
x2: $ G , z ∊ iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q v , x ⊆ v ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q x , ∃ w (functional o ∧ cdm o ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ w = crn o ∧ w ⊆ x ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q w) ⇒ ∃ f (functional f ∧ cdm f ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ crn f ⊆ v ∧ z ∊ cap y (iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q y) (crn f)) $ by ex_elim [x1, de]
x3: $ G , z ∊ iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q v , x ⊆ v ∧ x ∊ u ∧ z ∊ iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q x ⇒ ∃ f (functional f ∧ cdm f ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ crn f ⊆ v ∧ z ∊ cap y (iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q y) (crn f)) $ by ex_elim [mn, x2]
x4: $ G , z ∊ iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q v ⇒ ∃ f (functional f ∧ cdm f ⊆ iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q ∧ crn f ⊆ v ∧ z ∊ cap y (iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q y) (crn f)) $ by ex_elim [a2, x3]
fin: $ G ⇒ cont y (iphi u (dnf u M) D W Z Q y) (iax u (dnf u M) D W Z Q) $ by cont_intro [x4]

lemma b7_pt3b (G: hyps) (B1 B2 B3 J A: class) (y: set): $ G ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ B1 × (B2 × B3) $ > $ G ⇒ A ∈ B2 $
----
a1: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) ⇒ c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) $ by ax
b1: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ $ by ax
b2: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
b3: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ = c $ by eq_sym [b2]
b4: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ x , v ⟩ $ by eq_trans [b3, b1]
b5: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ isset J $ by opair_eq_isset [b4]
b6: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ isset ⟨ A , y ⟩ $ by opair_isset
b7: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ isset x $ by isset_var
b8: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ isset v $ by isset_var
b9: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ J = x ∧ ⟨ A , y ⟩ = v $ by opair_inj_c [b4, b5, b6, b7, b8]
b10: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ ⟨ A , y ⟩ = v $ by and_elim_r [b9]
b11: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ v ∊ B2 × B3 $ by ax
d1: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ $ by ax
d2a: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ ⟨ A , y ⟩ = v $ by weaken [b10]
d2: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ ⟨ A , y ⟩ = ⟨ w , e ⟩ $ by eq_trans [d2a, d1]
d3: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ isset A $ by opair_eq_isset [d2]
d4: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ isset y $ by isset_var
d5: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ isset w $ by isset_var
d6: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ isset e $ by isset_var
d7: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ A = w ∧ y = e $ by opair_inj_c [d2, d3, d4, d5, d6]
d8: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ A = w $ by and_elim_l [d7]
d9: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ w ∊ B2 $ by ax
d10: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ w = A $ by eq_sym [d8]
d11: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 , v = ⟨ w , e ⟩ , w ∊ B2 , e ∊ B3 ⇒ A ∈ B2 $ by wcel_intro [d10, d9]
d12: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) , c = ⟨ x , v ⟩ , x ∊ B1 , v ∊ B2 × B3 ⇒ A ∈ B2 $ by cxp_elim [b11, d11]
d13: $ G , c = ⟨ J , ⟨ A , y ⟩ ⟩ , c ∊ B1 × (B2 × B3) ⇒ A ∈ B2 $ by cxp_elim [a1, d12]
d14: $ G ⇒ A ∈ B2 $ by wcel_elim [#1, d13]

lemma b7_scat_pre_c (G: hyps) (A Q: class) (x: set): $ G ⇒ scat x Q ∈ fseq A $ > $ G ⇒ Q ∈ fseq A $ > $ G ⇒ x ∊ fseq (crn x) $
----
a1: $ G , q = Q , q ∊ fseq A ⇒ q = Q $ by ax
a2: $ G , q = Q , q ∊ fseq A ⇒ Q = q $ by eq_sym [a1]
a3: $ G , q = Q , q ∊ fseq A ⇒ x = x $ by eq_refl
a4: $ G , q = Q , q ∊ fseq A ⇒ scat x Q = scat x q $ by scat_eq [a3, a2]
a5: $ G , q = Q , q ∊ fseq A ⇒ scat x Q ∈ fseq A $ by weaken [#1]
a6: $ G , q = Q , q ∊ fseq A ⇒ scat x q ∈ fseq A $ by wcel_eq_l [a4, a5]
a7: $ G , q = Q , q ∊ fseq A ⇒ q ∊ fseq A $ by ax
a8: $ G , q = Q , q ∊ fseq A ⇒ x ∊ fseq (crn x) $ by b7_scat_pre [a6, a7]
a9: $ G ⇒ x ∊ fseq (crn x) $ by wcel_elim [#2, a8]

lemma b7_ixv_universe (G: hyps) (Q: class) (u k: set): $ G ⇒ universe u $ > $ G ⇒ k ∊ u $ > $ G ⇒ ixv k Q ∈ u $
----
a1: $ G ⇒ crn k ∈ u $ by universe_crn [#1, #2]
a2: $ G ⇒ ⋃ (crn k) ∈ u $ by universe_cuni_c [#1, a1]
a3: $ G ⇒ ⋃ (⋃ (crn k)) ∈ u $ by universe_cuni_c [#1, a2]
b1: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q ⇒ y ∊ ixv k Q $ by ax
c1: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k $ by ax
c2: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k ⇒ isset ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ $ by opair_isset
d1: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⇒ r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ $ by ax
d2: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ = r $ by eq_sym [d1]
d3: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⇒ j = j $ by eq_refl
d4: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ j , r ⟩ $ by opair_eq [d3, d2]
d5: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k $ by ax
d6: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , r ⟩ ∈ k $ by wcel_eq_l [d4, d5]
d7: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⇒ r ∊ crn k $ by crn_intro [d6]
d8a: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⇒ isset (cpr (scat x Q) y) $ by cpr_isset
d8: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⇒ cpr (scat x Q) y ∈ ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ $ by cpr_intro_r_c [d8a]
d9: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⇒ cpr (scat x Q) y ∈ r $ by wcel_eq_r [d2, d8]
e1: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ , b = cpr (scat x Q) y ⇒ b = cpr (scat x Q) y $ by ax
e2: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ , b = cpr (scat x Q) y ⇒ cpr (scat x Q) y = b $ by eq_sym [e1]
e3: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ , b = cpr (scat x Q) y ⇒ cpr (scat x Q) y ∈ r $ by weaken [d9]
e4: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ , b = cpr (scat x Q) y ⇒ b ∈ r $ by wcel_eq_l [e2, e3]
e5: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ , b = cpr (scat x Q) y ⇒ b ∊ r $ by wcel_welc [e4]
e6: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ , b = cpr (scat x Q) y ⇒ r ∊ crn k $ by weaken [d7]
e7: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ , b = cpr (scat x Q) y ⇒ b ∊ ⋃ (crn k) $ by cuni_intro [e5, e6]
e8a: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ , b = cpr (scat x Q) y ⇒ y = y $ by eq_refl
e8b: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ , b = cpr (scat x Q) y ⇒ y = scat x Q ∨ y = y $ by or_intro_r [e8a]
e8: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ , b = cpr (scat x Q) y ⇒ y ∊ cpr (scat x Q) y $ by cpr_intro [e8b]
e9: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ , b = cpr (scat x Q) y ⇒ y ∊ b $ by welc_eq [e2, e8]
e10: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ , b = cpr (scat x Q) y ⇒ y ∊ ⋃ (⋃ (crn k)) $ by cuni_intro [e9, e7]
e11: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k , r = ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⇒ y ∊ ⋃ (⋃ (crn k)) $ by isset_elim [d8a, e10]
e12: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q , x ∊ fseq (crn x) , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k ⇒ y ∊ ⋃ (⋃ (crn k)) $ by isset_elim [c2, e11]
e13: $ G , y ∊ ixv k Q ⇒ y ∊ ⋃ (⋃ (crn k)) $ by ixv_elim [b1, e12]
e14: $ G ⇒ ixv k Q ⊆ ⋃ (⋃ (crn k)) $ by subset_intro [e13]
e15: $ G ⇒ ixv k Q ∈ u $ by universe_subset_c [#1, a3, e14]

lemma b7_ixv_gen {v: set} (G: hyps) (J M D W Z P T Q L: class) (u: set): $ G ⇒ icwf J D $ > $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ W ∈ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ Z ∈ u $ > $ G ⇒ Z ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ > $ G ⇒ iprt D P T $ > $ G ⇒ Q ∈ esat u (dnf u M) P W $ > $ G ⇒ isup (ifam u (dnf u M) D W) (csn (scons ∅ ∅)) ⊆ Z $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ v (v ⊆ L → v ∊ u → iphi0 u (dnf u M) D W Z Q v ⊆ L) $ > $ G ⇒ ixv (ifam u (dnf u M) D W) Q ⊆ L $
----
h1: $ G , k ⊆ (ifam u (dnf u M) D W) , k ∊ u , k ⊆ {o | ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (o = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ scat x2 Q , x3 ⟩ ⟩ → x2 ∊ fseq (crn x2) → x3 ∊ L)} , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k $ by ax
h1a: $ G , k ⊆ (ifam u (dnf u M) D W) , k ∊ u , k ⊆ {o | ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (o = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ scat x2 Q , x3 ⟩ ⟩ → x2 ∊ fseq (crn x2) → x3 ∊ L)} , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k ⇒ k ⊆ (ifam u (dnf u M) D W) $ by ax
h1b: $ G , k ⊆ (ifam u (dnf u M) D W) , k ∊ u , k ⊆ {o | ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (o = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ scat x2 Q , x3 ⟩ ⟩ → x2 ∊ fseq (crn x2) → x3 ∊ L)} , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (ifam u (dnf u M) D W) $ by wcel_subset [h1a, h1]
h2: $ G , k ⊆ (ifam u (dnf u M) D W) , k ∊ u , k ⊆ {o | ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (o = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ scat x2 Q , x3 ⟩ ⟩ → x2 ∊ fseq (crn x2) → x3 ∊ L)} , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k ⇒ (ifam u (dnf u M) D W) ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by ifam_sub
h3: $ G , k ⊆ (ifam u (dnf u M) D W) , k ∊ u , k ⊆ {o | ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (o = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ scat x2 Q , x3 ⟩ ⟩ → x2 ∊ fseq (crn x2) → x3 ∊ L)} , ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ k ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ scat x Q , y ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by wcel_subset [h2, h1b]
