e7: $ G ⇒ ω × {y | ∃ p ∃ t ∃ j ∃ c ∃ k ∃ f ∃ g ∃ x3 ∃ a ∃ d (iprt D p t ∧ ictk D j c k ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ x3 , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) k W (scat Q (ixs D W (isup Z (csn (scons ∅ ∅))))) ∧ y ∊ fv g d)} ⊆ csn ∅ ∪ ω × ⋃ (crn (⋃ (cdm (crn (⋃ (img (cgr x2 (etel u (dnf u M) x2 W (scat Q (ixs D W (isup Z (csn (scons ∅ ∅))))))) (ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr))))))) $ by subset_trans [e5, e6]
