s3: $ … ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) tk W (scat tp X) ⊆ b7_shp td ti (swin (scat tp X) (fv nvf ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) (fv nvf tm)) $ by b7_cwf_shape_c [#1, #2, s2, #3, s1, #4, #5]
w1: $ … ⇒ swin (scat tp X) ∅ (cdm tp) = tp $ by b16_swin [s1, #6]
w2: $ G ⇒ scat tp X = scat tp X $ by eq_refl
w3: $ G ⇒ fv nvf ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ = ∅ $ by nvf_nz
w4: $ … ⇒ fv nvf tm = cdm tp $ by eq_sym [#7]
w5: $ … ⇒ swin (scat tp X) (fv nvf ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) (fv nvf tm) = swin (scat tp X) ∅ (cdm tp) $ by swin_eq [w2, w3, w4]
w6: $ … ⇒ swin (scat tp X) (fv nvf ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) (fv nvf tm) = tp $ by eq_trans [w5, w1]
s4: $ … ⇒ b7_shp td ti (swin (scat tp X) (fv nvf ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) (fv nvf tm)) ⊆ b7_shp td ti tp $ by b7_shp_eq [w6]
s5: $ … ⇒ ⟨ tf , ⟨ tg , ⟨ tt , ta ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ b7_shp td ti (swin (scat tp X) (fv nvf ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) (fv nvf tm)) $ by wcel_subset [s3, #8]
s6: $ … ⇒ ⟨ tf , ⟨ tg , ⟨ tt , ta ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ b7_shp td ti tp $ by wcel_subset [s4, s5]
k1: $ G , o = ⟨ tf , ⟨ tg , ⟨ tt , ta ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ b7_shp td ti tp ⇒ o ∊ b7_shp td ti tp $ by ax
