s15: $ G , n = lv l W , n ∊ ω , ∃ m (m ∊ ω ∧ n = suc m) ⇒ universe (fv uni (lv l W)) ∧ ω ∈ fv uni (lv l W) $ by ex_elim [s14, s13]
