e10: $ … ⇒ k ∊ 𝒫 (cdm (⋃ (cpi x C B)) × ⋃ (⋃ (img (cgr z (⟦ x / z ⟧ A)) (cdm (⋃ (cpi x C B)))))) $ by ex_elim [b4, e9]
