a22: $ G , ra_nidx o i m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , e ∊ apn (fv x (fv nvf i)) q ⇒ e ∊ apn (fv x (fv nvf i)) q $ by ax
a23: $ … ⇒ e ∊ apn (fv X (fv nvf i)) q $ by welc_eq [a21, a22]
