a1: $ G , ra_nidx o i m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , g ∊ apn (fv y (fv nvf i)) q ⇒ ∀ i ∀ m ∀ q (ra_nidx D i m ∈ lrel → cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf t3) → q ∊ fseq b6_V → ∀ g (g ∊ apn (fv Y (fv nvf i)) q → ¬ g = ∅)) $ by weaken [#1]
