h10: $ G , v ∊ cpi x (dt u M a0 w (scat t6 X)) (dt u M b0 w (scons x (scat t6 X))) ⇒ ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 t4 z ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#12]
h11: $ G , v ∊ cpi x (dt u M a0 w (scat t6 X)) (dt u M b0 w (scons x (scat t6 X))) ⇒ z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr $ by weaken [#11]
