h13: $ G , v ∊ cpi x (dt u M a0 w (scat t6 X)) (dt u M b0 w (scons x (scat t6 X))) ⇒ cdm t6 = nadd (fv nvf t4) (fv nvf t3) $ by weaken [#8]
h14: $ … ⇒ ∃ n (n ∊ dt u M z w (scat t6 Y)) $ by b6_ipos_ne [h5, h6, h7, h8, h9, h10, h11, h12, h13, h4]
h15: $ G , n ∊ dt u M z w (scat t6 Y) ⇒ n ∊ dt u M z w (scat t6 Y) $ by ax
