e1: $ G , (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x6 (scons x7 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x5 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x7 ∈ lrel)) ∨ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ z = x6 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x6 x8 ∈ lrel)) ⇒ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x6 (scons x7 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x5 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x7 ∈ lrel)) ∨ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ z = x6 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x6 x8 ∈ lrel)) $ by ax
