lemma b14_ipos (G: hyps) (M N S: class) (u w X Y t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6: set): $ G ⇒ uadm u $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ X ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ Y ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ b6_cond t1 t3 X Y $ > $ G ⇒ b12_bnd t1 t3 X S $ > $ G ⇒ b12_ne t1 t3 Y $ > $ G ⇒ universe N $ > $ G ⇒ S ∈ N $ > $ G ⇒ ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ t5 ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr $ > $ G ⇒ t6 ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ cdm t6 = nadd (fv nvf t4) (fv nvf t3) $ > $ G ⇒ (dt u M t5 w (scat t6 Y) ⊆ csn ∅ → dt u M t5 w (scat t6 X) ⊆ csn ∅) ∧ (dt u M t5 w (scat t6 Y) ∈ N → dt u M t5 w (scat t6 X) ∈ N) $
----
q1: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b14_cip u M w X Y t1 t2 t3 N , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , c ∊ fseq u , cdm c = nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by ax
q2: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b14_cip u M w X Y t1 t2 t3 N , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , c ∊ fseq u , cdm c = nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
q3: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b14_cip u M w X Y t1 t2 t3 N , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , c ∊ fseq u , cdm c = nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
q4: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b14_cip u M w X Y t1 t2 t3 N , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , c ∊ fseq u , cdm c = nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) ⇒ crn j ⊆ b14_cip u M w X Y t1 t2 t3 N $ by ax
q5: $ … ⇒ z ∊ trees ω $ by trees_omega_intro [q1, q2, q3]
q6: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b14_cip u M w X Y t1 t2 t3 N , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , c ∊ fseq u , cdm c = nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) ⇒ ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel $ by ax
q7: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ b14_cip u M w X Y t1 t2 t3 N , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , c ∊ fseq u , cdm c = nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) ⇒ z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr $ by ax
