c1: $ G , v = W , v ∊ lvals , t4 = l ∧ t14 = m ∧ lveq ⟨ kc_lmax , scons l (scons m ∅) ⟩ l ⇒ t4 = l ∧ t14 = m ∧ lveq ⟨ kc_lmax , scons l (scons m ∅) ⟩ l $ by ax
