lemma b14_dom (G: hyps) (J M W H A: class) (u c0 t4 t13 t14: set): $ G ⇒ jval u M J $ > $ G ⇒ W ∈ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ H ∈ sat u M c0 W $ > $ G ⇒ ra_deq c0 t13 t13 ⟨ kc_srt , scons t14 ∅ ⟩ ∈ J $ > $ G ⇒ t14 ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ fv uni (lv t14 W) ⊆ fv uni (lv t4 W) $ > $ G ⇒ A = dt u M t13 W H $ > $ G ⇒ A ∈ fv uni (lv t4 W) $
----
d1: $ … ⇒ dt u M t13 W H = dt u M t13 W H ∧ dt u M t13 W H ∈ dt u M ⟨ kc_srt , scons t14 ∅ ⟩ W H $ by jval_elim [#1, #4, #2, #3]
d2: $ … ⇒ dt u M t13 W H ∈ dt u M ⟨ kc_srt , scons t14 ∅ ⟩ W H $ by and_elim_r [d1]
d3: $ G ⇒ sat u M c0 W ⊆ fseq u $ by sat_fseq
d4: $ … ⇒ H ∈ fseq u $ by wcel_subset [d3, #3]
d5: $ … ⇒ dt u M ⟨ kc_srt , scons t14 ∅ ⟩ W H = fv uni (lv t14 W) $ by dt_srt_c [#5, #2, d4]
d6: $ … ⇒ dt u M t13 W H ∈ fv uni (lv t14 W) $ by wcel_eq_r [d5, d2]
d7: $ … ⇒ dt u M t13 W H ∈ fv uni (lv t4 W) $ by wcel_subset [#6, d6]
d8: $ … ⇒ dt u M t13 W H = A $ by eq_sym [#7]
d9: $ … ⇒ A ∈ fv uni (lv t4 W) $ by wcel_eq_l [d8, d7]

lemma b14_path {b c g f t a: set} (G: hyps b c g f t a) (E W R0: class) (u t10 t11: set) (f0 g0 s0 a0: set g f t a): $ G ⇒ t10 ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ t11 ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ W ∈ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ R0 ∈ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f0 , ⟨ g0 , ⟨ s0 , a0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E ⟨ kc_pi , scons t10 (scons t11 ∅) ⟩ W R0 $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ b ∃ c (b ∊ da (fv E t10) W R0 ∧ b ∊ u ∧ c ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E t11 W (scons b R0))} ∧ c ∊ fseq u ∧ g0 = scons b c) $
----
p1: $ G , v = W , v ∊ lvals , r = R0 , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ t10 ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
p2: $ G , v = W , v ∊ lvals , r = R0 , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ t11 ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#2]
p3: $ G , v = W , v ∊ lvals , r = R0 , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ v ∊ lvals $ by ax
p4: $ G , v = W , v ∊ lvals , r = R0 , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ by ax
p5: $ … ⇒ etel u E ⟨ kc_pi , scons t10 (scons t11 ∅) ⟩ v r = {y | ∃ x ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ l (x ∊ da (fv E t10) v r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ i , ⟨ j , ⟨ k , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E t11 v (scons x r) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc i x , ⟨ scons x j , ⟨ scons (etel u E t10 v r) k , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by etel_pi [p1, p2, p3, p4]
p6: $ G , v = W , v ∊ lvals , r = R0 , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ v = W $ by ax
p7: $ G , v = W , v ∊ lvals , r = R0 , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ r = R0 $ by ax
p8: $ … ⇒ W = v $ by eq_sym [p6]
p9: $ … ⇒ R0 = r $ by eq_sym [p7]
p10: $ G , v = W , v ∊ lvals , r = R0 , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ ⟨ kc_pi , scons t10 (scons t11 ∅) ⟩ = ⟨ kc_pi , scons t10 (scons t11 ∅) ⟩ $ by eq_refl
p11: $ … ⇒ etel u E ⟨ kc_pi , scons t10 (scons t11 ∅) ⟩ W R0 = etel u E ⟨ kc_pi , scons t10 (scons t11 ∅) ⟩ v r $ by etel_eq [p10, p8, p9]
p12: $ G , v = W , v ∊ lvals , r = R0 , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ ⟨ f0 , ⟨ g0 , ⟨ s0 , a0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E ⟨ kc_pi , scons t10 (scons t11 ∅) ⟩ W R0 $ by weaken [#5]
p13: $ … ⇒ ⟨ f0 , ⟨ g0 , ⟨ s0 , a0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E ⟨ kc_pi , scons t10 (scons t11 ∅) ⟩ v r $ by wcel_eq_r [p11, p12]
p14: $ … ⇒ ⟨ f0 , ⟨ g0 , ⟨ s0 , a0 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ {y | ∃ x ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ l (x ∊ da (fv E t10) v r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ i , ⟨ j , ⟨ k , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E t11 v (scons x r) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc i x , ⟨ scons x j , ⟨ scons (etel u E t10 v r) k , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by wcel_eq_r [p5, p13]
