v1: $ G , o = D , w = W , p = P0 , h = R , i ∊ cdm t8 , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = i ⇒ ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm t8 → b ∊ trees ω → fv nvf b = i → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons D (scons b ∅) ⟩ W ∅ = fv t8 i) $ by weaken [#10]
