v3: $ … ⇒ i ∊ cdm t8 → b ∊ trees ω → fv nvf b = i → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons D (scons b ∅) ⟩ W ∅ = fv t8 i $ by all_elim [v2]
