v10: $ G , o = D , w = W , p = P0 , h = R , i ∊ cdm t8 , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = i ⇒ o = D $ by ax
v11: $ G , o = D , w = W , p = P0 , h = R , i ∊ cdm t8 , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = i ⇒ w = W $ by ax
v12: $ G , o = D , w = W , p = P0 , h = R , i ∊ cdm t8 , b ∊ trees ω , fv nvf b = i ⇒ scons b ∅ = scons b ∅ $ by eq_refl
v13: $ … ⇒ scons o (scons b ∅) = scons D (scons b ∅) $ by scons_eq [v10, v12]
