t10: $ … ⇒ t11 ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [t8]
p1: $ G , y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} , ⟨ f , ⟨ y , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ y , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R $ by ax
p2: $ G , y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} , ⟨ f , ⟨ y , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R ⇒ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons t10 (scons t11 ∅) ⟩ $ by weaken [#1]
p2a: $ G , y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} , ⟨ f , ⟨ y , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R ⇒ W = W $ by eq_refl
p2b: $ G , y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} , ⟨ f , ⟨ y , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R ⇒ R = R $ by eq_refl
p3: $ … ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z W R = etel u (dnf u M) (⟨ kc_pi , scons t10 (scons t11 ∅) ⟩) W R $ by etel_eq [p2, p2a, p2b]
p4: $ … ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ y , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) (⟨ kc_pi , scons t10 (scons t11 ∅) ⟩) W R $ by wcel_eq_r [p3, p1]
p5a: $ G , y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} , ⟨ f , ⟨ y , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R ⇒ t10 ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [t9]
p5b: $ G , y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} , ⟨ f , ⟨ y , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R ⇒ t11 ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [t10]
p5c: $ G , y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} , ⟨ f , ⟨ y , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R ⇒ W ∈ lvals $ by weaken [#3]
p5d: $ G , y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} , ⟨ f , ⟨ y , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R ⇒ R ∈ fseq u $ by weaken [#4]
p6: $ … ⇒ ∃ b ∃ c (b ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) t10) W R ∧ b ∊ u ∧ c ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t11 W (scons b R))} ∧ c ∊ fseq u ∧ y = scons b c) $ by b14_path [p5a, p5b, p5c, p5d, p4]
