d2: $ G , v ∊ u , y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} ⇒ ∀ y (y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} → ∃ b ∃ c (b ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) t10) W R ∧ b ∊ u ∧ c ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t11 W (scons b R))} ∧ c ∊ fseq u ∧ y = scons b c)) $ by weaken [d1]
d3: $ … ⇒ y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} → ∃ b ∃ c (b ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) t10) W R ∧ b ∊ u ∧ c ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t11 W (scons b R))} ∧ c ∊ fseq u ∧ y = scons b c) $ by all_elim [d2]
d4: $ G , v ∊ u , y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} ⇒ y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} $ by ax
d5: $ … ⇒ ∃ b ∃ c (b ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) t10) W R ∧ b ∊ u ∧ c ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t11 W (scons b R))} ∧ c ∊ fseq u ∧ y = scons b c) $ by imp_elim [d3, d4]
c1: $ G , v ∊ u , y ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) z W R)} , b ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) t10) W R ∧ b ∊ u ∧ c ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t11 W (scons b R))} ∧ c ∊ fseq u ∧ y = scons b c ⇒ b ∊ da (fv (dnf u M) t10) W R ∧ b ∊ u ∧ c ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t11 W (scons b R))} ∧ c ∊ fseq u ∧ y = scons b c $ by ax
