c2r: $ … ⇒ b ∊ u ∧ c ∊ {g | ∃ f ∃ t ∃ a (⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) t11 W (scons b R))} ∧ c ∊ fseq u ∧ y = scons b c $ by and_elim_r [c1]
