q59: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ x5 ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind $ by weaken [q12]
q60: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_ind_data x5 tb tP tT ∈ lrel $ by weaken [q18]
q61: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_clen tP tnp ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#4]
q62: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [q9]
q63: $ … ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf tnp) $ by b6_itc_len [q59, q60, q61, q48, q53, q58, q62]
q64: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q65: $ … ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf tnp) $ by ex_elim [q64, q63]
q66: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q67: $ … ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf tnp) $ by ex_elim [q66, q65]
q68: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q69: $ … ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf tnp) $ by ex_elim [q68, q67]
q70: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , ∃ a ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ a ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q71: $ … ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf tnp) $ by ex_elim [q70, q69]
q72: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , ∃ x4 ∃ a ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x4 ∃ a ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q73: $ … ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf tnp) $ by ex_elim [q72, q71]
q74: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ a ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ a ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q75: $ … ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf tnp) $ by ex_elim [q74, q73]
q76: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ a ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ a ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
q77: $ … ⇒ cdm ta = nadd (fv nvf tm) (fv nvf tnp) $ by ex_elim [q76, q75]
