q60: $ G , m = fv nvf ti , m ∊ ω , x3 ∊ ω , ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 (ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = x3 → x3 ∊ fv nvf x4) , x2 = suc x3 , ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel , ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel , fv nvf x6 = x2 ⇒ ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel $ by ax
q61: $ G , m = fv nvf ti , m ∊ ω , x3 ∊ ω , ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 (ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = x3 → x3 ∊ fv nvf x4) , x2 = suc x3 , ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel , ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel , fv nvf x6 = x2 ⇒ ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel $ by ax
q62: $ … ⇒ fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x4 $ by b15_rng_case [q60, q61, q59]
q63: $ G , m = fv nvf ti , m ∊ ω , x3 ∊ ω , ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 (ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = x3 → x3 ∊ fv nvf x4) , x2 = suc x3 , ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel , ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel , fv nvf x6 = x2 ⇒ fv nvf x6 = x2 $ by ax
q64: $ … ⇒ x2 ∈ fv nvf x4 $ by wcel_eq_l [q63, q62]
q65: $ … ⇒ x2 ∊ fv nvf x4 $ by wcel_welc [q64]
q66: $ … ⇒ fv nvf x6 = x2 → x2 ∊ fv nvf x4 $ by imp_intro [q65]
q67: $ … ⇒ ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = x2 → x2 ∊ fv nvf x4 $ by imp_intro [q66]
q68: $ … ⇒ ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = x2 → x2 ∊ fv nvf x4 $ by imp_intro [q67]
q69: $ … ⇒ ∀ x7 (ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = x2 → x2 ∊ fv nvf x4) $ by all_intro [q68]
q70: $ … ⇒ ∀ x6 ∀ x7 (ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = x2 → x2 ∊ fv nvf x4) $ by all_intro [q69]
q71: $ … ⇒ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 (ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = x2 → x2 ∊ fv nvf x4) $ by all_intro [q70]
q72: $ … ⇒ ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 (ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = x2 → x2 ∊ fv nvf x4) $ by all_intro [q71]
q73: $ G , m = fv nvf ti , m ∊ ω ⇒ m ∊ ω $ by ax
q74: $ … ⇒ ∀ x4 ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 (ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys x5 x4 x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = m → m ∊ fv nvf x4) $ by omega_ind_named [q29, q72, q73]
q75: $ … ⇒ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 (ra_nth_ty x5 x6 tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys x5 tn x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = m → m ∊ fv nvf tn) $ by all_elim [q74]
q76: $ … ⇒ ∀ x6 ∀ x7 (ra_nth_ty tT x6 tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys tT tn x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = m → m ∊ fv nvf tn) $ by all_elim [q75]
q77: $ … ⇒ ∀ x7 (ra_nth_ty tT ti tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys tT tn x7 ∈ lrel → fv nvf ti = m → m ∊ fv nvf tn) $ by all_elim [q76]
q78: $ … ⇒ ra_nth_ty tT ti tf te ∈ lrel → ra_ntys tT tn tm0 ∈ lrel → fv nvf ti = m → m ∊ fv nvf tn $ by all_elim [q77]
q79: $ G , m = fv nvf ti , m ∊ ω ⇒ ra_nth_ty tT ti tf te ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#1]
q80: $ … ⇒ ra_ntys tT tn tm0 ∈ lrel → fv nvf ti = m → m ∊ fv nvf tn $ by imp_elim [q78, q79]
q81: $ G , m = fv nvf ti , m ∊ ω ⇒ ra_ntys tT tn tm0 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#2]
q82: $ … ⇒ fv nvf ti = m → m ∊ fv nvf tn $ by imp_elim [q80, q81]
q83: $ G , m = fv nvf ti , m ∊ ω ⇒ m = fv nvf ti $ by ax
q84: $ … ⇒ fv nvf ti = m $ by eq_sym [q83]
q85: $ … ⇒ m ∊ fv nvf tn $ by imp_elim [q82, q84]
q86: $ … ⇒ m ∈ fv nvf tn $ by welc_wcel [q85]
q87: $ … ⇒ fv nvf ti ∈ fv nvf tn $ by wcel_eq_l [q83, q86]
q88: $ … ⇒ fv nvf ti ∈ fv nvf tn $ by wcel_elim [q2, q87]

lemma b15_tys_head {kk ll: set} (G: hyps kk ll) (J: class) (dd nv np lv iv cx bb ff y1 y2 y3: set): $ G ⇒ ra_tys_wf dd nv np lv iv cx bb ∈ lrel3 J $ > $ G ⇒ bb = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons y1 (scons y2 (scons y3 ∅)) ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ ff = y1 $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ kk ∃ ll (ra_isort ff kk ll ∈ lrel ∧ lveq ll lv) $
----
n0: $ G , dd = u ∧ nv = v ∧ np = w ∧ lv = y ∧ iv = r ∧ cx = x0 ∧ bb = ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ dd = u ∧ nv = v ∧ np = w ∧ lv = y ∧ iv = r ∧ cx = x0 ∧ bb = ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩ $ by ax
