lemma b15_ixs_in (G: hyps) (D W Z Y: class) (u j: set): $ G ⇒ universe u $ > $ G ⇒ Z ∈ u $ > $ G ⇒ Z ⊆ ω × (fseq u × u) $ > $ G ⇒ Y ∈ fv (ixs D W Z) j $ > $ G ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ Y ∈ ient D W Z j $
----
a0: $ G ⇒ Y ∈ ⋃ (ap (ixs D W Z) j) $ by weaken [#4]
b1: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v ⇒ v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j $ by ax
b2: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v ⇒ ⟨ j , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z $ by cab_elim [b1]
c1: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ c ∊ ixs D W Z $ by ax
c2: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ ∃ k (k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩) $ by cab_elim [c1]
d1: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ $ by ax
d2: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ k ∊ intys D $ by and_elim_l [d1]
d3: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [d1]
d4a: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ $ by ax
d4b: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , v ⟩ = c $ by eq_sym [d4a]
d4: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , v ⟩ = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ $ by eq_trans [d4b, d3]
d5a: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ universe u $ by weaken [#1]
d5b: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ Z ∈ u $ by weaken [#2]
d5c: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ Z ⊆ ω × (fseq u × u) $ by weaken [#3]
d5d: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ ient D W Z k ∈ u $ by b7_ient_universe [d5a, d5b, d5c]
d5: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ isset (ient D W Z k) $ by wcel_isset [d5d]
d6a: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ isset j $ by isset_var
d6b: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ isset v $ by isset_var
d6c: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ isset k $ by isset_var
d6: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ j = k ∧ v = ient D W Z k $ by opair_inj_c [d4, d6a, d6b, d6c, d5]
d7: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ j = k $ by and_elim_l [d6]
d8: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ v = ient D W Z k $ by and_elim_r [d6]
d9a: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ k = j $ by eq_sym [d7]
d9: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ intys D $ by welc_eq_set [d9a, d2]
d10a: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ Y ∈ v $ by ax
d10b: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ Y ∈ ient D W Z k $ by wcel_eq_r [d8, d10a]
d10c: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ D = D $ by eq_refl
d10d: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ W = W $ by eq_refl
d10e: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ Z = Z $ by eq_refl
d10f: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ ient D W Z k = ient D W Z j $ by ient_eq [d10c, d10d, d10e, d9a]
d10: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ Y ∈ ient D W Z j $ by wcel_eq_r [d10f, d10b]
d11: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , k ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ k , ient D W Z k ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ Y ∈ ient D W Z j $ by and_intro [d9, d10]
d12: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v , c = ⟨ j , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ Y ∈ ient D W Z j $ by ex_elim [c2, d11]
d13: $ G , v ∊ ap (ixs D W Z) j , Y ∈ v ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ Y ∈ ient D W Z j $ by wcel_elim [b2, d12]
d14: $ G ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ Y ∈ ient D W Z j $ by wcel_cuni_elim [a0, d13]

lemma b15_np (G: hyps) (J D W K: class) (tb tP tT tn tnp tl tG2: set): $ G ⇒ D ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind $ > $ G ⇒ W ∈ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ ra_ind_data D tb tP tT ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_tys_wf D tn tnp tl ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ tG2 tT ∈ lrel3 J $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ lv tl W = ∅ $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ iprop D K W $
----
q1: $ … ⇒ isset D $ by wcel_isset [#1]
q2: $ … ⇒ isset W $ by wcel_isset [#2]
q3: $ G ⇒ iprt D tP tT $ by ex_intro [#3]
q4: $ G , x5 = D ⇒ x5 = D $ by ax
q5: $ … ⇒ D = x5 $ by eq_sym [q4]
q6: $ G , x5 = D , w = W ⇒ w = W $ by ax
q7: $ … ⇒ W = w $ by eq_sym [q6]
q8: $ G , x5 = D , w = W ⇒ W ∈ lvals $ by weaken [#2]
q9: $ … ⇒ w ∈ lvals $ by wcel_eq_l [q7, q8]
q10: $ … ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by wcel_welc [q9]
q11: $ G , x5 = D , w = W ⇒ isset ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
q12: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ $ by ax
q13: $ … ⇒ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [q12]
q14: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ tn = tn $ by eq_refl
q15: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ tnp = tnp $ by eq_refl
q16: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ tl = tl $ by eq_refl
q17: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ tG2 = tG2 $ by eq_refl
q18: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ tT = tT $ by eq_refl
q19: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ D = x5 $ by weaken [q5]
q20: $ … ⇒ ra_tys_wf D tn tnp tl ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ tG2 tT = ra_tys_wf x5 tn tnp tl z tG2 tT $ by ra_tys_wf_eq [q19, q14, q15, q16, q13, q17, q18]
q21: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ ra_tys_wf D tn tnp tl ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ tG2 tT ∈ lrel3 J $ by weaken [#4]
q22: $ … ⇒ ra_tys_wf x5 tn tnp tl z tG2 tT ∈ lrel3 J $ by wcel_eq_l [q20, q21]
q23: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel ⇒ iprt D p t $ by ax
q24: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel ⇒ iprt D tP tT $ by weaken [q3]
q25: $ … ⇒ p = tP ∧ t = tT $ by iprt_det [q23, q24]
q26: $ … ⇒ p = tP $ by and_elim_l [q25]
q27: $ … ⇒ t = tT $ by and_elim_r [q25]
q28: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel ⇒ n = n $ by eq_refl
q29: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel ⇒ f = f $ by eq_refl
q30: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel ⇒ c = c $ by eq_refl
q31: $ … ⇒ ra_nth_ty t n f c = ra_nth_ty tT n f c $ by ra_nth_ty_eq [q27, q28, q29, q30]
q32: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel $ by ax
q33: $ … ⇒ ra_nth_ty tT n f c ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q31, q32]
q34: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_tys_wf x5 tn tnp tl z tG2 tT ∈ lrel3 J $ by weaken [q22]
q35: $ … ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 (ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl) $ by b15_tys_lv [q34, q33]
q36: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel , ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl ⇒ ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl $ by ax
q37: $ … ⇒ ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_l [q36]
q38: $ … ⇒ lveq x2 tl $ by and_elim_r [q36]
q39: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel , ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl ⇒ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel $ by ax
q40: $ … ⇒ k = x1 ∧ l = x2 $ by lrel_isort_det [q39, q37]
q41: $ … ⇒ k = x1 $ by and_elim_l [q40]
q42: $ … ⇒ l = x2 $ by and_elim_r [q40]
q43: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel , ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl ⇒ ∀ x3 (x3 ∊ lvals → lv x2 x3 = lv tl x3) $ by weaken [q38]
q44: $ … ⇒ w ∊ lvals → lv x2 w = lv tl w $ by all_elim [q43]
q45: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel , ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [q10]
q46: $ … ⇒ lv x2 w = lv tl w $ by imp_elim [q44, q45]
q47: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel , ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl ⇒ W = w $ by weaken [q7]
q48: $ … ⇒ lv l W = lv x2 w $ by lv_eq [q42, q47]
q49: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel , ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl ⇒ tl = tl $ by eq_refl
q50: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel , ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl ⇒ w = W $ by ax
q51: $ … ⇒ lv tl w = lv tl W $ by lv_eq [q49, q50]
q52: $ … ⇒ lv tl W = lv tl w $ by eq_sym [q51]
q53: $ … ⇒ lv tl w = lv x2 w $ by eq_sym [q46]
q54: $ … ⇒ lv x2 w = lv l W $ by eq_sym [q48]
q55: $ … ⇒ lv tl W = lv x2 w $ by eq_trans [q52, q53]
q56: $ … ⇒ lv tl W = lv l W $ by eq_trans [q55, q54]
q57: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel , ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl ⇒ lv l W = ∅ $ by ax
q58: $ … ⇒ lv tl W = ∅ $ by eq_trans [q56, q57]
q59: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel , ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl ⇒ ¬ lv tl W = ∅ $ by weaken [#5]
q60: $ … ⇒ ⊥ $ by not_elim [q59, q58]
q61: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ , iprt D p t , fv nvf n = K , ra_nth_ty t n f c ∈ lrel , ∃ x2 (ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl) ⇒ ∃ x2 (ra_isort f x1 x2 ∈ lrel ∧ lveq x2 tl) $ by ax
q62: $ … ⇒ ⊥ $ by ex_elim [q61, q60]
q63: $ … ⇒ ⊥ $ by ex_elim [q35, q62]
q64: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W , ityf D K f , ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel , lv l W = ∅ ⇒ ityf D K f $ by ax
q65: $ … ⇒ ⊥ $ by ityf_elim [q64, q63]
q66: $ G , x5 = D , w = W , z = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ , iprop D K W ⇒ iprop D K W $ by ax
q67: $ … ⇒ ⊥ $ by iprop_elim [q66, q65]
q68: $ … ⇒ ¬ iprop D K W $ by not_intro [q67]
q69: $ … ⇒ ¬ iprop D K W $ by isset_elim [q11, q68]
q70: $ G , x5 = D ⇒ isset W $ by weaken [q2]
q71: $ … ⇒ ¬ iprop D K W $ by isset_elim [q70, q69]
q72: $ … ⇒ ¬ iprop D K W $ by isset_elim [q1, q71]

lemma b15_idx (G: hyps) (D: class) (tb tP tT tn tm0 to tm: set): $ G ⇒ D ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind $ > $ G ⇒ ra_ind_data D tb tP tT ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_ntys tT tn tm0 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_nidx D to tm ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ fv nvf to ∈ intys D $
----
q1: $ … ⇒ isset D $ by wcel_isset [#1]
q2: $ … ⇒ intys D = fv nvf tn $ by b15_intys [#2, #3]
q3: $ G , x5 = D ⇒ x5 = D $ by ax
q4: $ … ⇒ D = x5 $ by eq_sym [q3]
q5: $ G , x5 = D ⇒ tb = tb $ by eq_refl
q6: $ G , x5 = D ⇒ tP = tP $ by eq_refl
q7: $ G , x5 = D ⇒ tT = tT $ by eq_refl
q8: $ … ⇒ ra_ind_data D tb tP tT = ra_ind_data x5 tb tP tT $ by ra_ind_data_eq [q4, q5, q6, q7]
q9: $ G , x5 = D ⇒ ra_ind_data D tb tP tT ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#2]
q10: $ … ⇒ ra_ind_data x5 tb tP tT ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q8, q9]
q11: $ G , x5 = D ⇒ to = to $ by eq_refl
q12: $ G , x5 = D ⇒ tm = tm $ by eq_refl
q13: $ … ⇒ ra_nidx D to tm = ra_nidx x5 to tm $ by ra_nidx_eq [q4, q11, q12]
q14: $ G , x5 = D ⇒ ra_nidx D to tm ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#4]
q15: $ … ⇒ ra_nidx x5 to tm ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q13, q14]
q16: $ … ⇒ ∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ a ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_nidx_cases [q15]
q17: $ G , x5 = D , x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel $ by ax
q18: $ … ⇒ x5 = x0 $ by and_elim_l [q17]
q19: $ … ⇒ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [q17]
q20: $ … ⇒ to = x4 $ by and_elim_l [q19]
q21: $ … ⇒ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [q19]
q22: $ … ⇒ tm = a $ by and_elim_l [q21]
q23: $ … ⇒ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [q21]
q24: $ … ⇒ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_l [q23]
q25: $ … ⇒ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [q23]
q26: $ … ⇒ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_l [q25]
q27: $ … ⇒ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [q25]
q28: $ … ⇒ x0 = x5 $ by eq_sym [q18]
q29: $ G , x5 = D , x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ x1 = x1 $ by eq_refl
q30: $ G , x5 = D , x5 = x0 ∧ to = x4 ∧ tm = a ∧ ra_ind_data x0 x1 x2 x3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x4 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_isort x6 a x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ x2 = x2 $ by eq_refl
