q5: $ G , ra_nidx D o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , g ∊ apn (fv (scat tv R) (fv nvf o)) q ⇒ ra_tys_wf D tn tnp tl ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ tG2 tT ∈ lrel3 J $ by weaken [#5]
q6: $ G , ra_nidx D o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , g ∊ apn (fv (scat tv R) (fv nvf o)) q ⇒ ¬ lv tl W = ∅ $ by weaken [#6]
q7: $ G , ra_nidx D o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , g ∊ apn (fv (scat tv R) (fv nvf o)) q ⇒ S ∈ u $ by weaken [#7]
q8: $ G , ra_nidx D o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , g ∊ apn (fv (scat tv R) (fv nvf o)) q ⇒ tv ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#8]
q9: $ G , ra_nidx D o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , g ∊ apn (fv (scat tv R) (fv nvf o)) q ⇒ cdm tv = intys D $ by weaken [#9]
q10: $ G , ra_nidx D o m ∈ lrel , cdm q = nadd (fv nvf m) (fv nvf tnp) , q ∊ fseq b6_V , g ∊ apn (fv (scat tv R) (fv nvf o)) q ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ intys D → fv tv i = ityv u (dnf u (mcv H)) D i W) $ by weaken [#10]
