w2: $ G , z = ⟨ i0 , ⟨ scat m0 Q , y0 ⟩ ⟩ , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S) , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q W , ictk D j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k W (scat p (ixs D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S))) , a ∊ fseq u , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ D ∈ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ind $ by iwf_sort [w1]
w3: $ G , z = ⟨ i0 , ⟨ scat m0 Q , y0 ⟩ ⟩ , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S) , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q W , ictk D j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k W (scat p (ixs D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S))) , a ∊ fseq u , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ iprt D P T $ by weaken [#2]
w4: $ G , z = ⟨ i0 , ⟨ scat m0 Q , y0 ⟩ ⟩ , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S) , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q W , ictk D j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k W (scat p (ixs D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S))) , a ∊ fseq u , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ iprt D q e $ by ax
w5: $ G , z = ⟨ i0 , ⟨ scat m0 Q , y0 ⟩ ⟩ , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S) , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q W , ictk D j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k W (scat p (ixs D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S))) , a ∊ fseq u , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ q = P $ by b12_prt [w2, w3, w4]
w6: $ G , z = ⟨ i0 , ⟨ scat m0 Q , y0 ⟩ ⟩ , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S) , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q W , ictk D j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k W (scat p (ixs D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S))) , a ∊ fseq u , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ W = W $ by eq_refl
w7: $ G , z = ⟨ i0 , ⟨ scat m0 Q , y0 ⟩ ⟩ , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S) , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q W , ictk D j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k W (scat p (ixs D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S))) , a ∊ fseq u , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q W = esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) P W $ by esat_eq [w5, w6]
w8: $ G , z = ⟨ i0 , ⟨ scat m0 Q , y0 ⟩ ⟩ , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S) , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q W , ictk D j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k W (scat p (ixs D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S))) , a ∊ fseq u , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q W $ by ax
w9: $ G , z = ⟨ i0 , ⟨ scat m0 Q , y0 ⟩ ⟩ , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S) , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q W , ictk D j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k W (scat p (ixs D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S))) , a ∊ fseq u , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) P W $ by welc_eq [w7, w8]
