y2: $ G , z = ⟨ i0 , ⟨ scat m0 Q , y0 ⟩ ⟩ , z ∊ iop0 u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S) , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) q W , ictk D j c k , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) k W (scat p (ixs D W (isup (ijs u (dnf u (mcv H)) D W) S))) , a ∊ fseq u , z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
