f1: $ G ⇒ ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ y ∃ r ∃ x0 (dd = u ∧ nv = v ∧ np = w ∧ lv = y ∧ iv = r ∧ cx = x0 ∧ bb = ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩) ∨ ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ y ∃ z ∃ r ∃ o ∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ p ∃ c (dd = u ∧ nv = v ∧ np = w ∧ lv = y ∧ iv = r ∧ cx = x0 ∧ bb = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons p (scons c ∅)) ⟩ ∧ ra_isort x1 o z ∈ lrel ∧ lveq z y ∧ ra_ctors_wf u v w y r x0 p ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_tys_wf u v w y ⟨ kc_s , scons r ∅ ⟩ x0 c ∈ lrel3 J) $ by lrel3_tys_wf_cases [#1]
