f12e: $ G , q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w , e ∊ apn (ity u (dnf u (mcv H)) d kk w) q ⇒ ityf d kk f $ by weaken [#4]
f12f: $ G , q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w , e ∊ apn (ity u (dnf u (mcv H)) d kk w) q ⇒ q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w $ by ax
f12g: $ G , q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w , e ∊ apn (ity u (dnf u (mcv H)) d kk w) q ⇒ e ∊ apn (ity u (dnf u (mcv H)) d kk w) q $ by ax
f12: $ G , q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w , e ∊ apn (ity u (dnf u (mcv H)) d kk w) q ⇒ e ∊ {y | ∃ x ∃ z (∃ v (⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) f w q) ∧ y = nest x z)} $ by b3_ity_pts [f12a, f12b, f12c, f12d, f12e, f12f, f12g]
f13: $ G , q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w ⇒ apn (ity u (dnf u (mcv H)) d kk w) q ⊆ {y | ∃ x ∃ z (∃ v (⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) f w q) ∧ y = nest x z)} $ by subset_intro [f12]
h1: $ G , q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w , ⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) f w q ⇒ ra_isort f k l ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#5]
h2: $ G , q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w , ⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) f w q ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [g4]
h3: $ G , q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w , ⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) f w q ⇒ q ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [f3]
h4: $ G , q ∊ esat u (dnf u (mcv H)) b w , ⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) f w q ⇒ ⟨ x , v ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u (mcv H)) f w q $ by ax
